i.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/06d1a34bd301a259676daf14857e43292dc28fdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:20:41Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:20:41Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(18): a question about how an action''s figure was reached is grounded on that action\n\nWalking /m on csjones: \"How did you work out the £3,700 pension figure?\"\nwent ungrounded (the plan grounding needed a tax classification and words\nlike \"my plan\"), no tool ran, and Fyn invented a top-up for children the\nuser does not have. ActionCardService::forFigureQuestion finds the open\naction whose title carries the quoted amount; the card grounding carries\nthe item''s working. A question repeated after a failed turn now reaches\nthe model once (it said \"I answered that a moment ago\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"9de9cd5561e4664fed87c72a14da841d172cd2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/9de9cd5561e4664fed87c72a14da841d172cd2fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/06d1a34bd301a259676daf14857