_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/1d9bf05fb4fb07b094d7a110010cf53584f4044b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:52:04Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:52:04Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(18): the pension relief item carries its working; Fyn gives it, never its own sums\n\n\"Talk me through my tax plan\" got \"£60,000 − £50,270 = £9,730 taxed at\n40%\" where the plan''s £3,700 starts from income after the pension paid\nthrough pay (£54,000). PensionTaxReliefStrategy now publishes the steps\nbehind its figure on every path, from the figures the sizing used; they\nreach Fyn through the composed plan and the actions list. One prompt rule\nin FynSystemPrompt: give an action''s working exactly, never redo the sums.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"743e147d30c083d42a1f5eeec344e80976e764fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/743e147d30c083d42a1f5eeec344e80976e764fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/1d9bf05fb4fb07b094d7a110010cf53584f4044b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18