s://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/a9d3a55dc42980b45ba3b4756d675e0fb439954b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:00:59Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:00:59Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(15): bond and GIA cards reach holders and those with allowances used; three savings how-tos drafted\n\nCSJ 2026-10-08: \"if a person has entered a gia or bond account, these cards\nneed to show, if a person has not, then they only show if they have used\ntheir allowances up\". A holder with ISA room sees both cards; every card\nstill needs cash above the user''s own emergency fund target.\n\n- The pension card covered every case the bond and General Investment\n  Account cards fired on, so neither ever reached a user. The pension card\n  now needs the ISA allowance used, relief room left and age under 75\n  (FA 2004 s188(3)(a), s190), as its definition says.\n- The relief-room rule has one home, AnnualAllowanceChecker::reliefRoomThisYear,\n  read by the Retirement plan and the savings cards (Rule 20).\n- The excess-cash cards read the user''s own emergency target\n  (EmergencyFundCalculator: 3 months retired, 9 self-employed), not a typed 6.\n- Drafts for offset_mortgage_better, excess_cash_bond, excess_cash_gia with\n  sources (HMRC BIM45695, IPTM2005, HS320/HS321, FCA MCOB 12.3.1R and\n  7.5.3R(4)(d), gov.uk, ITA 2007 s13A, TCGA 1992 s1K, FSCS); new\n  {dividend_allowance}, {cgt_allowance}, has_bond and {bond} placeholders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"476bbb4347a394486b0a7b0e4f081a1e6364dfb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/476bbb4347a394486b0a7b0e4f081a1e6364dfb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/a9d3a55dc42980b45ba3b4756d675e0fb439954b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/a9d3a55dc42980b45ba3b4756d675e0fb439954b","node_id":"C_kwDOQnps9NoAKGE5ZDNhNTVkYzQyOTgwYjQ1YmEzYjQ3NTZkNjc1ZTBmYjQzOTk1NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/735099f8c423c1cac32a472e860d902ca10c72b9","sha":"735099f8c423c1cac32a472e860d902ca10c72b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/735099f8c423c1cac32a472e860d902ca10c72b9"}],"sha":"a9d3a55dc42980b45ba3b4756d675e0fb439954b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/a9d3a55dc42980b45ba3b4756d675e0fb439954b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.