://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/09e289c612337ef1f3d45db346d820ed8f18dc53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:57:31Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:57:31Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(12): an investment account with no holdings asks for them on the dashboard card, never \"0 holdings\"\n\nice-cube #973: an ISA added through Fyn has a value and no holdings, and the\ncard read \"0 holdings\" beside it. It now reads the approved no_holdings\naction''s title, \"Add the funds you hold\". One card, both dashboards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"a77f937cc0a0a26bcd3b76ab6b27eebc04cf554c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/a77f937cc0a0a26bcd3b76ab6b27eebc04cf554c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/09e289c612337ef1f3d45db346d820ed8f18dc53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}",