:"fix(11): what the partner does is read from their account only while they share it\n\nThe status prefill read the linked partner''s employment status through\nliveSpouse(), skipping the sharing permission every other read of their account\ngoes through (W-0530). It now reads financiallySharedSpouse(), as their income\ndoes. Found by the commit security review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"947bdba022e453b08e7494f9179b06801d9c317a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/947bdba022e453b08e7494f9179b06801d9c317a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/53ab5e56ec84afde1dd6c85417a7a28e9e9e7294","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/53ab5e56ec84afde1dd6c85417a7a28e9e9e7294","node_id":"C_kwDOQnps9NoAKDUzYWI1ZTU2ZWM4NGFmZGUxZGQ2Yzg1NDE3YTdhMjhlOWU5ZTcyOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"http