ats\n\nWalk on csjones (brett-a, married, partner with no account): the card said\n\"If you died today, £105,200 would be due\", but what passes to a wife is\nfree of the tax (IHTA 1984 s18). W-0467''s approved sentences (CSJ\n2026-08-23) now have one home on EstateIhtExposureDetector, read by the\nteaser and the card: \"Based on your own records alone, ...\" plus the\npartner note, for a married user not linked or not sharing.\n\nThe card is also a surface printing the engine''s current figure, so it\ncarries the current column''s caveats in the engine''s words\n(unmodelled_relief_caveat W-0466, pension_exclusion_caveat W-0534);\nEveryIhtFigureCarriesItsCaveatsTest now covers it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"fb071c9a5d204717df6d7b08925c81d620eea731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/fb071c9a5d204717df6d7b08925c81d620eea731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/ecff5ac36482b6cd7300725e22628dca3ecf2b31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu