.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/c40e9c22982c5c2a20d70f63e0aa1e17886e4782/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:25:28Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:25:28Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(9): pension line names its beneficiary; /m re-reads the user after a director action\n\n- Fyn''s pension sentence (the user''s own line in the chat) now says\n  \"to go to <name> if I die\", so the beneficiary the form saved is seen.\n- /m: \"Something else\" parks the onboarding step server-side with no\n  event; runFynAction never re-read the user, so the screen kept its\n  onboarding nudge and hid Edit details until a reload. Every director\n  action now re-reads the user once its stream ends.\n\nWalked locally at 390 on /m (john: pension card -> Edit details -> new\nbeneficiary field saved, card cleared; LPA link -> Fyn LPA form saved,\ncard names only health and welfare; sarah: Something else -> Edit\ndetails without a reload) and at 1440 on web (Mitchell plan page\ntoggles: charity 78,931, larger gifts 72,400, both 137,575).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"0340b22af5b9c4ad47afe8bd2ccd5267838d6833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/0340b22af5b9c4ad47afe8bd2ccd5267838d6833"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/c40e9c22982c5c2a20d70f63e0aa1e17886e4782","v