":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/8e7fcba719e65a5ec28a0775ca91764dc4755389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:02:16Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:02:16Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(9): CI green — store reads, unique test helpers, no glyph, CLT wording\n\n- EstateDataReadinessService reads property and savings through their\n  stores (existsForUser covers joint ownership), per the store boundary.\n- EstateCardsTest helpers renamed; gift() collided with\n  FailedGiftTaperReliefTest and stopped the Feature job.\n- MaritalStatusLiterals baseline: the deleted EstateController line removed.\n- GiftForm: the tick glyph off the edited line (Rule 15); a Chargeable\n  Lifetime Transfer is taxed now only above the nil rate band (IHTA 1984\n  s7(2), HMRC IHTM14512), not \"immediately at 20%\".\n- AccountCard.test.js reads max_drift, the field the server sends\n  (AccountRebalancingController), not the old drift_score.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"e7b72d965c0e7f929d5b8015afedc59095514bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/e7b72d965c0e7f929d5b8015afedc59095514bc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/8e7fcba719e65a5ec28a0775ca9