l":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/342d94237e1f389611a465ca4442deb6eece6b5a","node_id":"C_kwDOQnps9NoAKDM0MmQ5NDIzN2UxZjM4OTYxMWE0NjVjYTQ0NDJkZWI2ZWVjZTZiNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/3341880a5fe776acbef304d077f47efb0b02a57b","sha":"3341880a5fe776acbef304d077f47efb0b02a57b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/3341880a5fe776acbef304d077f47efb0b02a57b"}],"sha":"342d94237e1f389611a465ca4442deb6eece6b5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/342d94237e1f389611a465ca4442deb6eece6b5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/3341880a5fe776acbef304d077f47efb0b02a57b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:39:46Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:39:46Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(8b): protection needs in one config block, sourced, with correct maths\n\nEvery figure that sizes a protection need now lives under\nprotection.needs_calculation (TaxConfigService::getProtectionNeeds), each\nwith its source, editable in admin (Tax Settings > Module Config >\nProtection needs calculations). CSJ 2026-10-06, D1-D7:\n\n- Life cover income part: the household''s living costs (recorded spending\n  plus a home''s running costs, without mortgage, loan, pension, saving and\n  premium payments) less income that continues, paid until State Pension\n  age, as a lump sum at the Personal Injury Discount Rate (0.5%). Was the\n  user''s net income less the partner''s whole income, divided by 4.7% (a\n  perpetuity). No spending recorded: left out and said so.\n- Final expenses: SunLife cost of dying, £9,797 (was £7,500).\n- No separate education figure (charged £9,000 for every year to 21).\n- Income protection: Legal & General''s 60% of the first £60,000, 50% above\n  (was a flat 60%).\n- Critical illness: 3 x gross earned income kept, shown to the user as a\n  rule of thumb on the cover row, card and plan.\n- One engine: the plan strategy reads these needs (was its own 3x and 70%\n  of net); the plan page and print view print the server''s working (the\n  page said ''70% of your net monthly income'' beside 60% of gross).\n- Seeder and test factory share one method; no code fallbacks remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"1295e97fafdfeac9b8a341074d70ba267d1d4e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/1295e97fafdfeac9b8a341074d70ba267d1d4e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/3341880a5fe776acbef304d077f47efb0b02a57b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committe