"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/d2b6bf5da3bf7baca1b57c3eedeb8c3e42557b9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:16:57Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:16:57Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(8a): no made-up premiums anywhere; retiree dashboard line\n\nEvery monthly or annual premium the app estimated came from typed-in rates\nwith no source (Rule 23; CSJ 2026-10-06 \"we do not make up monthly\npremiums\"). Removed:\n- Protection plan strategy (estimated_monthly_cost, totals, affordability %)\n  and its card cost/figures/decision trace; RecommendationEngine\n  estimated_cost; ScenarioBuilder premium increase.\n- Estate life policy page: the premium table, joint discount, self-insurance\n  built on the premium, cost-benefit comparison, 60/40 advice and named\n  insurers. The page states the cover (the liability) and that the premium\n  comes from insurers'' quotes. Estate plan premium and its annual cost.\n- Dead code carrying invented figures: LifeCoverCalculator scenarios (no\n  caller), LifeCoverRecommendations.vue (no producer), Protection\n  WhatIfScenarios.vue / ScenarioBuilder.vue (£45.50 hard-coded, mounted\n  nowhere), RecommendationCard.vue (mounted nowhere).\n- Frontend premium sums and rows in the what-if, holistic and print views.\n- premium_factors, insurance_premium_estimates and premium affordability\n  config from TaxConfigurationSeeder.\n\nDashboard: each focus card carries its line from the server\n(NextActionsService AREA_INFO); a retiree drawing their pension\n(RetirementDrawdownPosition::isDrawing) is no longer told to close an\nincome gap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"2106d833401dfb1c63fa93e1ce0da32d8b932250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/2106d833401dfb1c63fa93e1ce0da32d8b932250"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/d2b6bf5da3bf7baca1b57c3eedeb8c3e42557b9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/d2b6bf5da3bf7baca1b57c3eedeb8c3e42557b9f","node_id":"C_kwDOQnps9NoAKGQyYjZiZjVkYTNiZjdiYWNhMWI1N2MzZWVkZWI4YzNlNDI1NTdiOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"h