"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/13f1b51e1056947ae6e5d45575ca4800b58fc4f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:37:56Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:37:56Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(8a): enhanced annuity card reaches a retiree with no retirement profile\n\nThe card reads the user''s own answers and their pensions, never a target,\nbut was skipped whenever there was no retirement profile, which is how a\nretiree set up through Fyn arrives. Shorter card description so it no\nlonger repeats the approved why line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"35d06f1e486ae475a92469ad8e413d5da9efbc39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/35d06f1e486ae475a92469ad8e413d5da9efbc39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/commits/13f1b51e1056947ae6e5d45575ca4800b58fc4f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/13f1b51e1056947ae6e5d45575ca4800b58fc4f5","node_id":"C_kwDOQnps9NoAKDEzZjFiNTFlMTA1Njk0N2FlNmU1ZDQ1NTc1Y2E0ODAwYjU4ZmM0ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynla/commit/a7cefcf3b26a80a44ca94949cfe1941ffc107264","sha":"a7cefcf3b26a80a44ca94949cfe1941ffc107264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/a7cefcf3b26a80a44ca94949cfe1941ffc107264"}],"sha":"13f1b51e1056947ae6e5d45575ca4800b58fc4f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/13f1b51e1056947ae6e5d45575ca4800b58fc4f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/commits/a7cefcf3b26a80a44ca94949cfe1941ffc107264/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:18:02Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:18:02Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(8a): one home for smoking and health, on the user\n\nSmoking and health had two homes. Users answer on users.smoking_status /\nhealth_status (web Health, /m Personal Information, old onboarding), but\nthe enhanced annuity card, protection premiums and the protection plan\nread protection_profiles.smoker_status / health_status, which no surface\nwrites: every production profile held its defaults, so the card never\nfired and premiums never saw a smoker.\n\n- users pair is the one home; every reader goes through\n  ProfileEnums::isSmoker / hasHealthHistory (sources in the docblocks).\n- Migration: both users columns nullable with no default (null = not\n  answered); real users still on both defaults reset (CSJ 2026-10-06);\n  protection_profiles pair dropped.\n- Fyn''s personal details form asks both (web/m Health form wording).\n- Enhanced annuity: no invented 20%/15% uplift or 5% income in the card\n  trace or the annuity/drawdown comparison (Rule 23).\n- Readiness links for smoking/health go to Settings > Health.\n- Preview persona copy used smoker_status (no such users column).\n- Bond how-tos bond_position, bond_paid_in_missing approved (CSJ).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017aFqBc7vwyPJ6BoL6dtJKX","tree":{"sha":"90d9da30bc3ae77f59ef3c2f1f057d21095f0acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynla/git/trees/9