"name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:54:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(api): add distinct tool endpoints — ADR-0007 contract formalization\n\nEach of the 6 blogengine tools now has its own HTTP endpoint:\n  POST /api/v2/draft           — draft_post\n  POST /api/v2/posts/edit      — edit_post      (threadId required)\n  POST /api/v2/posts/publish   — publish_post   (threadId required)\n  POST /api/v2/notion/sync     — notion_sync\n  POST /api/v2/podcast/notes   — podcast_notes\n  POST /api/v2/content/strategy — content_strategy\n\nAll delegate to chatService.chat() internally (same LangGraph graph).\nGET /api/tools manifest updated — no tool points to POST /api/v2/chat anymore.\nserver.ts mounts tool-endpoints router at /api/v2 with chatLimiter + requireAuth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38269177013d10c951528c1778f7139a42c77896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/38269177013d10c951528c1778f7139a42c77896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/2591c10376a2e7351835c5575ad87b748c9e5bda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/2591c10376a2e7351835c5575ad87b748c9e5bda","node_id":"C_kwDOQnrcCNoAKDI1OTFjMTAzNzZhMmU3MzUxODM1YzU1NzVhZDg3Yjc0OGM5ZTViZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29","sha":"9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29"}],"sha":"2591c10376a2e7351835c5575ad87b748c9e5bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/2591c10376a2e7351835c5575ad87b748c9e5bda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T23:16:11Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T23:25:29Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: add Frame OS integration section to CLAUDE.md\n\nDocuments BlogEngine as a Module Federation remote in Frame OS:\n- MF surface area (Dashboard + Settings exposed)\n- Shared singletons config with ''as any'' cast explanation\n- Local MF dev workflow (vite build + preview, not vite dev)\n- Shell Redux singleton usage; settings state in shell settingsSlice (ADR-0011)\n- Production deployment: blog.jim.software (Vercel, branch protection)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd6ee284237797aef9062f43133bef6879a51799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/cd6ee284237797aef9062f43133bef6879a51799"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29","node_id":"C_kwDOQnrcCNoAKDk4OTE4NjBkNTgzZWVjMjgxZTc4MzI4ODk5YjE0MmI5NWJhZWVhMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea","sha":"1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea"}],"sha":"9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/9891860d583eec281e78328899b142b95baeea29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:49:23Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:49:23Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(mf): add @carbon/react to shared singletons + Cache-Control headers\n\nAdds @carbon/react singleton to MF shared config — without it BlogEngine\nloads a duplicate Carbon instance, breaking CSS class resolution in shell.\nAdds no-store on remoteEntry.js and immutable on other assets for safe\nVercel CDN caching across deployments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aff6ba52aeb57fd2bf2021298bbf9debaceb5983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/aff6ba52aeb57fd2bf2021298bbf9debaceb5983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea","node_id":"C_kwDOQnrcCNoAKDFiM2JhNDhmZWIwMmNhYjJlZmIyMzQxNGRmMGJiNTcxNDgwYzlmZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/bbf94106e6a3f0a8a9e246550265f24133f9ec92","sha":"bbf94106e6a3f0a8a9e246550265f24133f9ec92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/bbf94106e6a3f0a8a9e246550265f24133f9ec92"}],"sha":"1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/1b3ba48feb02cab2efb23414df0bb571480c9fea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/bbf94106e6a3f0a8a9e246550265f24133f9ec92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:32:13Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T22:32:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(settings): migrate SettingsPanel to shell Redux, keep localStorage for API keys (#25)\n\n* feat(blogengine): add vercel.json for demo deployment\n\nConfigures Vercel build from pnpm workspace root. Adds CORS headers on\n/assets/* to allow shell MF host at frame.jim.software to load remoteEntry.js.\nSee ADR-0013.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(blogengine): Vercel GitHub Actions — initial deploy workflow\n\nStep outputs pattern for vercel_env/prod flags; preview URL comment on PRs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(blogengine): grant pull-requests:write for PR comment step\n\n* ci: remove pnpm version pin — read from packageManager in package.json\n\n* ci: disable IBM telemetry in CI and local dev\n\n* ci: add contents:read permission — required for checkout in private repos\n\n* fix: set packageManager pnpm@9.15.4 — required by pnpm/action-setup@v4\n\n* fix(vercel): build agent-core before browser-app — resolves TS module not found\n\n* feat(settings): migrate SettingsPanel to shell Redux, keep localStorage for API keys\n\nTwo-store architecture:\n- Shell Redux (shared MF singleton): apiBaseUrl, notionApiUrl, defaultAuthor,\n  autoPublish, autoSave, seoSuggestions — persisted by shell''s localStorage adapter\n- Browser localStorage: anthropicApiKey, openaiApiKey, notionApiKey — sensitive\n  credentials never go into Redux, explicit Save API Keys button\n\nReplaces SettingsForm/loadSettings/saveSettings localStorage-only approach.\nDispatches via action type string to avoid circular MF shell dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(settings): add live connection status to SettingsPanel\n\nProbes /health endpoint with 4s timeout on mount and on URL change.\nShows Carbon Tag (green/red), InlineLoading during check, and a\nRenew icon button for manual re-check — all inline in the shell modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"adf98ee84eb89125c400e6f8d91c807d7f44727d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/adf98ee84eb89125c400e6f8d91c807d7f44727d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/bbf94106e6a3f0a8a9e246550265f24133f9ec92","verification":{"payload":"tree adf98ee84eb89125c400e6f8d91c807d7f44727d\nparent c54bfe258a4cbf9088eb99de105b6966d1012bb4\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1772577133 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772577133 -0600\n\nfeat(settings): migrate SettingsPanel to shell Redux, keep localStorage for API keys (#25)\n\n* feat(blogengine): add vercel.json for demo deployment\n\nConfigures Vercel build from pnpm workspace root. Adds CORS headers on\n/assets/* to allow shell MF host at frame.jim.software to load remoteEntry.js.\nSee ADR-0013.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(blogengine): Vercel GitHub Actions — initial deploy workflow\n\nStep outputs pattern for vercel_env/prod flags; preview URL comment on PRs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(blogengine): grant pull-requests:write for PR comment step\n\n* ci: remove pnpm version pin — read from packageManager in package.json\n\n* ci: disable IBM telemetry in CI and local dev\n\n* ci: add contents:read permission — required for checkout in private repos\n\n* fix: set packageManager pnpm@9.15.4 — required by pnpm/action-setup@v4\n\n* fix(vercel): build agent-core before browser-app — resolves TS module not found\n\n* feat(settings): migrate SettingsPanel to shell Redux, keep localStorage for API keys\n\nTwo-store architecture:\n- Shell Redux (shared MF singleton): apiBaseUrl, notionApiUrl, defaultAuthor,\n  autoPublish, autoSave, seoSuggestions — persisted by shell''s localStorage adapter\n- Browser localStorage: anthropicApiKey, openaiApiKey, notionApiKey — sensitive\n  credentials never go into Redux, explicit Save API Keys button\n\nReplaces SettingsForm/loadSettings/saveSettings localStorage-only approach.\nDispatches via action type string to avoid circular MF shell dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(settings): add live connection status to SettingsPanel\n\nProbes /health endpoint with 4s timeout on mount and on URL change.\nShows Carbon Tag (green/red), InlineLoading during check, and a\nRenew icon button for manual re-check — all inline in the shell modal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-autho