fix(api): safe BaseMessage.content extraction in chat-service.ts\n  non-streaming path; replaces unsafe `as string` cast with\n  extractContent() helper that handles string | MessageContent[]\n- fix(api): add ⚠️ SECURITY deployment guard comment to auth.ts (TD-009)\n\nArchitecture / quality:\n- fix(agent-graph): document routing fragility in respond_to_podcast\n  catch-all handler; Phase C tracking note added\n- fix(api): document graph singleton lazy-init assumption\n- fix(agent-core,api): move pino-pretty to devDependencies (dev transport)\n- fix(agent-core): document dotenv path depth assumption\n\nTECHDEBT:\n- TD-009 and TD-011 now explicitly marked as Phase C merge blockers\n- TD-017 added: /api/posts cross-user thread title leak (blocks Phase C)\n\nAll 16 tests pass. Type-check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c53c3793c5bdc48e6a52c8c6e7fe97b107195b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/4c53c3793c5bdc48e6a52c8c6e7fe97b107195b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/3d0e31659e7a9ebb41541cb5530febfd832b3077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}"