sers.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: address PR review issues #1-#16\n\n- fix(api): add requireAuth to /api/posts route (issue #1)\n- fix(agent-core): correct env.json path from 3 to 2 levels up (issue #2)\n- fix(browser-app): disable PodcastResponder preview buttons with TODO (issue #3)\n- fix(browser-app): replace window.confirm with Carbon danger Modal in WorkingMemoryDashboard (issue #4)\n- fix(browser-app): add InlineNotification for localStorage errors in WorkingMemoryDashboard (issue #10/#11)\n- fix(browser-app): fix key={i} → key={tag} for tag list in WorkingMemoryDashboard (issue #9)\n- fix(agent-graph): ToneCheckerNode JSON parse failure now defaults to fail not pass (issue #5)\n- fix(agent-graph): export TONE_RETRY_CAP inline at declaration site (issue #8)\n- fix(api): ThreadService.addMessage uses immutable spread instead of mutation (issue #7)\n- fix(agent-graph): remove fragile BlogEngineState.spec internal API access in test (issue #13)\n- feat(agent-graph): add vitest run script to package.json\n- chore: add TECHDEBT entries TD-012 to TD-016 for deferred issues\n\nAll 16 tests pass. Type-check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ced8b91eda70728bb95617383fb30607115fe990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/ced8b91eda70728bb95617383fb30607115fe990"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/6a5e32d3ac35546940cfa35486ba049807d72ee7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/6a5e32d3ac35546940cfa35486ba049807d72ee7","node_id":"C_kwDOQnrcCNoAKDZhNWUzMmQzYWMzNTU0Njk0MGNmYTM1NDg2YmEwNDk4MDdkNzJlZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/675c514693e21e8e8c2c0742385da50823492d0a","sha":"675c514693e21e8e8c2c0742385da50823492d0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/675c514693e21e8e8c2c0742385da50823492d0a"}],"sha":"6a5e32d3ac35546940cfa35486ba049807d72ee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/6a5e32d3ac35546940cfa35486ba049807d72ee7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/675c514693e21e8e8c2c0742385da50823492d0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T02:48:04Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T04:46:15Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(phase-b): implement BlogEngine agent graph, JWT auth, and file-backed storage\n\nPhase A\n- Fix API port 3001 → 3006 (ADR-001) to align with frame-agent BlogEngineDomainAgent\n- Add GET /api/posts endpoint consumed by frame-agent\n- Configure Module Federation remote in browser-app (exposes ./Dashboard at port 3005)\n\nPhase B — agent-graph\n- Implement all 9 LangGraph nodes with real ChatAnthropic calls:\n  OrchestratorNode, MediaIngestionNode, ConversationContextNode,\n  ArticleGeneratorNode, PodcastResponderNode, ToneCheckerNode (ADR-002),\n  EditorNode, SEOOptimizerNode, RagRetrievalNode (Phase D stub)\n- BlogEngineState with messagesReducer + nodeOrderReducer accumulators\n- SQLite checkpointer (WAL mode, :memory: for tests)\n- Full graph wiring with conditional routing via nextAction\n- 16 passing tests (7 tone-checker + 9 graph integration, all mocked)\n\nPhase B — API\n- Wire chat-service.ts to real graph.stream() / graph.invoke() (replaces mock)\n- Replace in-memory ThreadService with .data/threads.json file-backed store\n- JWT requireAuth middleware on all /api/v2/* routes (mockAuth bypass for dev)\n- POST /api/v2/auth/token endpoint to issue JWTs\n\nConfig / docs\n- Add jwtSecret + mockAuth to env.json.example and agent-core config schema\n- Add jsonwebtoken ^9.0.2 to workspace catalog\n- Update CLAUDE.md: stale mock-AI note, agent-graph description, auth docs\n- TECHDEBT.md: resolve TD-001/002/004/006; open TD-009/010/011 for Phase C\n- ADR-001: BlogEngine API port assignment (3006)\n- ADR-002: ToneCheckerNode retry cap (hard cap at 2)\n\nCo-Authored-