,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commits/70613ee6c523b220a00d7b4d059cd42f1d7de0b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-15T02:00:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T04:46:15Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(browser-app): add podcast responder flow and working memory features\n\nThis commit introduces two major features and a terminology update:\n\n1. **Podcast Responder**: Collaborative content generation flow\n   - New PodcastResponder component with 3-step workflow (media input → chat → preview)\n   - Integrated as tile in Generate tab dashboard\n   - Supports podcast/media ingestion with metadata (URL, author, notes)\n   - Mock collaborative AI responses with \"yes, and...\" conversational tone\n   - Compact UI optimized for dashboard panel view\n\n2. **Working Memory Tab**: Reference materials management\n   - New WorkingMemoryDashboard component with full CRUD interface\n   - localStorage persistence for reference materials\n   - Support for multiple content types: podcast, transcript, document, annotation, conversation, link\n   - Rich metadata: URL, author, tags, dates\n   - Color-coded type tags and empty states\n\n3. **Product Library**: Terminology update (was Content Library)\n   - Renamed ContentLibrary → ProductLibrary\n   - Updated framing to focus on published products across platforms\n   - Updated tab label and documentation strings\n\nNavigation changes:\n- Added WORKING_MEMORY tab between GENERATE and NOTION\n- Updated tab order documentation with rationale\n- Product-oriented language throughout\n\nRelated to issue #11 (Podcast Responder feature)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff52dfa2c573494bb1e2c650adef548752546e89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/trees/ff52dfa2c573494bb1e2c650adef548752546e89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/BlogEngine/git/commits/70613ee6c523b220a00d7b4d059cd42f1d7de0b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/70613ee6c523b220a00d7b4d059cd42f1d7de0b2","node_id":"C_kwDOQnrcCNoAKDcwNjEzZWU2YzUyM2IyMjBhMDBkN2I0ZDA1OWNkNDJmMWQ3ZGUwYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/BlogEngine/commit/49af0ad92dbadb5858129c7b7db127debb1b91ae","sha":"49af0ad92dbadb58581