151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/9e8c69b1be717a327a33d782c18b563a88fe3fa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T22:34:44Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:37:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"chore(gitignore): add domain-knowledge, personal-knowledge, decisions, .claude entries\n\nAligns with cv-builder and blogengine. These directories are symlinked from\ncore (canonical source of truth) and must not be committed per-repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de3cb0c71e6bf664d7e2c832cfd23fba6eabe612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/de3cb0c71e6bf664d7e2c832cfd23fba6eabe612"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/9e8c69b1be717a327a33d782c18b563a88fe3fa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/9e8c69b1be717a327a33d782c18b563a88fe3fa1","node_id":"C_kwDOQnzlENoAKDllOGM2OWIxYmU3MTdhMzI3YTMzZDc4MmMxOGI1NjNhODhmZTNmYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01","sha":"685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01"}],"sha":"9e8c69b1be717a327a33d782c18b563a88fe3fa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/9e8c69b1be717a327a33d782c18b563a88fe3fa1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T22:14:42Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:37:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shell): Module Federation integration + Carbon shell-mode layout polish\n\n## What changed\n\n### Module Federation setup (vite.config.ts, package.json)\n- Add `vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js` so CSS is bundled into the MF remote chunk\n  instead of a separate .css file that the shell host never loads.\n- `jsAssetsFilterFunction` scopes injection to `__federation_expose_Dashboard` only.\n- Exposes `./Dashboard` and `./Settings` via Vite Module Federation remote config.\n- Shared: react, react-dom, @reduxjs/toolkit, react-redux (singletons from host).\n\n### Dashboard.tsx — shellMode prop + Redux Provider isolation\n- `shellMode?: boolean` prop: activates shell-mode CSS class chain.\n- Redux `<Provider store={store}>` wraps DashboardContent. When the shell loads\n  this as a Module Federation remote it mounts it under the shell''s own Redux store\n  (which has no TripPlanner slices). The inner Provider ensures DashboardContent\n  always resolves selectors against the correct local store — harmless double-wrap.\n\n### Dashboard.css — shell-mode layout chain\n- `.dashboard-wrapper.shell-mode { margin-top: 4.5rem }`: visual rhythm — top gap\n  matches 72px (4.5rem) horizontal margins.\n- `.dashboard-wrapper.shell-mode .cds--tabs { flex-direction: column }`:\n  Carbon''s own rule for `cds--tabs--contained` is absent when @carbon/react shared\n  chunk is replaced by the host singleton. Redeclared here for self-sufficiency.\n- `.cds--tab-panels { flex: 1; min-height: 0 }` + `.cds--tab-content { height: 100% }`:\n  fills remaining vertical space in the shell flex column.\n- Contained tab stretching rules declared here for same reason.\n\n### ThreadSidebar.css — positioning\n- `top: calc(48px + 0.5rem)` — minimal clearance from shell header bottom.\n  Independent of dashboard margin-top.\n- `height: calc(100vh - 48px - 1rem)` — accounts for top offset.\n\n### CondensedChat.css — with-sidebar alignment\n- `.condensed-chat.with-sidebar { right: calc(var(--sidebar-width) + 2rem) }` —\n  the `+ 2rem` matches the dashboard margin-right formula (`calc(320px + 2rem)`)\n  so the chat widget''s right edge stays flush with the dashboard right edge.\n  Previously used `+ 1rem` which was off by 16px.\n\n### threadsSlice.ts — defensive type guard\n- `fetchThreads.fulfilled`: wraps `action.payload` in `Array.isArray()` guard\n  before assigning to `state.threads`. Prevents \"threads.map is not a function\"\n  if the API returns an unexpected shape (e.g. error object) before the network\n  layer surfaces a rejection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb4d4f594442266bfdbbed2f7b4e803a6a730fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/fb4d4f594442266bfdbbed2f7b4e803a6a730fc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01","node_id":"C_kwDOQnzlENoAKDY4NWM4OWUyYjVlYTYyZmZlOTQyOGNlZmE3ODExNGE4NzVhZmJiMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/c55cfd9419116592ebe10f609a54cc43eafd14ce","sha":"c55cfd9419116592ebe10f609a54cc43eafd14ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/c55cfd9419116592ebe10f609a54cc43eafd14ce"}],"sha":"685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/685c89e2b5ea62ffe9428cefa78114a875afbb01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/3c00db4929e74a0e90dccdcd20fadb478331e255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T02:37:37Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:18:28Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix: address PR #11 code quality and SSE race condition\n\n- Fix SSE race condition: buffer events in ProgressEmitter and replay\n  them on stream subscribe so late-connecting clients never miss events\n- Add 10-minute TTL cleanup for processEmitters to guard against hangs\n- Replace `any` types with typed interfaces throughout progress-emitter\n  and SSE event handlers in integrations route\n- Add aiInsight?: string to ItineraryItem type (was used in TimelineView\n  but missing from the type definition)\n- Remove unused TimelineItem interface and unused activeItem variable\n- Wrap Carbon TabPanels in a div to apply height/overflow styles\n  (TabPanels does not accept a style prop)\n- Change IconButton kind from ''danger'' to ''secondary'' for reject action\n  (IconButton does not support the danger kind)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95a45af4b70acd38bdbb316461d95aa8a8601b6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/95a45af4b70acd38bdbb316461d95aa8a8601b6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/3c00db4929e74a0e90dccdcd20fadb478331e255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://