:{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T01:52:36Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:18:28Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"chore(tripplanner): extend gitignore for core-managed symlinks\n\nAdd missing entries to the core-managed block:\n  decisions/       ← symlink to core/decisions\n  personal-knowledge/  ← symlink to core/personal-knowledge\n  .claude/settings.json  ← local Claude project config\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6682546b36c670c067a53a4a3fb78aac4d3eb0c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/6682546b36c670c067a53a4a3fb78aac4d3eb0c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/8fb19943f297efd16d3a03dfe4924e25205a63a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/8fb19943f297efd16d3a03dfe4924e25205a63a9","node_id":"C_kwDOQnzlENoAKDhmYjE5OTQzZjI5N2VmZDE2ZDNhMDNkZmU0OTI0ZTI1MjA1YTYzYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/d4323e5639fdde1b8e72f9975c5be2f914b2ee86","sha":"d4323e5639fdde1b8e72f9975c5be2f914b2ee86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/d4323e5639fdde1b8e72f9975c5be2f914b2ee86"}],"sha":"8fb19943f297efd16d3a03dfe4924e25205a63a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/8fb19943f297efd16d3a03dfe4924e25205a63a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commits/d4323e5639fdde1b8e72f9975c5be2f914b2ee86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T01:42:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T23:18:28Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(tripplanner): Module Federation setup + MF remote stability fixes\n\nModule Federation\n- Add @originjs/vite-plugin-federation ^1.3.6 to devDependencies\n- Configure vite.config.ts: name=tripplanner, exposes ./Dashboard,\n  shared singletons (react, react-dom, @reduxjs/toolkit, react-redux),\n  esnext build target, CORS enabled on preview server\n\nRedux Provider isolation\n- Wrap Dashboard in <Provider store={store}> (same pattern as cv-builder\n  and blogengine) so MF remote is self-contained; host store is not polluted\n\nArray.isArray guards for MF remote API calls\n- When running as a shell MF remote, relative /api/* calls route to the\n  shell''s Vite dev server (origin localhost:4000) which returns the SPA\n  index.html (200 OK) instead of JSON. Axios fulfills with HTML string.\n- threadsSlice.fetchThreads.fulfilled: state.threads = Array.isArray ? payload : []\n- documentsSlice.fetchDocuments.fulfilled: same guard\n- Prevents \"X.map is not a function\" crashes on initial render\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3792d394021528d467f4e3aaca28b51557a35f01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/3792d394021528d467f4e3aaca28b51557a35f01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/d4323e5639fdde1b8e72f9975c5be2f914b2ee86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub