cuments\n\n- Add polling every 5 seconds to refetch documents if none are loaded\n- Ensures Itineraries tab shows data even if import happened on different tab\n- Helps handle race conditions between import completion and tab navigation\n- Cleans up interval on component unmount\n\nThis fixes the issue where extracted itinerary data doesn''t appear in\nthe Itineraries tab after importing a ChatGPT conversation from My Trips tab.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6813f15b92289c09cabdfe2b779c560f353532c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/a6813f15b92289c09cabdfe2b779c560f353532c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/38c79de5184a65c8bb2f1ec13a05ff59df2a47ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/TripPlanner/commit/38c79de5184a65c8bb2f1ec13a05ff59df2a47ba","node_id":"C_kwDOQnzlENoAKDM4Yzc5ZGU1MTg0YTY