ults as they stream from backend\n- Auto-scroll to bottom to always show latest progress\n- Highlight latest message with increased opacity and bold font\n- Add custom scrollbar styling for better UX\n- Show extraction details like destinations, dates, themes, travelers\n- Messages fade in smoothly with animation\n- Maximum 400px height with overflow scrolling for long imports\n\nBackend already streams detailed extraction information including:\n- Destinations extracted (e.g., \"England, London, Bath, Cambridge\")\n- Date range detection\n- Key topics/themes identified\n- Number of travelers\n- Activity and accommodation counts\n- Reservation and flight detection\n- Itinerary item counts\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aa41acbc135accb197e7b94675d9132023b6ba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/trees/3aa41acbc135accb197e7b94675d9132023b6ba0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/TripPlanner/git/commits/3a74d349818229cebc276cfda0cf0f41726f94f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi