 `mf-duringtrip` and `mf-itinerary` to include improved shared dependencies and settings for Zephyr integration.\n- Enhanced type definitions in `Activity` to support flexible location formats.\n- Refactored `ActivityCard` to format location display based on new type definitions.\n- Improved `TripMembersAvatars` component by creating a reusable `MemberAvatar` component for better code organization and avatar handling.\n- Added error handling and auto-generation of invite links in `InviteLinkModal`.\n- Enhanced logging in the itinerary controller for better debugging and tracking of itinerary creation processes.","tree":{"sha":"17829fc2679d9e19ec5410660a7a95d46ba4fe49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lgt-champs/travel-app/git/trees/17829fc2679d9e19ec5410660a7a95d46ba4fe49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lgt-champs/travel-app/git/commits/5023db2db40d464f621ddde3520de8df3d401c0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14298038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thomasnguyen","id":14298038,"login":"thomasnguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Mjk4MDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomasnguyen","user_view_type":"public"},