b146a1a9b84226237a3f18e65b32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:57:01Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:57:01Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"message":"CLAUDE.md: document WAL checkpoint before backing up the prod DB\n\nCopying ghost.db alone silently drops writes still in ghost.db-wal; checkpoint\nvia bun:sqlite first (the prod image has no sqlite3 CLI), or fetch the -wal\nand -shm files alongside.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"331377d9890b52e7dad9c3508439bf50cbcb2df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/331377d9890b52e7dad9c3508439bf50cbcb2df2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/de8c60c1eae5b146a1a9b84226237a3f18e65b32","verification":{"payload":"tree 331377d9890b52e7dad9c3508439bf50cbcb2df2\nparent d1e8b4b81109bae6ed51d1d6a37f081b08ccddae\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1788433021 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1788433021 -0400\n\nCLAUDE.md: document WAL checkpoint before backing up the prod DB\n\nCopying ghost.db alone silently drops writes still in ghost.db-wal; checkpoint\nvia bun:sqlite first (the prod image has no sqlite3 CLI), or fetch the -wal\nand -shm files alongside.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQi++hh8caZOpaP3suMH6araKp5xAUCaplSfQAKCRCMH6araKp5\nxLLRAQDKfnrk78od+CmZsO818T/8VXbE5LSMAPOrZ9Z58/aCFQD/SA9Qy1CMsh1w\nWbnc6O4hTwewWBomt2iGAmXtQXlMbg0=\n=AsiS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T10:57:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76548291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/