"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commits/18c329210c86d59eb55e5a8cf3dcebfbfe369928/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T11:08:29Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T11:08:29Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"message":"Argent engine: dividends are spendable cash, not forced reinvestment\n\nPort of argent 2e101d9. The withdrawal solver now counts dividend\ndistributions as cash income, so bridge-year share sales (and the\nrealized gains + LTCG/state tax they trigger) shrink by the dividend\namount; unspent dividends recycle into the taxable bucket as new basis.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae07ff624e1a615fae56ac1ab3c4448355ef4eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/ae07ff624e1a615fae56ac1ab3c4448355ef4eb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/18c329210c86d59eb55e5a8cf3dcebfbfe369928","verification":{"payload":"tree ae07ff624e1a615fae56ac1ab3c4448355ef4eb5\nparent 2b18241aa4ff110313197495e42f2d419e64d3ae\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786360109 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786360109 -0400\n\nArgent engine: dividends are spendable cash, not forced reinvestment\n\nPort of argent 2e101d9. The withdrawal solver now counts dividend\ndistributions as cash income, so bridge-year share sales (and the\nrealized gains + LTCG/state tax they trigger) shrink by the dividend\namount; unspent dividends recycle into the taxable bucket as new basis.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP