8:49Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"message":"Address review: hoist shared style constants, fix drift and shadowing\n\n- New src/lib/argent/styles.ts centralizes the Tailwind class strings the\n  four retirement pages were each re-declaring; unifies the button padding\n  drift (px-3.5 vs px-3) and documents the input vs inputOnCard split\n  (page-background fields for controls sitting on surface cards/tables).\n- Rename the label wrapper constant to `field`, removing the shadowing by\n  {#each ... as [value, label]} loops in expenses/accounts.\n- Comment the chart''s use of --color-border-hover as its axis stroke\n  (no dedicated axis token exists yet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BeEhetRECDEDxZFFFV4U34","tree":{"sha":"267dc843f7c7a6e97f033eb37aa3c78573c2c9c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/267dc843f7c7a6e97f033eb37aa3c78573c2c9c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/2361009490fce7e4bfc7c4908e60e1f8aa3250df","verification":{"payload":"tree 267dc843f7c7a6e97f033eb37aa3c78573c2c9c4\nparent 59809358b42cd3d38a82c42ea9ee46dfa8903b9f\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786202929 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786202929 -0400\n\nAddress review: hoist shared style constants, fix drift and shadowing\n\n- New src/lib/argent/styles.ts centralizes the Tailwind class strings the\n  four retirement pages were each re-declaring; unifies the button padding\n  drift (px-3.5 vs px-3) and documents the input vs inputOnCard split\n  (page-background fields for controls sitting on surface cards/tables).\n- Rename the label wrapper constant to `field`, removing the shadowing by\n  {#each ... as [value, label]} loops in expenses/accounts.\n- Comment the chart''s use of --color-border-hover as its axis stroke\n  (no dedicated axis token exists yet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply