r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76548291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vhari-Maven","id":76548291,"login":"Vhari-Maven","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTQ4Mjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commits/59809358b42cd3d38a82c42ea9ee46dfa8903b9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T13:10:16Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T13:10:16Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"message":"Restyle /retirement to ghost''s design language (closes #11)\n\n- Add status (--color-success/error) and categorical data-viz tokens\n  (--color-viz-1..5) to app.css and DESIGN.md. The viz set is cyan-led to\n  match the brand accent and validated colorblind-safe as adjacent pairs\n  against --color-surface (dataviz six-checks validator; worst pair\n  CVD dE 13.2, normal-vision 19.3, all slots >=3:1 contrast).\n- Convert all four retirement pages to Tailwind utilities on ghost tokens,\n  matching the card/form/table patterns of other micro-apps; pages demote\n  their titles to h2 under a shared \"Retirement\" h1 in the section layout.\n- Retheme TimeSeriesChart in place (kept the custom SVG chart rather than\n  porting to Chart.js — the crosshair/tooltip/keyboard interactions and\n  stacked-area gap rendering would be a rewrite for no functional gain);\n  it now reads ghost tokens directly.\n- Drop the argent variable-bridge from the retirement layout; no argent\n  tokens remain.\n- Add a hologram-style icon-retirement.svg (growth curve + coin) used in\n  the section header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BeEhetRECDEDxZFFFV4U34","tree":{"sha":"a050291aab3500242aa055ec93105becda139090","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/a050291aab3500242aa055ec93105becda139090"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/59809358b42cd3d38a82c42ea9ee46dfa8903b9f","verification":{"payload":"tree a050291aab3500242aa055ec93105becda139090\nparent 6c15767e15d10b513afda4946d02fb08a4cc1d17\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786194616 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786194616 -0400\n\nRestyle /retirement to ghost''s design language (closes #11)\n\n- Add status (--color-success/error) and categorical data-viz tokens\n  (--color-viz-1..5) to app.css and DESIGN.md. The viz set is cyan-led to\n  match the brand accent and validated colorblind-safe as adjacent pairs\n  against --color-surface (dataviz six-checks validator; worst pair\n  CVD dE 13.2, normal-vision 19.3, all slots >=3:1 contrast).\n- Convert all four retirement pages to Tailwind utilities on ghost tokens,\n  matching the card/form/table patterns of other micro-apps; pages demote\n  their titles to h2 under a shared \"Retirement\" h1 in the section layout.\n- Retheme TimeSeriesChart in place (kept the custom SVG chart rather than\n  porting to Chart.js — the crosshair/tooltip/keyboard interactions and\n  stacked-area gap rendering would be a rewrite for no functional gain);\n  it now reads ghost tokens directly.\n- Drop the argent variable-bridge from the retirement layout; no argent\n  tokens remain.\n- Add a hologram-style icon-retirement.svg (growth curve + coin) used in\n  the section header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BeEhetRECDEDxZFFFV4U34\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQi++hh8caZOpaP3suMH6araKp5xAUCancquAAKCRCMH6araKp5\nxOLfAQCfCJlPXZkNGOFKpTZGjFT36KHZYxlv6dQ3g+u3V7POdgD/el8smUMbcJ7Z\nUTeoqnMKz2YydOqjyeA/Ga1FYPxcGwI=\n=5pQf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T15:33:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76548291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vhari-Maven","id":76548291,"login":"Vhari-Maven","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTQ4Mjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commit/59809358b42cd3d38a82c42ea9ee46dfa8903b9f","node_id":"C_kwDOQogrKNoAKDU5ODA5MzU4YjQyY2QzZDM4YTgyYzQyZWE5ZWU0NmRmYTg5MDNiOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commit/6c15767e15d10b513afda4946d02fb08a4cc1d17","sha":"6c15767e15d10b513afda4946d02fb08a4cc1d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commits/