bles are never touched. Gitignore the seed file — it contains\npersonal financial data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ea3eh74jYydzd8wQQncmHZ","tree":{"sha":"20f28a1709c39ebaacdd88a86f7207c1141103d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/20f28a1709c39ebaacdd88a86f7207c1141103d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/38899614b333482d48385c4246713031e86cdff3","verification":{"payload":"tree 20f28a1709c39ebaacdd88a86f7207c1141103d0\nparent 91d0356bbeb9e3e82dc0d7c5245b3cc5ade35b66\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786190586 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786190586 -0400\n\nImport argent data on boot from a seed file next to the database\n\nIf the argent tables are empty and argent-seed.sql sits beside ghost.db\n(prod: /data/argent-seed.sql, uploaded via fly sftp), run it in a\ntransaction on first production boot. INSERT-only into argent_* tables;\nother tables are never touched. Gitignore the seed file — it contains\npersonal financial data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ea3eh74jYydzd8wQQncmHZ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQQi++hh8caZOpaP3suMH6araKp5xAUCanca+gAKCRCMH6araKp5\nxJ0DAQDDCaImuNegGF0iSyH8n35QSPyJexuvM2Uq3C0P6/FlbQEAuGvZT5Dof42r\nKCgPAZN+WrL0SedBAT4Pn4ya7iJfTgI=\n=EY6v\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T12:03:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76548291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vha