github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/commits/91d0356bbeb9e3e82dc0d7c5245b3cc5ade35b66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:56:00Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T11:56:00Z","email":"jimmybdavis@gmail.com","name":"James Davis"},"message":"Port argent retirement planner in as a micro-app\n\nAdds a Retirement section (/retirement + job/accounts/expenses) ported\nfrom the standalone argent repo:\n\n- Projection engine (pure TS) + chart component under src/lib/argent/,\n  tests converted from bun:test to vitest\n- Server libs (inputs, balances CSV import, LES PDF parse via unpdf)\n  under src/lib/services/argent/\n- Schema merged into src/lib/db/schema.ts with argent_-prefixed tables\n  (migration 0012); argent CSS tokens scoped to the section layout\n- Fixes fresh-install migration failure: 0008 and 0009 both created\n  oauth_tokens_provider_idx; 0009 now uses IF NOT EXISTS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ea3eh74jYydzd8wQQncmHZ","tree":{"sha":"9d703babae8bd73d14b9f242e15acfe9366cd49c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/9d703babae8bd73d14b9f242e15acfe9366cd49c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/91d0356bbeb9e3e82dc0d7c5245b3cc5ade35b66","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d703babae8bd73d14b9f242e15acfe9366cd49c\nparent d061668556c6866473e84a84991820d2cec1a2ef\nauthor James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786190160 -0400\ncommitter James Davis <jimmybdavis@gmail.com> 1786190160 -0400\n\nPort argent retirement planner in as a micro-app\n\nAdds a Retirement section (/retirement + job/accounts/expenses) ported\nfrom the standalone argent repo:\n\n- Projection engine (pure TS) + chart component under s