s\n- Update Dockerfile to use oven/bun base image\n- Update all scripts and commands from npm/node to bun\n- Add @types/bun, remove better-sqlite3 and tsx dependencies\n- Update test scripts to run with Bun runtime (bun --bun vitest)\n- Enable foreign_keys pragma in test setup for cascade deletes\n- Update documentation (CLAUDE.md, README.md, DEPLOY.md)\n\nBenefits:\n- Faster startup and package installs\n- Built-in SQLite driver (no native compilation needed)\n- Smaller Docker image (~96MB vs ~150-200MB)\n- Native TypeScript execution without tsx\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44cb234bfd6a9e415719b8e083e175d54ddea3cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/trees/44cb234bfd6a9e415719b8e083e175d54ddea3cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vhari-Maven/ghost/git/commits/3a2663668f75a7276df4e4359bd8f89afebf034a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76548291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vhari-Maven","id":76548291,"login":"Vhari-Maven","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NTQ4Mjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vhari-Maven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/