ldeu/platform-ssot/commits/0e2700274483193578660c13f2a48e33c7ec0fda"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/e0834808589121c146ed2ee85eec2a8df553052d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T23:34:19Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T23:34:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(api-gateway): /api/auth/cookie/refresh path matcher (silent token refresh) (#571)\n\n* fix(api-gateway): add /api/auth/cookie/refresh path matcher (frontend silent-refresh contract)\n\nThe frontend AuthBootstrapper POSTs to /api/auth/cookie/refresh on every\nsilent token rotation, but AuthCookieEndpoint only mapped @PostMapping\nwithout an explicit path attribute — i.e. only the root /api/auth/cookie\nmatched. Every refresh hit fell through to Spring''s static-resource handler\nand 404''d (\"No static resource api/auth/cookie/refresh.\"), so the httpOnly\ncookie was never re-written. With the cookie expired and no refresh path\nworking, every subsequent request landed on\nWebSessionServerSecurityContextRepository → \"No SecurityContext found in\nWebSession\" → 401, and the user got bounced to Keycloak login.\n\nEffect: live testai cluster gateway logs showed the full pattern in a\nten-minute window — frontend POST /api/auth/cookie/refresh → 404, then a\nflood of GET /api/v1/authz/me → 401 (\"No SecurityContext\"). Multiple\nre-logins didn''t help because each refresh attempt re-hit the missing path.\n\nFix: change @PostMapping to @PostMapping(path = {\"\", \"/refresh\"}) so both\nthe initial cookie-write (POST /api/auth/cookie) and silent-refresh\n(POST /api/auth/cookie/refresh) hit the same handler. Both endpoints share\nthe same Bearer-to-cookie translation; splitting them lets observability\ndistinguish login vs. refresh hits if needed later. SecurityConfig already\nmatches /api/auth/cookie/** with permitAll, so no security change is\nrequired.\n\nLive hotfix in place: a temporary ingress rewrite (/api/auth/cookie/refresh\n→ /api/auth/cookie) was applied to platform-test before this commit so the\nuser could keep working. Once this image ships and rolls out, the rewrite\ningress (muavin-auth-cookie-refresh-rewrite) can be deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(governance): scope PR #571 under auth-cookie-refresh-fix feature contract\n\nAdds a dedicated feature execution contract for the api-gateway\nAuthCookieEndpoint /refresh path matcher fix. The change is not in scope\nfor fin-muhasebe-detay-muavin-v3 (auth flow is a cross-cutting platform\nconcern, not a muavin v3 deliverable), so a separate contract is the\ncorrect boundary.\n\n- features/auth-cookie-refresh-fix.v1.json (new contract)\n- active_features.v1.json (registers the contract for governance gates)\n- ux_change_map.v1.json (maps AuthCookieEndpoint.java under\n  trust_privacy_security_ux / least_privilege_interaction_design — cookie\n  is httpOnly + Secure + SameSite=Strict on https)\n\nLocal check_feature_execution_contract.py status=OK, errors=0.\nLocal check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py status=OK, missing_mappings=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(deploy-backend): add api-gateway to build matrix + paths filter\n\nPR #571 fixes AuthCookieEndpoint.java in api-gateway, but the existing\ndeploy-backend workflow only matrices report-service — api-gateway was\non the V2 backlog. That meant merging the cookie fix would not produce\na new api-gateway image, so the gateway pod would stay stuck on\nsha-25076a4 and the live 404 on /api/auth/cookie/refresh would persist.\n\nAdds:\n- backend/api-gateway/** to the push paths filter so commits touching\n  the gateway trigger a build.\n- api-gateway to the service matrix so the gateway image is rebuilt\n  alongside report-service.\n\nMaven and Dockerfile are already in place under backend/api-gateway/, no\nbuild pipeline changes required besides the matrix entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9fa5868fd8340b3762162aefb01cb1b506441fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/f9fa5868fd8340b3762162aefb01cb1b506441fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/e0834808589121c146ed2ee85eec2a8df553052d","verification":{"payload":"tree f9fa5868fd8340b3762162aefb01cb1b506441fd\nparent 34712d0f8e7573f3bf560fe2227d38f2adb4aad8\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1778024059 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778024059 +0300\n\nfix(api-gateway): /api/auth/cookie/refresh path matcher (silent token refresh) (#571)\n\n* fix(api-gateway): add /api/auth/cookie/refresh path matcher (frontend silent-refresh contract)\n\nThe frontend AuthBootstrapper POSTs to /api/auth/cookie/refresh on every\nsilent token rotation, but AuthCookieEndpoint only mapped @PostMapping\nwithout an explicit path attribute — i.e. only the root /api/auth/cookie\nmatched. Every refresh hit fell through to Spring''s static-resource handler\nand 404''d (\"No static resource api/auth/cookie/refresh.\"), so the httpOnly\ncookie was never re-written. With the cookie expired and no refresh path\nworking, every subsequent request landed on\nWebSessionServerSecurityContextRepository → \"No SecurityContext found in\nWebSession\" → 401, and the user got bounced to Keycloak login.\n\nEffect: live testai cluster gateway logs showed the full pattern in a\nten-minute window — frontend POST /api/auth/cookie/refresh → 404, then a\nflood of GET /api/v1/authz/me → 401 (\"No SecurityContext\"). Multiple\nre-logins didn''t help because each refresh attempt re-hit the missing path.\n\nFix: change @PostMapping to @PostMapping(path = {\"\", \"/refresh\"}) so both\nthe initial cookie-write (POST /api/auth/cookie) and silent-refresh\n(POST /api/auth/cookie/refresh) hit the same handler. Both endpoints share\nthe same Bearer-to-cookie translation; splitting them lets observability\ndistinguish login vs. refresh hits if needed later. SecurityConfig already\nmatches /api/auth/cookie/** with permitAll, so no security change is\nrequired.\n\nLive hotfix in place: a temporary ingress rewrite (/api/auth/cookie/refresh\n→ /api/auth/cookie) was applied to platform-test before this commit so the\nuser could keep working. Once this image ships and rolls out, the rewrite\ningress (muavin-auth-cookie-refresh-rewrite) can be deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(governance): scope PR #571 under auth-cookie-refresh-fix feature contract\n\nAdds a dedicated feature execution contract for the api-gateway\nAuthCookieEndpoint /refresh path matcher fix. The change is not in scope\nfor fin-muhasebe-detay-muavin-v3 (auth flow is a cross-cutting platform\nconcern, not a muavin v3 deliverable), so a separate contract is the\ncorrect boundary.\n\n- features/auth-cookie-refresh-fix.v1.json (new contract)\n- active_features.v1.json (registers the contract for governance gates)\n- ux_change_map.v1.json (maps AuthCookieEndpoint.java under\n  trust_privacy_security_ux / least_privilege_interaction_design — cookie\n  is httpOnly + Secure + SameSite=Strict on https)\n\nLocal check_feature_execution_contract.py status=OK, errors=0.\nLocal check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py status=OK, missing_mappings=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(deploy-backend): add api-gateway to build matrix + paths filter\n\nPR #571 fixes AuthCookieEndpoint.java in api-gateway, but the existing\ndeploy-backend workflow only matrices report-service — api-gateway was\non the V2 backlog. That meant merging the cookie fix would not produce\na new api-gateway image, so the gateway pod would stay stuck on\nsha-25076a4 and the live 404 on /api/auth/cookie/refresh would persist.\n\nAdds:\n- backend/api-gateway/** to the push paths filter so commits touching\n  the gateway trigger a build.\n- api-gateway to the service matrix so the gateway image is rebuilt\n  alongside report-service.\n\nMaven and Dockerfile are already in place under backend/api-gateway/, no\nbuild pipeline changes required besides the matrix entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+n57CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH+cQAHbwVznsUpYo+Nw+9ktVg9KG\n/5It5ykN+DiSG3WIRsyVsEHDHjdZO1s4GV53+64BPpx0usL71MZGdEbMWBVdgwIM\n4ZSWLuQebmL4AvqEuPa7ILox9g+uOh0WwYgtB53mxs9fSc9nslxkCreWHXQh840q\nqA+8rZ76qQukVbgm5HfuYkW8dFlbmUTPSyfRgSxMoIZFDlrvtvOivHNmfyt5hRng\nrwDHDulS09f8I/8xlKDKCbC+vNvDH8AutLb25VBaczDtBT95esjYjzrPVbDdOWTv\niapZrk9K0fqmoEhTFXXq9kAW6dKWgxCXD/OCGOpWpxHan3n0y5vQvE88OKgCvP7z\nDZGcmrnow4lPxa3TXy1rS43NN7lYAjLo3OGSoeASbLma2tkWg74tgOicOZRd5Dxe\nbLcDWj1LmoA/068JjdOK1z2y