"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/34712d0f8e7573f3bf560fe2227d38f2adb4aad8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:21Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T21:15:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe-reporting): CompanyPicker dropdown for muavin v3 single-tenant reports (#570)\n\n* feat(mfe-reporting): CompanyPicker dropdown for muavin v3 single-tenant reports\n\nBackend muavin v3 (PR #564) requiresSingleCompany contract: header\nX-Company-Id eksikse 400 MissingCompanyHeaderException döndürür.\nŞu ana kadar localStorage''a manuel set edilmişti; bu PR ile sayfa\nfiltre satırına şirket dropdown''u eklendi.\n\nComponent:\n- web/apps/mfe-reporting/src/components/CompanyPicker.tsx (NEW)\n  * V1 MVP: hardcoded 1-43 list (live MSSQL evidence: 43 company-only\n    schemas workcube_mikrolink_<N>).\n  * onChange -> localStorage[reporting:currentCompanyId] write +\n    CustomEvent dispatch + window.location.reload (next fetch picks up\n    via dynamic-report/api.ts buildCompanyHeaders helper).\n  * ''storage'' + ''reporting:company-changed'' event listener -> diğer\n    bileşenler (gelecekte) seçim değişimini tracker edebilir.\n\nIntegration:\n- create-dynamic-module.tsx renderFilters: search input ile birlikte\n  CompanyPicker render edilir (tüm dynamic raporlar; muavin gibi\n  single-tenant olanlar header''ı kullanır, multi-tenant olanlar\n  ignore eder).\n\nFollowups (V2 PR):\n- Dynamic list: /api/v1/users/me/companies (currently 500) debug + fix.\n- AG Grid api.refreshServerSide() ile reload yerine in-place re-fetch.\n- WorkspaceSwitcher year + company combined picker (mfe-shell).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mfe-reporting): forward AG Grid filterModel as advancedFilter (muavin column filter pushdown)\n\nBug: dynamic-report/api.ts dropped request.filterModel on the floor — AG Grid\ncolumn-level filters (e.g. typing \"serban\" into the Cari Adı column header)\nnever reached the backend. The \"Filtre 1\" chip would light up but the grid\nkept rendering all 126,218 rows because no advancedFilter param was emitted.\n\nFix mirrors the hr-compensation-report pattern: merge filterModel into a\nsingle advancedFilter JSON payload that ReportController parses and\nFilterTranslator translates into a parameterized SQL WHERE (whitelisted\nagainst visibleColumns, so unknown fields are silently dropped — no SQL\ninjection risk).\n\nAlso fixed: sortModel was emitted as legacy CSV (\"colId,asc\"), but\nReportController parses sort as JSON via parseJson(...). Switched to\nJSON.stringify([{colId, sort}]) — same shape hr-compensation uses.\n\nTests: 4 new vitest cases cover filterModel forwarding, the empty-filter\ncase, explicit advancedFilter precedence, and the sort JSON shape. All 11\nsuite tests pass locally.\n\nContract: added CompanyPicker.tsx + create-dynamic-module.tsx to the muavin\nv3 feature contract''s ux_contract.artifacts (was failing PR #570 with\nux_contract:uncovered_ui_change). Local\ncheck_feature_execution_contract.py now reports status=OK errors=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mfe-reporting): pass-through stringified advancedFilter (avoid double-encode)\n\nCodex review (REVISE) blocker: the previous commit re-stringified\nrequest.advancedFilter, but GridRequest types it as `string` and DashboardPage\nalready calls JSON.stringify(filter) before passing it through. Doing\nJSON.stringify(string) yields \"\\\"{\\\\\\\"foo\\\\\\\":1}\\\"\" — a single-quoted JSON\nstring literal, not the Map<String,Object> the backend parseJson expects, so\ndashboard drill-through filters silently failed.\n\nFix: pass-through when typeof advancedFilter === ''string''; only stringify\nwhen a caller defensively hands us a raw object (legacy / tests).\n\nTests: split the explicit-advancedFilter case into two — string-input\n(production path, asserts exact pass-through with no double-encode) and\nraw-object-input (defensive). 12 vitest cases pass locally.\n\nCodex thread: 019df9f0-89fc-7a91-8a49-a40667ea5d00 (cross-AI peer review).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(ux-catalog): map muavin v3 CompanyPicker + create-dynamic-module to ux_change_map\n\nUX catalog enforcement gate (extensions/PRJ-UX-NORTH-STAR/contract/\ncheck_ux_catalog_enforcement.py) was failing PR #570 with\nmissing_mapping errors for two new UX surfaces.\n\nBoth files surface trust/privacy/security (least-privilege interaction\ndesign): CompanyPicker scopes the data plane to a single tenant via\nX-Company-Id; create-dynamic-module.tsx wires the picker into the muavin\nfilter row.\n\nLocal check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py: status=OK, errors=0,\nmissing_mappings=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c994a8551bb245135e032fafbabc89e53041af45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/c994a8551bb245135e032fafbabc89e53041af45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/34712d0f8e7573f3bf560fe2227d38f2adb4aad8","verification":{"payload":"tree c994a8551bb245135e032fafbabc89e53041af45\nparent 809e3da437246824f64ee18649c724a62553abf1\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1778015721 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778015721 +0300\n\nfeat(mfe-reporting): CompanyPicker dropdown for muavin v3 single-tenant reports (#570)\n\n* feat(mfe-reporting): CompanyPicker dropdown for muavin v3 single-tenant reports\n\nBackend muavin v3 (PR #564) requiresSingleCompany contract: header\nX-Company-Id eksikse 400 MissingCompanyHeaderException döndürür.\nŞu ana kadar localStorage''a manuel set edilmişti; bu PR ile sayfa\nfiltre satırına şirket dropdown''u eklendi.\n\nComponent:\n- web/apps/mfe-reporting/src/components/CompanyPicker.tsx (NEW)\n  * V1 MVP: hardcoded 1-43 list (live MSSQL evidence: 43 company-only\n    schemas workcube_mikrolink_<N>).\n  * onChange -> localStorage[reporting:currentCompanyId] write +\n    CustomEvent dispatch + window.location.reload (next fetch picks up\n    via dynamic-report/api.ts buildCompanyHeaders helper).\n  * ''storage'' + ''reporting:company-changed'' event listener -> diğer\n    bileşenler (gelecekte) seçim değişimini tracker edebilir.\n\nIntegration:\n- create-dynamic-module.tsx renderFilters: search input ile birlikte\n  CompanyPicker render edilir (tüm dynamic raporlar; muavin gibi\n  single-tenant olanlar header''ı kullanır, multi-tenant olanlar\n  ignore eder).\n\nFollowups (V2 PR):\n- Dynamic list: /api/v1/users/me/companies (currently 500) debug + fix.\n- AG Grid api.refreshServerSide() ile reload yerine in-place re-fetch.\n- WorkspaceSwitcher year + company combined picker (mfe-shell).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mfe-reporting): forward AG Grid filterModel as advancedFilter (muavin column filter pushdown)\n\nBug: dynamic-report/api.ts dropped request.filterModel on the floor — AG Grid\ncolumn-level filters (e.g. typing \"serban\" into the Cari Adı column header)\nnever reached the backend. The \"Filtre 1\" chip would light up but the grid\nkept rendering all 126,218 rows because no advancedFilter param was emitted.\n\nFix mirrors the hr-compensation-report pattern: merge filterModel into a\nsingle advancedFilter JSON payload that ReportController parses and\nFilterTranslator translates into a parameterized SQL WHERE (whitelisted\nagainst visibleColumns, so unknown fields are silently dropped — no SQL\ninjection risk).\n\nAlso fixed: sortModel was emitted as legacy CSV (\"colId,asc\"), but\nReportController parses sort as JSON via parseJson(...). Switched to\nJSON.stringify([{colId, sort}]) — same shape hr-compensation uses.\n\nTests: 4 new vitest cases cover filterModel forwarding, the empty-filter\ncase, explicit advancedFilter precedence, and the sort JSON shape. All 11\nsuite tests pass locally.\n\nContract: added CompanyPicker.tsx + create-dynamic-module.tsx to the muavin\nv3 feature contract''s ux_contract.artifacts (was failing PR #570 with\nux_contract:uncovered_ui_change). Local\ncheck_feature_execution_contract.py now reports status=OK errors=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(mfe-reporting): pass-through stringified advancedFilter (avoid double-encode)\n\nCodex review (REVISE) blocker: the previous commit re-stringified\nrequest.advancedFilter, but GridRequest types it as `string` and DashboardPage\nalready calls JSON.stringify(filter) before passing it through. Doing\nJSON.stringify(string) yields \"\\\"{\\\\\\\"foo\\\\\\\":1}\\\"\" — a single-quoted JSON\nstring literal, not the Map<String,Object> the backend parseJson expects, so\ndashboard drill-through filters silently failed.\n\nFix: pass-through when typeof advancedFilter === ''string''; only stringify\nwhen a caller defensively hands us a raw object (legacy / tests).\n\nTests: split the explicit-advancedFilter case into two — string-input\n(production path, asserts exact pass-through with no double-encode) and\nraw-object-input (defensive). 12 vitest cases pass locally.\n\nCodex thread: 019df9f0-89fc-7a91-8a49-a40667ea5d00 (cross-AI peer review).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(ux-catalog): map muavin v3 CompanyPicker + create-dynamic-module to ux_change_map\n\nUX catalog enforcement gate (extensions/PRJ-UX-NORTH-STAR/contract/\ncheck_ux_catalog_enforcement.py) was failing PR #570 with\nmissing_mapping errors for two new UX surfaces.\n\nBoth files surface trust/privacy/security (least-privilege interaction\ndesign): CompanyPicker scopes the data plane to a single tenant via\nX-Company-Id; create-dynamic-module.tsx wires the picker into the muavin\nfilter row.\n\nLocal check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py: status=OK, errors=0,\nmissing_mappings=0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+l3pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnAcQAD85mkKVFxCjxz5pZQGeAGY6\nSKAizjpp5W7IWMFnaflX69XcoLL/K66U6LpNdm6rTUghPxmqIGIMDd0Px7Pl4bQv\nvBfuwBCsqhhg/GjWUr1nkCFSVLhWd577Jx/a+o4pu3r7s2TYMa+pOQ1n0uuk4X9V\nPcdu33Tz1YwYbTpkLrZsLGYEN1D3eULcSVnS8CzxxRFqSqeitYcq7a/x9kR/tuaJ\ni9Azyqwe1k9O01bpvQ3DGXdRXs4fPeaDCzpGBjv85L5/4+BED3qtRQzuB2XO6zVp\nCmTS8AnahDNKeZ4bGr5WS3goHuBGt5D+yt9/eD//7K/sQ9IuGW5+ywIk4BqhR185\no8rrqG6rC1U9D2wPo2KGQE/A/FfJRMBHb2jwP7cncOvAgzbiHrypbTtIBgisGhBa\nBmpIdhmGV7/Y8Lggk+y3x8in/ZWSAm+ZR3ZVmwAJVhH9fooFee9/TaB8uRat4u7v\nz6AJV4DpjHIPLdp4s6y10tc46qdmp8gO5MquoBV4dMB2V1uWLAE4cMzldsIaXEe4\njcidTCqm+Jpk/DdusaiiTmz8zZbAw6C8Fc1Tj5+g0seTp+nUJbeI5t1/CsPCIHk5\nGMCAzAFHt6QrWorxJ9OMQPd0YkWOthp3KTGyvPSxzffikUYmXVRn/JZoCfLOwVvp\nehYYTTWnXgfZhougDXWr\n=nMh9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_