.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/809e3da437246824f64ee18649c724a62553abf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:32:14Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:32:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): rotate frontend-image GHA cache scope to v2 (force vite build refresh) (#569)\n\nLive test cluster smoke (post-PR #568 backend deploy) tespit:\nmfe-reporting bundle dosyalarında PR #564''te eklenen X-Company-Id /\nresolveCompanyId / reporting:currentCompanyId kodları YOK. Source main\nHEAD''de doğru ama vite build output''u eski (cache hit).\n\nCause: Buildx GHA cache scope=frontend-testai 4+ build boyu pnpm install\n+ vite build layer''larını reuse etti. cache-bust marker (PR #567) ve\nexplicit GHA cache delete sonrası bile aynı image digest çıktı (byte-\nidentical). Anlamı: vite chunk content hash''leri (deterministic build)\naynı kalmaya devam ediyor; layer cache bu adımı atlıyor.\n\nFix: scope=frontend- → scope=frontend--v2. Yeni cache\nnamespace eski layer''ları görmüyor → fresh pnpm install + vite build →\nmfe-reporting bundle''ı doğru kaynaktan derlenir.\n\nSonraki rotation gerektiğinde: -v3, -v4 (D30 cutover öncesi tek adım).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ff46a65ae1efc5680faed1ae530f8ddfcb803aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/2ff46a65ae1efc5680faed1ae530f8ddfcb803aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/809e3da437246824f64ee18649c724a62553abf1","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ff46a65ae1efc5680faed1ae530f8ddfcb803aa\nparent eb82a03dc8abe9f1769810a1dc4acb027f327dbb\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1778013134 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778013134 +0300\n\nfix(ci): rotate frontend-image GHA cache scope to v2 (force vite build refresh) (#569)\n\nLive test cluster smoke (post-PR #568 backend deploy) tespit:\nmfe-reporting bundle dosyalarında PR #564''te eklenen X-Company-Id /\nresolveCompanyId / reporting:currentCompanyId kodları YOK. Source main\nHEAD''de doğru ama vite build output''u eski (cache hit).\n\nCause: Buildx GHA cache scope=frontend-testai 4+ build boyu pnpm install\n+ vite build layer''larını reuse etti. cache-bust marker (PR #567) ve\nexplicit GHA cache delete sonrası bile aynı image digest çıktı (byte-\nidentical). Anlamı: vite chunk content hash''leri (deterministic build)\naynı kalmaya devam ediyor; layer cache bu adımı atlıyor.\n\nFix: scope=frontend- → scope=frontend--v2. Yeni cache\nnamespace eski layer''ları görmüyor → fresh pnpm install + vite build →\nmfe-reporting bundle''ı doğru kaynaktan derlenir.\n\nSonraki rotation gerektiğinde: -v3, -v4 (D30 cutover öncesi tek adım).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+lPOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqi4QAAjQDzo/EOI6eQzFoPvNnLMd\nj+GRit7S3o+mMdeMd3TEolswYfyyg/aha3FwSgK7apksHN5uZPVz+7JrkC45h+I5\ngClU+/qjQzsrS8A6tKJ9G8garVySe19Nce4mXsD43UEjKcaKgsZ3nAcOr4cS62Ei\nADqh77SNtY2DC0en+t6HHtp92aTrz2lgjCyDtP0dBxzu2nDF4NF86FWmCSUCCwsi\nuXA+r0q0JXa6uoWO8MndpEahSDeEMXad2tINzZSyGmqE9nGE4I9xv6+FkV9BxC2Y\nywrC38UNMsvOHqT14uzZQux7T2qfP3GKHOjhsLpn2mCi7TlMQJNkQyG6/FMtt1GA\nKYkBfIJcOgIyBRcFkuC5uUbbT4cx9sksBvmgElzz2FEadjzLG217nstifCo4EtGL\ns7DXV/UE9WM60nDumYvEPg