(workcube_mikrolink_1, company-only):\n    ID, ACTION_ID, MONEY_TYPE, RATE2, RATE1, IS_SELECTED\n    -> ACTION_MONEY_ID YOK ama ID identity kolonu var.\n\nFix:\n  EXPENSE_ITEM_PLANS_MONEY -> CAST(NULL AS bigint) AS ACTION_MONEY_ID\n    (audit MID:NULL stand-in, ORDER BY priority/is_selected dominate).\n  TAHAKKUK_PLAN_MONEY -> ID AS ACTION_MONEY_ID\n    (live row identity preserved for audit log).\n\nHem L3 (POOL direct AC.ACTION_TABLE) hem L4 (POOL via MONEY_TABLES\ndispatch) UNION ALL''larında aynı düzeltme.\n\nValidation: ./mvnw -pl report-service test -> 270/270 PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: re-trigger CI workflows for PR #568 (initial trigger missed)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0608c9fd6711cd0f7842b7b509b615390ef3838","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/a0608c9fd6711cd0f7842b7b509b615390ef3838"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/eb82a03dc8abe9f1769810a1dc4acb027f327dbb","verification":{"payload":"tree a0608c9fd6711cd0f7842b7b509b615390ef3838\nparent 9b0b735f5d928671fcaefbf72032896c3506fd9d\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1778011879 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778011879 +0300\n\nfix/muavin-pool-action-money-id (#568)\n\n* fix(muavin): EXPENSE_ITEM_PLANS_MONEY + TAHAKKUK_PLAN_MONEY column shape (live evidence)\n\nLive test cluster smoke (post-PR #567 deploy) yeni hata:\n''Invalid column name ACTION_MONEY_ID'' MSSQL 207 — branch.sql\nPOOL UNION ALL''da iki tablo schema mismatch.\n\nLive MSSQL crawl (sqlcmd 10.9.193.201:1433, 2026-05-05):\n\n  EXPENSE_ITEM_PLANS_MONEY (workcube_mikrolink_2026_1, yearly):\n    MONEY_TYPE, ACTION_ID, RATE2, RATE1, IS_SELECTED\n    -> ACTION_MONEY_ID YOK (composite key ACTION_ID+MONEY_TYPE).\n\n  TAHAKKUK_PLAN_MONEY (workcube_mikrolink_1, company-only):\n    ID, ACTION_ID, MONEY_TYPE, RATE2, RATE1, IS_SELECTED\n    -> ACTION_MONEY_ID YOK ama ID identity kolonu var.\n\nFix:\n  EXPENSE_ITEM_PLANS_MONEY -> CAST(NULL AS bigint) AS ACTION_MONEY_ID\n    (audit MID:NULL stand-in, ORDER BY priority/is_selected dominate).\n  TAHAKKUK_PLAN_MONEY -> ID AS ACTION_MONEY_ID\n    (live row identity preserved for audit log).\n\nHem L3 (POOL direct AC.ACTION_TABLE) hem L4 (POOL via MONEY_TABLES\ndispatch) UNION ALL''larında aynı düzeltme.\n\nValidation: ./mvnw -pl report-service test -> 270/270 PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: re-trigger CI workflows for PR #568 (initial trigger missed)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+k7nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAivYQADHH671ki7MlI6u/2ed0VGQb\nrwu966MZdhOA/fHxs/z7P8eWfiQtxvsrFasG6CHtvpxMGhJFULmOA5sR3/sD0hBe\nSrqhWlcIVkitIeBghn/cbaQhsg4tsAM/jiZ5T2djHtZSEP1peyO7pT9pEh0+4tiw\nQ7Oq9vIyQlAOcsrGIlnVdYZQJiLoVXXpJkd4hsWKqrmGeU92+S3ohaS5cwmmNvpH\nRNTCQ1p4pASDNyE5PfpEnTuKvKv86ZHVgRAIzocfftbVfPcf113auxRMaoCZBkpM\nUX5qVjoufHWp0m75kaD3s1eFwiR+PQ3SHbhDhM4ckm5gFJI0N8tMe3dlBh2XCYw0\nCFfOTu7hLT2mG6irHu08vuNGdqZTHWyUm6u2+6TbpA4VmQw5g36mH8W3QuPRyys0\nN683tCWtm2PiAljoLtBAcbs+qnpcYZOvoaWwkgAt8E5/sCrks4dewjoTU2D/htoK\n4v/76zG2yIWj/uadicBt/kS+Ywon8l8wrjtm5FF759lXdVFQV++WzNccaJBm+w/p\nrZi0Bo+Wtw9FUTKoTisWgooO67SR7g9P1aoz2REcV0kfcfP2f4xJ4Jy3283t5oqN\nyQGr8yy3OXcoWE+b2NEtBFUPc1gT6PDZ6J06TTpqnqNAmx8aAMp9JZxJT3bdnqB8\n+CZwRTWHYRKTpIgw5kjG\n=DB0E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-05T20:11:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.gi