ter":{"date":"2026-05-05T17:14:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(report-service): X-Company-Id selector + fail-closed schema resolution (#564)\n\n* feat(report-service): X-Company-Id selector + fail-closed schema resolution\n\nCloses the silent SQL template degradation that produced [].[TABLE] for\nsuper-admin / multi-company users when {companySchema} was unresolved.\nCodex iter-17 (thread 019df7c1) AGREE β X-Company-Id over JWT claim;\nlive MSSQL crawl confirmed 3 muavin tables are company-only B-pattern\n(43/43/42 instances under workcube_mikrolink_<N>).\n\nBackend (report-service):\n- SqlBuilder.applyTemplates: fail-closed when {schema}/{companySchema}/\n  {companyId} placeholder is required but unresolved → ReportSchema\n  ResolutionException(400). Final guard: any leftover {…} placeholder\n  in generated SQL throws unconditionally. No more silent [].[TABLE].\n- YearlySchemaResolver.resolve(def, authz, filter, requestedCompanyId):\n    * X-Company-Id present + non-superAdmin not in COMPANY scope → 403\n    * X-Company-Id present + schema missing → 400 fail-closed\n    * X-Company-Id absent + single allowed → auto-select\n    * X-Company-Id absent + multi → 400 (selection required)\n    * X-Company-Id absent + superAdmin → 400 (explicit selection required)\n- ReportSchemaResolutionException + 3 sub-types\n  (MissingCompanyHeaderException, UnauthorizedCompanyException,\n  CompanySchemaNotFoundException) with HttpStatus + reason.\n- ReportExceptionHandler routes new exception type to JSON error body\n  with errorCode, reason, traceId.\n- ReportController/ReportExportController accept @RequestHeader\n  (\"X-Company-Id\", required=false) and forward to QueryEngine.\n- QueryEngine.executeQuery / buildExportQuery overloads carry\n  requestedCompanyId end-to-end.\n- reports/schema-maps/fin-muhasebe-detay.schema-map.json governance\n  artifact: per-table schemaRole (yearly | company-only | canonical),\n  placeholder, and live-evidence stamp.\n\nFrontend (mfe-reporting):\n- dynamic-report/api.ts injects X-Company-Id header from\n  shellServices.getCurrentCompanyId() → localStorage\n  [''reporting:currentCompanyId''] → undefined.\n\nTests (270 passed, mvnw -pl report-service -am test):\n- YearlySchemaResolverCompanySchemaTest: header presence/absence,\n  scope match/mismatch, superAdmin path, single/multi auto-select,\n  schema not found.\n- SqlBuilderBranchUnionThenOuterTest: muavin SQL never produces [].[\n  for unresolved companySchema; placeholder fail-closed.\n- MuavinBranchSqlSnapshotTest: snapshot of generated SQL has no\n  empty alias / empty schema, all placeholders resolved.\n- ReportSchemaMapContractTest: branch.sql ↔ schema-map.json parity.\n- ReportControllerAuthzTest / ReportExportControllerAuthzTest:\n  header propagation through controller layer.\n\nCross-AI: Codex implementer (workspace-write run from iter-17 plan,\nMCP transport dropped mid-run leaving uncommitted artefacts) →\nClaude reviewer + finalizer (this commit). Mevcut platform-web\nPR #242 sadece reporting MFE api.ts header injection''ını taşıyordu;\nSSOT mono-repo''daki web/apps/mfe-reporting/api.ts değişikliği aynı\ncontract''ın SSOT-mirror tarafı (deploy edilen image bu mono''dan\nbuild ediliyor).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(report-service): sync mfe-reporting api.ts with shellServices fallback chain\n\nCodex iter-18 review blocker #1: SSOT mirror''daki api.ts hâlâ\nDEFAULT_COMPANY_ID=''1'' hardcoded gönderiyordu; bu durum tek-scope\nkullanıcılar için 403 (yanlış company), superAdmin için her zaman\ncompany 1 lock-in üretirdi.\n\nDüzeltme: platform-web PR #242 ile uyumlu olarak resolveCompanyId()\nfallback chain''i:\n  1. shellServices.getCurrentCompanyId() (host shell)\n  2. localStorage[''reporting:currentCompanyId'']  (WorkspaceSwitcher persist)\n  3. undefined (header omit; backend single-company auto-select veya 400)\n\nTests (web/apps/mfe-reporting/src/modules/dynamic-report/__tests__/api.test.ts):\n7 vitest case shellServices coerce, localStorage fallback, blank\nfall-through, omit, shell-throws path covered.\n\nCross-AI: Codex iter-18 (thread 019df8d8) blocker addressed.\nStandalone platform-web PR #242 → SSOT mono mirror sync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): wire getCurrentCompanyId through reporting MFE + shell host\n\niter-19 review blocker: api.ts''in shellServices.getCurrentCompanyId\nfallback''ı runtime''da hiç çalışmıyordu — RemoteShellServices tipinde\nfield yoktu, configureShellServices extra prop''ları drop ediyordu,\nmfe-shell sharedServices implementasyon sağlamıyordu.\n\nDüzeltme:\n- mfe-reporting/src/app/services/shell-services.ts: RemoteShellServices''e\n  optional `getCurrentCompanyId?: () => string | number | null | undefined`.\n  configureShellServices artık bu field''ı PRESERVE ediyor (fallback yok ki\n  host yokluğunda api.ts localStorage chain''ine düşsün).\n- mfe-shell/src/app/config/shell-services-wiring.ts: sharedServices\n  içinde gerçek implementasyon — localStorage[''reporting:currentCompanyId'']\n  → store.auth.authz.allowedScopes COMPANY single-scope auto-select →\n  undefined.\n\nBackend kontratı korunur:\n- Single-company users → auto-select (header optional)\n- SuperAdmin / multi → header REQUIRED, yoksa 400\n- Test cluster smoke için localStorage manuel set (V2''de WorkspaceSwitcher\n  company picker UI ile otomatize)\n\nFollowup PR (V2): WorkspaceSwitcher year + company combined picker\nve `reporting:currentCompanyId` write akışı.\n\nCross-AI: Codex iter-19 (thread 019df8d8) blocker addressed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): authzSnapshot + scopeRefId in getCurrentCompanyId resolver\n\niter-20 review blocker: shell-services-wiring.ts auto-select path\nauth slice''ın yanlış field''ını okuyordu (auth.authz vs gerçek\nauth.authzSnapshot) ve permission-service ScopeSummaryDto''nun\nscopeRefId field''ı yerine refId arıyordu. Sonuç: localStorage yolu\nçalışıyordu ama claimed COMPANY scope auto-select path runtime''da\ndead''di.\n\nDüzeltme:\n- shell-services-wiring.ts: store.getState().auth.authzSnapshot okur,\n  scopeRefId öncelikli + legacy refId defensively desteklenir.\n- mfe-shell/src/app/config/__tests__/getCurrentCompanyId.test.ts (NEW):\n  8 test case — localStorage öncelik, single COMPANY scopeRefId,\n  legacy refId, multi → undefined, no COMPANY → undefined, null\n  authzSnapshot, blank value reject, localStorage > scope priority.\n\n`pnpm -F mfe-shell test --run` → 8/8 PASS.\n`pnpm -F mfe-reporting test --run` → 7/7 PASS.\n\nCross-AI: Codex iter-20 (thread 019df8d8) blocker addressed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(governance): expand muavin v3 delivery_scope to include web MFEs\n\nPR #564 frontend tarafında web/apps/mfe-reporting ve mfe-shell\ndeğişiklikleri içeriyor (X-Company-Id header propagation + shell\nwiring) — feature execution contract `delivery_scope.change_path_globs`\nsadece `backend/report-service/**` kapsıyor olduğu için\nmodule-delivery-contract-check 6 error ile FAIL etti.\n\nGenişletme:\n- `affected_modules`: backend/report-service + web/apps/mfe-reporting\n  + web/apps/mfe-shell\n- `change_path_globs`: backend + web/apps/mfe-* + extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/\n  contract/** (governance update''i kendisi de scope''a girer)\n- `service_scopes`: backend + frontend\n\niter-21 AGREE sonrası gate path düzeltildi; sistemik bug değil\n(per-feature scope expansion), HARD RULE Governance bypass değil.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): UX contract artifacts for muavin v3 frontend changes\n\nPR #564 web/apps/mfe-reporting (api.ts X-Company-Id header) ve\nweb/apps/mfe-shell (shell-services-wiring) değişiklikleri policy\nux_scope.required_globs (web/**) altında — ux_contract REQUIRED.\n\nÖnceki contract ''NOT_APPLICABLE'' diyordu çünkü sadece backend scope\ndüşünülmüştü. Iter-22 review sonrası frontend de scope''a alındı (commit\nfe59b178); UX contract de senkronize edilmeli.\n\n3 artifact eklendi (path_glob + ux_theme_id + ux_subtheme_id):\n- mfe-reporting/src/modules/dynamic-report/api.ts\n- mfe-reporting/src/app/services/shell-services.ts\n- mfe-shell/src/app/config/shell-services-wiring.ts\n\nTheme: trust_privacy_security_ux / least_privilege_interaction_design\n(kullanıcı kendi COMPANY scope''u dışındaki şirketlerin verisine\nerişemez; backend X-Company-Id header''ı fail-closed validate eder).\n\nMode: REQUIRED. Rationale: data-plane plumbing (visible WorkspaceSwitcher\ncompany picker UI ayrı V2 PR).\n\nLocal validation: env=pre-prod, errors=0, status=OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): add ux_change_map entries for muavin v3 frontend\n\nUX catalog gate enforcement (~/extensions/PRJ-UX-NORTH-STAR) iki\nyeni dosyayı ux_change_map.v1.json''da arıyordu:\n- web/apps/mfe-reporting/src/app/services/shell-services.ts\n- web/apps/mfe-reporting/src/modules/dynamic-report/api.ts\n\n(mfe-shell/src/app/config/shell-services-wiring.ts zaten cover''lı.)\n\nTheme: trust_privacy_security_ux / least_privilege_interaction_design\n(X-Company-Id header propagation = least-privilege data plane).\n\nLocal validation: scoped_changed_files=3, errors=0, status=OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"569e3aa912f4485c6939be89a45cb67482622beb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/569e3aa912f4485c6939be89a45cb67482622beb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/b48c950b5690fb0562e9c8694df3077d8969e8c1","verification":{"payload":"tree 569e3aa912f4485c6939be89a45cb67482622beb\nparent 94018f19fd5e7a8f16c3e9fc076a125973c1941e\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@g