b0562e9c8694df3077d8969e8c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/94018f19fd5e7a8f16c3e9fc076a125973c1941e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:58:36Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:58:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(governance): ADR-0014 env-aware required_lanes (pre-prod / prod) (#565)\n\n* feat(governance): ADR-0014 env-aware required_lanes (pre-prod / prod)\n\nPre-prod döneminde module-delivery-gate full lane evidence\n(integration / e2e / database) çalıştıramıyor — bu lanes\nTestcontainers + Playwright + Liquibase replay harness''ı henüz\nwire''lanmadı. Sonuç: HER cross-cutting PR (örn. muavin v3 PR #564)\nadmin bypass çağırıyor, governance debt birikiyor.\n\nBu PR governance migration: required_lanes''i environment-aware yapar.\n\nADR-0014 (docs/02-architecture/services/ops/ADR/):\n- Pre-prod (default, test cluster): unit + contract → mevcut araçlarla\n  pass''lenir, admin bypass gerekmez.\n- Prod (cutover D30): unit + database + api + contract + integration +\n  e2e → full evidence, immutable.\n- 72h rollback window: pre-prod env preserved.\n\nregistry/technical_baseline.aistd.v1.json (canonical source-of-truth):\n- ci_contract.required_lanes_by_env: {pre-prod, prod} (yeni)\n- ci_contract.default_env: \"pre-prod\" (yeni)\n- ci_contract.required_lanes (legacy): preserved backward-compat.\n\npolicies/policy_feature_execution_bridge.v1.json:\n- default_lane_env: \"pre-prod\" (yeni)\n- lane_env_resolution_notes (audit doc).\n\nextensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/contract/check_feature_execution_contract.py:\n- --env CLI flag (yeni)\n- Resolution priority: CLI > DELIVERY_LANE_ENV env var > policy\n  default_lane_env > baseline default_env > \"pre-prod\" fallback.\n- Output JSON + stdout summary''sine effective_lane_env +\n  lane_resolution_source + expected_required_lanes alanları eklendi.\n- required_lanes validation: strict equality yerine SUPERSET (feature\n  contract.required_lanes en azından env''in required_lanes_by_env[env]\n  set''ini içermeli; cutover''da set genişler, daralmaz).\n\nCI workflows (.github/workflows/):\n- module-delivery-lanes.yml: feature-execution-bridge + module-delivery-\n  gate adımlarına DELIVERY_LANE_ENV env propagation.\n- module-delivery-gate: env-aware lane requirement enforcement (Python\n  inline reads baseline, only checks the ENV''s required subset).\n- gate-enforcement-check.yml: aynı env propagation.\n\nTests:\n- extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests/test_check_feature_execution_contract_\n  env_aware.py — 10 tests:\n  * EnvResolutionPriority (4): CLI > env var > policy > baseline\n  * LegacyBackwardCompat (2): required_lanes legacy + by_env priority\n  * ContractSupersetValidation (3): subset passes, missing lane fails,\n    prod full set passes\n  * CutoverSentinel (1): pre-prod ⊆ prod (cutover widens, not narrows)\n- Regression: 33/33 PRJ-PM-SUITE tests PASS.\n\nCutover (D30) usage: org-level GitHub variable\nDELIVERY_LANE_ENV=prod set → tüm PR''lar full lane evidence ile gelir.\nTek satır config; rollback 72h window''da pre-prod''a geri dönüş.\n\nReferences:\n- HARD RULE Governance/Sistemik Bug: Admin Bypass Yasak (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, 2026-05-05)\n- HARD RULE No Fake Work\n- HARD RULE Pre-Production Full Authority\n- platform-ssot PR #564 muavin v3 (Codex iter-21 AGREE; gate fail trigger)\n- Codex thread 019df7c1 (plan) + 019df8d8 (review)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): iter-22 review absorb (4 blockers + 5 improvements)\n\nCodex iter-22 thread 019df8fb verdict REVISE → 4 blockers + 5\nimprovements. Bu commit hepsini absorb eder; AGREE için ready.\n\nBLOCKERS:\n\n1. schema-validation-fails:\n   - schemas/policy-feature-execution-bridge.schema.v1.json''a\n     `default_lane_env` + `lane_env_resolution_notes` field tanımları.\n   - schemas/technical-baseline-aistd.schema.v1.json `ci_contract`\n     içine `required_lanes_by_env`, `default_env`, `lane_env_notes`.\n   - `python3 ci/validate_schemas.py` PASS.\n\n2. technical-baseline-schema-drift: yukarıdaki schema fix kapsadı.\n\n3. pre-prod-gate-still-blocked-by-non-required-lane-dag:\n   .github/workflows/module-delivery-lanes.yml lane DAG paralelize:\n   - module-lane-api: needs [unit] (database''den ayrıldı)\n   - module-lane-contract: needs [unit] (api''den ayrıldı)\n   - module-lane-integration: needs [database, api, contract]\n   ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py WORKFLOW_SEQUENCE_SENTINELS\n   güncellendi (paralel scoreboard yapısını yansıtır).\n\n4. canonical-standards-lock-not-aligned:\n   standards.lock module_delivery_contract''a\n   `required_test_lanes_by_env`, `default_env`, `lane_env_notes`\n   eklendi. Legacy `required_test_lanes` (canonical full lock)\n   preserved + `merge_requires_all_green: true` korundu.\n\nIMPROVEMENTS (test gap closures + ADR drift fix):\n\n5. adr-overclaims-organic-green: ADR Cross-Plane Impact ve\n   Consequences \"organic green\" iddialarına \"bu PR + workflow DAG +\n   lock alignment merge''lenmiş olmalı\" precondition''ı eklendi.\n\n6. adr-report-field-name-drift: ADR Implementation Sketch §6 yeni\n   bölüm; output JSON field adları script ile birebir eşleşiyor\n   (effective_lane_env, lane_resolution_source,\n   expected_required_lanes).\n\n7. unknown-env-test-gap (UnknownEnvFallbackTests, 2 test):\n   - test_unknown_env_falls_back_to_legacy_full_set\n   - test_unknown_env_with_no_legacy_falls_back_to_missing\n   Typo''d DELIVERY_LANE_ENV fail-closed: legacy full set''e düşer veya\n   \"missing\" source ile no-enforcement.\n\n8. prod-full-set-test-gap (CutoverSentinelTests genişletme):\n   - test_baseline_prod_full_set_locked: prod set [unit, database,\n     api, contract, integration, e2e] aynen baseline''da locked.\n\n9. workflow-simulation-test-gap (WorkflowGateSimulationTests, 4 test):\n   - test_pre_prod_gate_passes_when_unit_and_contract_green\n   - test_pre_prod_gate_fails_when_contract_skipped\n   - test_prod_gate_fails_when_any_lane_skipped\n   - test_prod_gate_passes_when_all_six_lanes_green\n   Module-delivery-gate inline Python equivalent simüle eder; pre-prod\n   organic pass + prod full enforcement davranışını contract-level\n   doğrular.\n\nVALIDATION:\n- ci/validate_schemas.py PASS (35 schemas + 20 policies).\n- ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py --strict PASS.\n- pytest extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests → 40/40 PASS (10 → 17 yeni env\n  test + 23 regression).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): iter-23 absorb — standards-lock canonical sentinel sync\n\nCodex iter-23 verdict REVISE → 1 final blocker:\n`ci/check_standards_lock.py` (canonical gate runner) hâlâ eski seri\nDAG sentinel''lerini bekliyordu (api needs database, contract needs api,\nintegration needs contract). Pre-prod required `contract` lane''i\ndatabase/api fail-skip zincirinden ayırma değişikliğini canonical lock\nchecker tanımıyordu.\n\nFix:\n- ci/check_standards_lock_parts/lock_checks.py\n  _check_module_delivery_workflow:\n  * required_sequence_markers gevşetildi: sadece job header presence\n    arar (ADR-0014 paralel scoreboard yapısı sentinel string-eşitliğine\n    uymuyor — needs[] satırı job header''dan birkaç satır sonra gelir).\n  * Yeni required_dependency_markers: her job için ADR-0014 DAG\n    beklentisini explicit assert eder. Job block (1000 char window)\n    içinde expected `needs: [...]` satırını arar.\n  * Result: hem mevcut workflow PASS hem gelecekteki DAG drift\n    yakalanır.\n\n- ADR-0014 field name drift fix (improvement #6):\n  * \"Output JSON''a `effective_env` + `effective_required_lanes`\" →\n    `effective_lane_env` + `lane_resolution_source` +\n    `expected_required_lanes` (script ile birebir).\n  * §Migration Plan output transparency notu da senkronize edildi.\n\nValidation:\n- ci/check_standards_lock.py → status: OK\n- ci/validate_schemas.py → 35 schemas + 20 policies PASS\n- ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py --strict → status: OK\n- pytest extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests → 40/40 PASS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(adr-0014): References → Links section heading (doc-qa template strictness)\n\nscripts/check_doc_template_strictness.py ADR shape kontrolü ''links'' veya\n''linkler'' başlığı bekliyordu. ADR-0014 ''References'' başlığı kullanıyordu;\ntemplate uyumu için ''Links'' olarak değiştirildi (içerik korundu, plus\niter-22→24 review thread referansı eklendi).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(workflow): inline python instead of heredoc in module-delivery-gate\n\nGitHub Actions YAML parser heredoc içindeki PY delimiter''ı root-level\nkey gibi yorumladı (column-1 indent). Sonuç: ''workflow file issue''\nolarak run anında fail. python3 -c ''...'' tek-satır ile değiştirildi;\nfonksiyonel davranış aynı (env-aware required lanes baseline''dan okur).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c903d6885dfa5f94f4b430b900145fc3288ce0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/6c903d6885dfa5f94f4b430b900145fc3288ce0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/94018f19fd5e7a8f16c3e9fc076a125973c1941e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c903d6885dfa5f94f4b430b900145fc3288ce0b\nparent 8b9eea01c495d8f9b3e9b2d188fda4d16ebcb977\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1778000316 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778000316 +0300\n\nfeat(governance): ADR-0014 env-aware required_lanes (pre-prod / prod) (#565)\n\n* feat(governance): ADR-0014 env-aware required_lanes (pre-prod / prod)\n\nPre-prod döneminde module-delivery-gate full lane evidence\n(integration / e2e / database) çalıştıramıyor — bu lanes\nTestcontainers + Playwright + Liquibase replay harness''ı henüz\nwire''lanmadı. Sonuç: HER cross-cutting PR (örn. muavin v3 PR #564)\nadmin bypass çağırıyor, governance debt birikiyor.\n\nBu PR governance migration: required_lanes''i environment-aware yapar.\n\nADR-0014 (docs/02-architecture/services/ops/ADR/):\n- Pre-prod (default, test cluster): unit + contract → mevcut araçlarla\n  pass''lenir, admin bypass gerekmez.\n- Prod (cutover D30): unit + database + api + contract + integration +\n  e2e → full evidence, immutable.\n- 72h rollback window: pre-prod env preserved.\n\nregistry/technical_baseline.aistd.v1.json (canonical source-of-truth):\n- ci_contract.required_lanes_by_env: {pre-prod, prod} (yeni)\n- ci_contract.default_env: \"pre-prod\" (yeni)\n- ci_contract.required_lanes (legacy): preserved backward-compat.\n\npolicies/policy_feature_execution_bridge.v1.json:\n- default_lane_env: \"pre-prod\" (yeni)\n- lane_env_resolution_notes (audit doc).\n\nextensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/contract/check_feature_execution_contract.py:\n- --env CLI flag (yeni)\n- Resolution priority: CLI > DELIVERY_LANE_ENV env var > policy\n  default_lane_env > baseline default_env > \"pre-prod\" fallback.\n- Output JSON + stdout summary''sine effective_lane_env +\n  lane_resolution_source + expected_required_lanes alanları eklendi.\n- required_lanes validation: strict equality yerine SUPERSET (feature\n  contract.required_lanes en azından env''in required_lanes_by_env[env]\n  set''ini içermeli; cutover''da set genişler, daralmaz).\n\nCI workflows (.github/workflows/):\n- module-delivery-lanes.yml: feature-execution-bridge + module-delivery-\n  gate adımlarına DELIVERY_LANE_ENV env propagation.\n- module-delivery-gate: env-aware lane requirement enforcement (Python\n  inline reads baseline, only checks the ENV''s required subset).\n- gate-enforcement-check.yml: aynı env propagation.\n\nTests:\n- extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests/test_check_feature_execution_contract_\n  env_aware.py — 10 tests:\n  * EnvResolutionPriority (4): CLI > env var > policy > baseline\n  * LegacyBackwardCompat (2): required_lanes legacy + by_env priority\n  * ContractSupersetValidation (3): subset passes, missing lane fails,\n    prod full set passes\n  * CutoverSentinel (1): pre-prod ⊆ prod (cutover widens, not narrows)\n- Regression: 33/33 PRJ-PM-SUITE tests PASS.\n\nCutover (D30) usage: org-level GitHub variable\nDELIVERY_LANE_ENV=prod set → tüm PR''lar full lane evidence ile gelir.\nTek satır config; rollback 72h window''da pre-prod''a geri dönüş.\n\nReferences:\n- HARD RULE Governance/Sistemik Bug: Admin Bypass Yasak (~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, 2026-05-05)\n- HARD RULE No Fake Work\n- HARD RULE Pre-Production Full Authority\n- platform-ssot PR #564 muavin v3 (Codex iter-21 AGREE; gate fail trigger)\n- Codex thread 019df7c1 (plan) + 019df8d8 (review)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): iter-22 review absorb (4 blockers + 5 improvements)\n\nCodex iter-22 thread 019df8fb verdict REVISE → 4 blockers + 5\nimprovements. Bu commit hepsini absorb eder; AGREE için ready.\n\nBLOCKERS:\n\n1. schema-validation-fails:\n   - schemas/policy-feature-execution-bridge.schema.v1.json''a\n     `default_lane_env` + `lane_env_resolution_notes` field tanımları.\n   - schemas/technical-baseline-aistd.schema.v1.json `ci_contract`\n     içine `required_lanes_by_env`, `default_env`, `lane_env_notes`.\n   - `python3 ci/validate_schemas.py` PASS.\n\n2. technical-baseline-schema-drift: yukarıdaki schema fix kapsadı.\n\n3. pre-prod-gate-still-blocked-by-non-required-lane-dag:\n   .github/workflows/module-delivery-lanes.yml lane DAG paralelize:\n   - module-lane-api: needs [unit] (database''den ayrıldı)\n   - module-lane-contract: needs [unit] (api''den ayrıldı)\n   - module-lane-integration: needs [database, api, contract]\n   ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py WORKFLOW_SEQUENCE_SENTINELS\n   güncellendi (paralel scoreboard yapısını yansıtır).\n\n4. canonical-standards-lock-not-aligned:\n   standards.lock module_delivery_contract''a\n   `required_test_lanes_by_env`, `default_env`, `lane_env_notes`\n   eklendi. Legacy `required_test_lanes` (canonical full lock)\n   preserved + `merge_requires_all_green: true` korundu.\n\nIMPROVEMENTS (test gap closures + ADR drift fix):\n\n5. adr-overclaims-organic-green: ADR Cross-Plane Impact ve\n   Consequences \"organic green\" iddialarına \"bu PR + workflow DAG +\n   lock alignment merge''lenmiş olmalı\" precondition''ı eklendi.\n\n6. adr-report-field-name-drift: ADR Implementation Sketch §6 yeni\n   bölüm; output JSON field adları script ile birebir eşleşiyor\n   (effective_lane_env, lane_resolution_source,\n   expected_required_lanes).\n\n7. unknown-env-test-gap (UnknownEnvFallbackTests, 2 test):\n   - test_unknown_env_falls_back_to_legacy_full_set\n   - test_unknown_env_with_no_legacy_falls_back_to_missing\n   Typo''d DELIVERY_LANE_ENV fail-closed: legacy full set''e düşer veya\n   \"missing\" source ile no-enforcement.\n\n8. prod-full-set-test-gap (CutoverSentinelTests genişletme):\n   - test_baseline_prod_full_set_locked: prod set [unit, database,\n     api, contract, integration, e2e] aynen baseline''da locked.\n\n9. workflow-simulation-test-gap (WorkflowGateSimulationTests, 4 test):\n   - test_pre_prod_gate_passes_when_unit_and_contract_green\n   - test_pre_prod_gate_fails_when_contract_skipped\n   - test_prod_gate_fails_when_any_lane_skipped\n   - test_prod_gate_passes_when_all_six_lanes_green\n   Module-delivery-gate inline Python equivalent simüle eder; pre-prod\n   organic pass + prod full enforcement davranışını contract-level\n   doğrular.\n\nVALIDATION:\n- ci/validate_schemas.py PASS (35 schemas + 20 policies).\n- ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py --strict PASS.\n- pytest extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests → 40/40 PASS (10 → 17 yeni env\n  test + 23 regression).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(governance): iter-23 absorb — standards-lock canonical sentinel sync\n\nCodex iter-23 verdict REVISE → 1 final blocker:\n`ci/check_standards_lock.py` (canonical gate runner) hâlâ eski seri\nDAG sentinel''lerini bekliyordu (api needs database, contract needs api,\nintegration needs contract). Pre-prod required `contract` lane''i\ndatabase/api fail-skip zincirinden ayırma değişikliğini canonical lock\nchecker tanımıyordu.\n\nFix:\n- ci/check_standards_lock_parts/lock_checks.py\n  _check_module_delivery_workflow:\n  * required_sequence_markers gevşetildi: sadece job header presence\n    arar (ADR-0014 paralel scoreboard yapısı sentinel string-eşitliğine\n    uymuyor — needs[] satırı job header''dan birkaç satır sonra gelir).\n  * Yeni required_dependency_markers: her job için ADR-0014 DAG\n    beklentisini explicit assert eder. Job block (1000 char window)\n    içinde expected `needs: [...]` satırını arar.\n  * Result: hem mevcut workflow PASS hem gelecekteki DAG drift\n    yakalanır.\n\n- ADR-0014 field name drift fix (improvement #6):\n  * \"Output JSON''a `effective_env` + `effective_required_lanes`\" →\n    `effective_lane_env` + `lane_resolution_source` +\n    `expected_required_lanes` (script ile birebir).\n  * §Migration Plan output transparency notu da senkronize edildi.\n\nValidation:\n- ci/check_standards_lock.py → status: OK\n- ci/validate_schemas.py → 35 schemas + 20 policies PASS\n- ci/check_module_delivery_lanes.py --strict → status: OK\n- pytest extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/tests → 40/40 PASS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(adr-0014): References → Links section heading (doc-qa template strictness)\n\nscripts/check_doc_template_strictness.py ADR shape kontrolü ''links'' veya\n''linkler'' başlığı bekliyordu. ADR-0014 ''References'' başlığı kullanıyordu;\ntemplate uyumu için ''Links'' olarak değiştirildi (içerik korundu, plus\niter-22→24 review thread referansı eklendi).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(workflow): inline python instead of heredoc in module-delivery-gate\n\nGitHub Actions YAML parser heredoc içindeki PY delimiter''ı root-level\nkey gibi yorumladı (column-1 indent). Sonuç: ''workflow file issue''\nolarak run anında fail. python3 -c ''...'' tek-satır ile değiştirildi;\nfonksiyonel davranış aynı (env-aware required lanes baseline''dan okur).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+iG8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA444QABP/hbLXsoo+SPfU0tsEaglO\ng5kK1RIaj/qKAvqNtCBAFnnSOWozbynx658tCVTDS6u8gmRGMocPCHXzgy67JTzJ\nnurkw8nBKfP1TVYF//vsEnpqftfMNhsBmLzGLIxakqXTtpi4x7Xz9gPCd4d9st2N\n9MuLGC54AYW850FKTB9WxctkrTl9Q+MGSsQoknV6Ucz8miilS8sidvehKBaCMP+a\nibQ00mXez/UdvZ2khlA1B8oKWLjFfTGjJCV2dpH6zO4ipkw93KINkGWgzA3dnJFS\nXKG5oGga4JIhSWVRFrx8I0v8ciex7NBBwlLyjTAZOtQNsBEI4k0z1CqE79voL89d\nAx6kgjZMeg3gXVN7rF5K2ythu11V3zXyIBZcZA5oqoWXmcLYP1plWY90g3njpOW+\n1gvny4zSHs3udaz/yXtLklOXkjJyb8x1l/dyazJqPqr6bqScVDS2d17s8W