compose path removed)\n- Image namespace: platform-backend-${svc} (gitops-aligned)\n- docker/build-push-action@v5 with sha-<7> tag + latest + digest output\n- GitHub step summary writes digest pin for manual gitops bump (until V2\n  repository_dispatch automation)\n- Matrix scope: report-service only (muavin v3 critical path; other\n  services in V2 sprint)\n- DEPLOY_ENABLED gate preserved (skip mechanism)\n- Multi-module Maven build (common-auth install → service package)\n\nDownstream (post-merge):\n1. Empty commit on main triggers workflow → image build at b445ba96\n2. Digest pin extracted from step summary\n3. Manual gitops PR: kustomize/overlays/prod/kustomization.yaml digest update\n4. ArgoCD sync → cluster pod restart\n5. Muavin v3 LIVE on https://ai.acik.com/api/v1/reports/fin-muhasebe-detay\n\nRefs:\n- Codex thread 019df4ed-615c-73d1-b67a-7d0b61cc94df iter-10 (diagnoz)\n- Codex iter-11 (namespace clarification — alt-agent plan-time)\n- gitops PR #360 e5efda3 (canonical state)\n- platform-ssot PR #561 b445ba96 (muavin v3 code, awaiting deploy)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51160c11eabc2132d6cade7f4ba604990dcf756e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/51160c11eabc2132d6cade7f4ba604990dcf756e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/8b9eea01c495d8f9b3e9b2d188fda4d16ebcb977","verification":{"payload":"tree 51160c11eabc2132d6cade7f4ba604990dcf756e\nparent b445ba961c0f889b80d46599f2535412fe8a724c\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1777973956 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777973956 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): deploy-backend workflow Faz 18 retirement migration (Codex 019df4ed iter-10) (#563)\n\nRoot cause (Codex iter-10 + iter-11 plan-time clarification):\n- Compose-based build path stale: backend/docker-compose.yml services\n  retired in Faz 18 (compose decommission); `docker compose build`\n  produces 0 images → workflow fails with \"No platform-* images found\"\n- Image namespace mismatch: workflow pushed to ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-ssot-${svc}\n  but gitops kustomize/overlays/{test,prod} canonical reference is\n  ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-backend-${svc}@sha256:<digest> (verified via\n  git show origin/main:kustomize/overlays/prod/kustomization.yaml)\n- SSH host deploy lane meaningless after compose retirement (ArgoCD/k8s\n  authoritative)\n\nFix: 544 → 154 satır clean rewrite\n- Per-service Dockerfile build (compose path removed)\n- Image namespace: platform-backend-${svc} (gitops-aligned)\n- docker/build-push-action@v5 with sha-<7> tag + latest + digest output\n- GitHub step summary writes digest pin for manual gitops bump (until V2\n  repository_dispatch automation)\n- Matrix scope: report-service only (muavin v3 critical path; other\n  services in V2 sprint)\n- DEPLOY_ENABLED gate preserved (skip mechanism)\n- Multi-module Maven build (common-auth install → service package)\n\nDownstream (post-merge):\n1. Empty commit on main triggers workflow → image build at b445ba96\n2. Digest pin extracted from step summary\n3. Manual gitops PR: kustomize/overlays/prod/kustomization.yaml digest update\n4. ArgoCD sync → cluster pod restart\n5. Muavin v3 LIVE on https://ai.acik.com/api/v1/reports/fin-muhasebe-detay\n\nRefs:\n- Codex thread 019df4ed-615c-73d1-b67a-7d0b61cc94df iter-10 (diagnoz)\n- Codex iter-11 (namespace clarification — alt-agent plan-time)\n- gitops PR #360 e5efda3 (canonical state)\n- platform-ssot PR #561 b445ba96 (muavin v3 code, awaiting deploy)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+brECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxZMQAKkz2aa0JyFyaeE+zYfDyPev\nEokPfrPfv8Vtm7d56XvAVdnUgSmoOfBSOVwhPnM+0oI3+NpibAp2/tF2HVBPB+wS\nedEbEWD8/Wo0HBXSKNTN/RdKAtWSnWD7PfYnZ8Hq3rMaCRW2bICLV+eBX/ZzV24T\nNihga4jWaODCgABOIJMcMN6FBR3KNqk3EFBVVbpl8FoOzXHbbAiAHpSab5YBPTIT\n/G/EHln/PMPHflpbpPk3/m0VXCrlLuMzs9aBNzfm