d":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/010c1b9bf6412c5ef37f03da2b8f1d016fcbf921/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T18:05:57Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T18:05:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"deploy(compose): Faz 18.9 observability retirement (5 service + 2 volume) (#554)\n\nRetirement hedefi: loki + promtail + tempo + prometheus + grafana (hem prod hem stage/dev compose).\nK8s kube-prometheus-stack authoritative (monitoring ns, 8d uptime):\n- grafana + prometheus + alertmanager + loki + promtail + node-exporter +\n  state-metrics + blackbox-exporter + tempo (ClusterIP 4317/4318 OTLP)\n\nLive kanıt (staging-sw 2026-04-24 17:54 UTC):\n- Pre-stop: K8s monitoring 11 Running, compose prometheus target''ları TÜM DOWN (retired services)\n- Stop: 5 container (grafana + prometheus + tempo + loki + promtail)\n- T+30s smoke: K8s 11 Running unchanged, edge 200/401 unchanged\n- Rm: 5 container\n- Post-rm: zero regression\n\nPreflight kanıt (Codex thread 019dc09c GO):\n1. Grafana compose zanzibar-authz.json dashboard → K8s''te authz-plane-dashboard.yaml canonical replacement mevcut\n2. K8s Tempo ClusterIP (10.43.34.113, 4317/4318) — host port conflict YOK\n3. Log visibility kabul: compose promtail/loki host-compose docker logs okuyordu; user \"sistem kullanıcısı yok\" + ops docker logs erişimi yeterli\n\nDosya değişiklikleri (-195/+33):\n- deploy/docker-compose.pr