-manager + vault pattern):\n- discovery-server (ADR Faz 19 migration scope notu eklendi: user \"discovery service i almayı unutma\")\n- openfga-migrate + openfga (K8s StatefulSet authoritative, parity Codex gate 019dc07c PASS)\n- permission-service, auth-service, user-service, variant-service, core-data-service,\n  api-gateway, report-service, schema-service\n\nLive retirement evidence (staging-sw 2026-04-24 17:27-17:30 UTC):\n- Pre-stop: K8s prod 19 Running + test 10 Running + edge 200/401 baseline\n- Stop: 9 container docker stop + permission-service + openfga-migrate (Exited zaten)\n- T+5m smoke: K8s Running unchanged + edge 200/401 + /realms/ 200 KC stateful\n- OpenFGA parity gate: /api/v1/authz/version 401 \"JWT token zorunludur\" (auth chain alive)\n- rm: 11 container docker rm (9 retire + 2 exited)\n- Post-rm: K8s 19+10 Running + edge 200/401 zero regression\n\nDeploy script cleanup:\n- deploy-backend.sh:\n  - print_compose_diagnostics services list: 10→3 (postgres-db + keycloak + vault)\n  - backend_services build list: 8→0 (entire backend tier retired)\n  - \"Ensure infrastructure is up\" compose up listesi 5→3 (openfga-migrate + openfga çıktı)\n  - \"Recreate backend services\" 4 compose_run bloğu (16 wait_for_service_state) → retired notu\n- platform-start.sh: stateful tier + observability kaldı; backend phase-2 kaldırıldı\n\ndocker-compose.{prod,backend}.yml: 9 app service blok awk ile tombstone''a dönüştürüldü\n(postgres-db + keycloak + vault + vault-unseal + observability korundu).\n\nCodex AGREE: thread 019dc07c (ready_for_impl=true, 2 gate PASS: OpenFGA parity + smoke)\nRefs:\n- platform-k8s-gitops PR #107 PLAN drift fix\n- ADR-0002 §0.5 D6 stateful tier (compose PG/KC/Vault permanent)\n- D34 three-realm independence\n\nValidation:\n- docker compose config --quiet PASS (prod + backend extras)\n- bash -n syntax PASS (iki script)\n- ssh staging-sw live stop+rm executed + 5dk smoke zero regression\n\nUser hard rule UPHELD: \"düzgün çalışan sistemleri bozma\" + \"bekleme yok hızlı güvenli\" (no-soak).\n\nFaz 18.5-18.7 COMPLETE. Next: gitops current-state + evidence doc PR, sonra Faz 18.8+ (lokal dev).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(doctor-infra): Faz 18.5-18.7 obsolete check no-op (B1 OpenFGA URL + B5 depends_on + I3/I4 profiles)\n\nci-gate-infra STATUS FAIL nedeni: compose retirement sonrası grep check''leri empty result\nset -e ile exit 1. 4 check Faz 18.5-18.7 scope''unda retired:\n- B1 OpenFGA URL consistency → K8s authoritative no-op\n- B5 OpenFGA depends_on openfga-migrate → K8s init-container no-op\n- I3 Dev SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local → K8s ConfigMap\n- I4 Prod SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod → K8s ConfigMap\n\nResult: 52 PASS + 0 FAIL + 20 WARN → STATUS PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba2f2205c6d041044fed2c69c10c45cf04fda75f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/ba2f2205c6d041044fed2c69c10c45cf04fda75f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/d2ca8f01ec4ac76e733306d3d0a022a0d3f8e63c","verification":{"payload":"tree ba2f2205c6d041044fed2c69c10c45cf04fda75f\nparent 2227a40b44b6087a7235c9240100b5319bfcc5e6\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1777052887 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777052887 +0300\n\nFaz 18.5-18.7 — App stateless compose retirement (11 blok + deploy script cleanup) (#553)\n\n* deploy(compose): Faz 18.5-18.7 app stateless retirement (11 service blok + deploy script cleanup)\n\n11 compose service bloğu tombstone comment''e dönüştürüldü (service-manager + vault pattern):\n- discovery-server (ADR Faz 19 migration scope notu eklendi: user \"discovery service i almayı unutma\")\n- openfga-migrate + openfga (K8s StatefulSet authoritative, parity Codex gate 019dc07c PASS)\n- permission-service, auth-service, user-service, variant