ly@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"deploy(prod): Faz 18.3 PR-B service-manager runtime retire + doctor cleanup (#551)\n\n## Faz 18.3 Cross-Repo — PR-B (backend/deploy)\n\nParent: platform-k8s-gitops PLAN.md §Faz 18.3\nCodex thread 019dbfa5 iter-4 AGREE (scope expansion, 9 dosya)\nRelated: platform-ssot PR #550 (Faz 18.3 PR-A web/MFE)\n         platform-k8s-gitops PR #100/101 (edge tombstone + canli deploy PASS)\n\n## Expanded Scope (Codex iter-4)\n\nCodex: \"Runtime/deploy yüzeyi yalnız service-manager-api.js degil. Aksi halde\nroute kalksa bile template, doctor veya local extras profili drift uretmeye\ndevam eder.\"\n\n## Kaldirilan (9 dosya)\n\n1. **backend/scripts/service-manager-api.js** — DELETED\n   Docker socket Node.js API, cross-realm control plane (start/stop/restart/logs).\n\n2. **backend/docker-compose.yml:428** service-manager service blok\n   Extras profile — local dev için Docker socket access. Yorum arsivi blog.\n\n3. **deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml:551** service-manager prod service blok\n   Prod compose service-manager container. Yorum arsivi blog.\n\n4. **deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml:582** NGINX_SERVICE_MANAGER_UPSTREAM env\n   web-nginx environment''tan kaldirildi.\n\n5. **backend/scripts/package.json** — script blok temizlendi\n   \"service-manager\": \"node service-manager-api.js\" npm script kaldirildi.\n   dependencies (dockerode, express) sifir.\n\n6. **deploy/nginx/default.conf.template:70-77** /api/services/ location blok\n   Template yeniden uretimde drift geri sizmasin diye kaldirildi.\n\n7. **deploy/ubuntu/run-frontend-nginx-container.sh**\n   NGINX_SERVICE_MANAGER_UPSTREAM default degeri ve template icindeki\n   /api/services/ location blok kaldirildi.\n\n8. **deploy/ubuntu/deploy-backend.sh:589** `compose up ... service-manager`\n   Service up list''ten kaldirildi.\n\n9. **deploy/ubuntu/platform-start.sh:41** `$COMPOSE up -d ... service-manager`\n   Start script''ten kaldirildi.\n\n**Plus:** backend/scripts/doctor-infra.sh — A2 + B6 service-manager check''ler\nno-op retired pass''e cevrildi (drift check gereksiz, compose blok yok).\n\n## Cross-Repo Flow\n\nPR-B merge sonrasi host ops (AYRI explicit user onayi):\n```bash\nssh staging-sw\ndocker compose stop platform-service-manager-1\n# smoke: ai.acik.com/api/services/ HALA 410 (edge tombstone), diger route 200\ndocker compose rm -f platform-service-manager-1\n```\n\nBu adim icin user \"prod edge deploy 30-day permission\" kapsamina girmez;\n**ayri explicit destructive ops onayi** gerek (Codex iter-4 guardrail).\n\n## Test\n\n- [x] Bash syntax: deploy-backend.sh + platform-start.sh + run-frontend.sh + doctor-infra.sh OK\n- [x] Worktree-mode light gate PASS (secrets + schema-policy + backend-lint)\n- [x] doctor-infra.sh A2+B6 no-op retired\n- [ ] Canli deploy: user ayri onay + ssh staging-sw docker compose stop/rm\n- [ ] platform-k8s-gitops final route removal PR (2026-05-01 sonrasi, 0 hit gozlem)\n\n## Referanslar\n\n- platform-k8s-gitops PLAN §Faz 18.3\n- platform-k8s-gitops PR #100 (5040249): /api/services 410 config\n- platform-k8s-gitops PR #101 (b610509): canli deploy PASS\n- platform-ssot PR #550: Faz 18.3 PR-A web/MFE admin UI\n- Codex thread 019dbfa5 iter-4 AGREE (scope expansion evidence-based)\n- ADR-0002 D6 (compose stateful korunur — degismez)\n- D34 Environment Independence (platform-k8s-gitops PLAN §Faz 18.0)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8f770f16e08852da2affc301fd27cd3c9dab265","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/d8f770f16e08852da2affc301fd27cd3c9dab265"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/8b764591b71951ec51248bb7f70e767ee3d9f3af","verification":{"payload":"tree d8f770f16e08852da2affc301fd27cd3c9dab265\nparent ee35d09c712e33f4d549253e5cea990d874429d7\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1777045366 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777045366 +0300\n\ndeploy(prod): Faz 18.3 PR-B servi