ops-only SSH/runbook\n    aciklamasi — user direktif \"GitHub private runbook linki KOYMA\")\n- Retirement notice banner: \"Service Control panel kaldirildi (Faz 18.3)\"\n- /api/services/ HTTP 410 Gone reference\n- Docker socket start/stop/restart/logs write-op yuzeyi TAM kaldirildi\n- useServiceManager import + cagri YOK (bundle grep: zero reference)\n\n### 4 dosya silme\n\n- ServiceCard.tsx\n- ServiceLogDrawer.tsx\n- useServiceManager.ts\n- ServiceHealthSummaryWidget.tsx (home/widgets/)\n\n### ShellHeader.tsx permission check (Codex P0 hidden risk)\n\nSatir 69 unconditional `/admin/services` link permission check olmadan\nekleniyor idi. `canThemeAdmin` permission check ekledim — Sidebar.tsx:60\npattern simetrik. ServiceControlPage artik statik Ops Links oldugundan\n`canThemeAdmin` pragmatic permission (admin erisimi).\n\n### i18n descriptions (4 dil)\n\n- de: ''Dienste'' → ''Ops Links''; ''Dienststatus'' → ''ArgoCD + Grafana + runbook''\n- en: ''Services'' → ''Ops Links''; ''Service health status'' → ''ArgoCD + Grafana + runbook''\n- es: ''Servicios'' → ''Enlaces Ops''; ''Estado de salud...'' → ''ArgoCD + Grafana + runbook''\n- tr: ''Servisler'' → ''Ops Baglantilari''; ''Servis saglik durumu'' → ''ArgoCD + Grafana + runbook''\n\n## Test\n\n- [x] grep ''/api/services'' src/**: sadece comment (zero fetch call)\n- [x] grep ''ServiceHealthSummary|useServiceManager'' src/**: zero orphan\n- [x] ArgoCD + Grafana canli smoke 200 (2026-04-24)\n- [x] Local gate worktree-mode PASS (secrets + schema-policy + web-lint)\n- [ ] Canli deploy: bundle build + mfe-shell rollout → ayri PR-B ile paralel\n\n## Cross-Repo Flow\n\nPR-A (bu) merge sonrasi:\n- /admin/services UI''da Ops Links gosterir (Docker state YOK)\n- /api/services edge 410 Gone (zaten canli, PR #101)\n\nPR-B (takip):\n- backend/scripts/service-manager-api.js retire\n- deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml platform-service-manager-1 blok kaldir\n- deploy/nginx/default.conf.template + deploy/ubuntu/*.sh cleanup\n- backend/docker-compose.yml extras profili\n- doctor-infra.sh + package.json drift onleme\n- Container stop/rm (ayri explicit onay)\n\nRuntime endpoint /api/services/ retirement PR-B''de takip ediyor.\n\n## Kabul Kriteri (Codex iter-4 + user)\n\n- [x] ShellHeader /admin/services linki permission check\n- [x] /admin/services artik Docker service listesi GOSTERMIYOR\n- [x] frontend bundle icinde /api/services cagrisi KALMADI\n- [x] Argo/Grafana linkleri canli dogrulandi\n- [x] Runbook linki DISABLED (public link yok)\n- [x] Worktree-mode light gate PASS\n- [ ] Runtime endpoint henuz kaldirilmadi; PR-B takip ediyor\n\n## Referanslar\n\n- platform-k8s-gitops PLAN §Faz 18.3\n- platform-k8s-gitops PR #100 (5040249): /api/services 410 config\n- platform-k8s-gitops PR #101 (b610509): canli deploy PASS\n- Codex thread 019dbfa5 iter-4 AGREE (9 madde evidence-based)\n- ADR-0002 D6 (compose stateful korunur — degismez)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* contract: delivery_scope + ux_contract admin/service-control + i18n locales coverage\n\nFeature execution contract artifact_globs + delivery_scope + ux_contract path_glob\ngenişletildi PR-A dosyaları için:\n\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/pages/admin/service-control/* (delivery_scope + ux_contract)\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/pages/home/widgets/*.tsx (delivery_scope)\n- web/packages/i18n-dicts/src/locales/*/common.ts (delivery_scope)\n\nContract check status: OK, 0 errors (6 scoped changed files covered).\n\nRefs: platform-ssot PR #550 (Faz 18.3 PR-A), Codex thread 019dbfa5 iter-4\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* contract: ux_change_map — 6 yeni entry Faz 18.3 PR-A dosyalar\\u0131\n\n- ShellHeader.tsx (consistency_and_pattern_governance/single_component_source_of_truth)\n- ServiceControlPage.tsx (consistency_and_pattern_governance/single_component_source_of_truth)\n- i18n-dicts/src/locales/{de,en,es,tr}/common.ts (trust_privacy_security_ux/least_privilege_interac