od/kustomization.yaml: frontend → platform-ssot-frontend\n- overlays/test/kustomization.yaml: frontend → platform-ssot-frontend-testai\n\nSub_filter hack kaldırılabilir (host nginx default.conf testai block sadeleşir).\nPR sonrası planlanan: host-compose/proxy/conf/nginx.conf + k8s-gitops overlay update.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"757524b244cb3c81af8e5606e6d44497f3188775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/757524b244cb3c81af8e5606e6d44497f3188775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/216984109936ff76fa862469edc33e148825a166","verification":{"payload":"tree 757524b244cb3c81af8e5606e6d44497f3188775\nparent dac571f468f9780742bb77dd514d7401d1b35b13\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776676500 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776676500 +0300\n\nfeat(frontend): Dockerfile ARG + matrix build (prod + testai env-per-build) (#534)\n\nADR-0002 Faz E env-per-build (host nginx sub_filter hack kaldırma hazırlığı):\n\nDockerfile ARG''lar:\n- VITE_KEYCLOAK_URL (default ai.acik.com)\n- VITE_KEYCLOAK_REALM (default serban)\n- VITE_KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_ID (default frontend)\n- VITE_FRONTEND_PUBLIC_ORIGIN (default ai.acik.com)\n- VITE_GATEWAY_URL (default ai.acik.com)\n- VITE_AUTH_MODE (default keycloak)\n\nENV''lere pass edildi → webpack DefinePlugin build-time inline → runtime''da\nprocess.env[key] bulur (auth-config.ts''teki getEnvValue öncelik sırası).\n\nWorkflow matrix:\n- prod: ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-ssot-frontend:sha-<short> (ai.acik.com + serban)\n- testai: ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-ssot-frontend-testai:sha-<short>\n  (testai.acik.com + platform-test)\n\nk8s-gitops overlay bump:\n- overlays/prod/kustomization.yaml: frontend → platform-ssot-frontend\n- overlays/test/kustomization.yaml: frontend → platform-ssot-frontend-testai\n\nSub_filter hack kaldırılabilir (host nginx default.conf testai block sadeleşir).\nPR sonrası planlanan: host-compose/proxy/conf/nginx.conf + k8s-gitops overlay update.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5e6UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXfUQADktcZP+0W+aZsNL4uzUFFk4\nOSlMdnX/YHSlqUdkBA2Cx20/BnC2iHkNuchA7m1KbxtGa14zyvPALBCyMMGI9Sn0\n0PfhH3QUavvPeIWKCCuDWTKSJ77Uy12fXW0740hQE3d+4ZKjdaGM0t/LgtQ0lNOE\nr1F3BqFkZoyU+meZLdgJfNSAHctDJjVVmAxSauuR6AHJGjD/A4DtefUjpwjBzzUR\nz4BNERcHIaswevR2ToxTr9lQNVTxREXZI/BCGymRI3MIfPU6+JljfyEpv23+uAUi\nlajcI1bD7SOFUcos3LhkGpqxUvwH2T2Q6d+9uL96OGpAleDRkek7YHm5VAP2CASL\nj/w+DAhU3j4d10vORuocp13eoEYoOnN9798EDV/rDsNWu9Wj0kfl9r/DZ24JX7nj\nKgmupJk+Wy7kvCqqAWwk+JMbSnnSKLiFJLepdnNzYjfzjv3ucrh5YpYWSe3CJR5C\n6HVjYR6ZSoFyQcy4zDPwU58pugvhucFpQ7zIuZ9nf7m0ekv56EqhJyyvlxKgmE5X\nZp1+ydYS5ygOBlIpf5at5X62AsimMXpCtke6hqnaxr4cvZxJW7jbcn4V8QT/Zjl9\nCliM2GpLVkiSMQgW53Z9fhJdFPDxsGQ4hB6o9xwDkhL1bP1dsKYDt7yruJU+YCS6\n/u4Mr1HnnW+C/h8fqatk\n=PIOV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-20T09:15:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https