ep.yml failed with:\n  KC token mint failed (status=401)\n  {\"error\":\"invalid_grant\",\"error_description\":\"Invalid user credentials\"}\n\nRoot cause: the initial wire used `PW_REAL_USER_PASSWORD` which belongs\nto user3@example.com (for stage-keycloak-smoke-user). The compare\nendpoint requires AUDIT.manager, so the script needs admin@example.com.\n\nFix: swap to a dedicated `STAGING_ADMIN_PASS` GH secret (added today,\nvalue = known stage admin password).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df9237b29512eed9afa30fcafe3a8bfa82f02a27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/df9237b29512eed9afa30fcafe3a8bfa82f02a27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/dac571f468f9780742bb77dd514d7401d1b35b13","verification":{"payload":"tree df9237b29512eed9afa30fcafe3a8bfa82f02a27\nparent 04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776666369 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776666369 +0300\n\nfix(ops): use STAGING_ADMIN_PASS secret for audit-compare sweep (#532)\n\nFirst dispatch of staging-audit-compare-sweep.yml failed with:\n  KC token mint failed (status=401)\n  {\"error\":\"invalid_grant\",\"error_description\":\"Invalid user credentials\"}\n\nRoot cause: the initial wire used `PW_REAL_USER_PASSWORD` which belongs\nto user3@example.com (for stage-keycloak-smoke-user). The compare\nendpoint requires AUDIT.manager, so the script needs admin@example.com.\n\nFix: swap to a dedicated `STAGING_ADMIN_PASS` GH secret (added today,\nvalue = known stage admin password).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5ccBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdo8QAGFrfMpiUyGJM08P0FZDK9dJ\nquH9zNzQZhmaI/N/MAmi7EXPUpiVNKsDni/B9TNsIQNu/ygK21EKBXquFgI2adbH\n6dauhCRuVYgr5UMjLJ40/ABteykycUQYKf5DeZpgayD/gW9uParCNb2rpxCx7QHB\nNxumuZvLaMMHPoojmupN4xa6