252c0ababb581c51cc277"}],"sha":"dac571f468f9780742bb77dd514d7401d1b35b13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/dac571f468f9780742bb77dd514d7401d1b35b13"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T06:19:17Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T06:19:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ops): daily audit-compare sweep workflow (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 monitoring) (#531)\n\nAutomates parity-evidence collection for the audit cutover so the operator\ncan see verdict history over days/weeks before promoting Faz 4 (read-path\ncleanup) and Faz 5 (user_audit_events table drop).\n\n## Workflow (`staging-audit-compare-sweep.yml`)\n- Runs daily at 04:00 UTC on the stage self-hosted runner\n- Workflow_dispatch for manual triage (page + pageSize inputs)\n- 90-day artifact retention (longer than error-sweep''s 30d since parity is\n  a slower-moving signal)\n- Exit-code mapping:\n    0 → verdict=clean                       green\n    1 → id-drift / count-drift / field-drift  yellow (warn annotation)\n    2 → user-service-unreachable / endpoint-error  red (fail workflow)\n\n## Script (`staging-audit-compare-sweep.sh`)\n1. Mints sweeper token via `staging-sweeper` KC client (requires GH secret\n   `STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET`, provisioned earlier).\n2. Calls `/api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50`.\n3. Parses diff verdict + extracts summary stats (totals, id-set sizes,\n   field-diff samples).\n4. Writes JSON to `.cache/reports/audit-compare-sweep-<ts>.json`.\n5. Exits with verdict-mapped code.\n\n## Artifact schema (summary fields)\n- `verdict`\n- `permissionTotal`, `userServiceTotal`, `totalDelta`\n- `permissionOnlyCount`, `userServiceOnlyCount`, `commonCount`, `fieldDiffCount`\n- `fieldDiffSamples` (first 5)\n- `userServiceErrors`\n- `diff` (full, with id lists truncated at 200 entries)\n\n## Faz 4/5 readiness criteria (proposed)\n- Faz 4 (delete user-service AuditEventController.java): verdict `clean`\n  or `id-drift` only for 7 consecutive days AND no `field-drift` for 14 days\n- Faz 5 (drop user_audit_events): Faz 4 shipped + 30 days + retention policy\n\nThese criteria land in the roadmap tracking issue (separate follow-up).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2d5789edf63703001ab3b59d9d64ccb058f152c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/f2d5789edf63703001ab3b59d9d64ccb058f152c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277","verification":{"payload":"tree f2d5789edf63703001ab3b59d9d64ccb058f152c\nparent 6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776665957 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776665957 +0300\n\nfeat(ops): daily audit-compare sweep workflow (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 monitoring) (#531)\n\nAutomates parity-evidence collection for the audit cutover so the operator\ncan see verdict history over days/weeks before promoting Faz 4 (read-path\ncleanup) and Faz 5 (user_audit_events table drop).\n\n## Workflow (`staging-audit-compare-sweep.yml`)\n- Runs daily at 04:00 UTC on the stage self-hosted runner\n- Workflow_dispatch for manual triage (page + pageSize inputs)\n- 90-day artifact retention (longer than error-sweep''s 30d since parity is\n  a slower-moving signal)\n- Exit-code mapping:\n    0 → verdict=clean                       green\n    1 → id-drift / count-drift / field-drift  yellow (warn annotation)\n    2 → user-service-unreachable / endpoint-error  red (fail workflow)\n\n## Script (`staging-audit-compare-sweep.sh`)\n1. Mints sweeper token via `staging-sweeper` KC client (requires GH secret\n   `STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET`, provisioned earlier).\n2. Calls `/api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50`.\n3. Parses diff verdict + extracts summary stats (totals, id-set sizes,\n   field-diff samples).\n4. Writes JSON to `.cache/reports/audit-compare-sweep-<ts>.json`.\n5. Exits with verdict-mapped code.\n\n## Artifact schema (summary fields)\n- `verdict`\n- `permissionTotal`, `userServiceTotal`, `totalDelta`\n- `permissionOnlyCount`, `userServiceOnlyCount`, `commonCount`, `fieldDiffCount`\n- `fieldDiffSamples` (first 5)\n- `userServiceErrors`\n- `diff` (full, with id lists truncated at 200 entries)\n\n## Faz 4/5 readiness criteria (proposed)\n- Faz 4 (delete user-service AuditEventController.java): verdict `clean`\n  or `id-drift` only for 7 consecutive days AND no `field-drift` for 14 days\n- Faz 5 (drop user_audit_events): Faz 4 shipped + 30 days + retention policy\n\nThese criteria land in the roadmap tracking issue (separate follow-up).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5cVlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADRYQAA2QsTv0lsdo5F46Ie7itnIb\n4EMHa2+qv0sABAQ5A2oEmU20ytzVDBltz3BI17m86SrnfiWhve9xXN6N5aHA7wR8\nEDc7JzucLXJi/G0KUOv40XuBzDJXRoTUrqaYrUaK/u4xJ5AIo5it+tLAROW0j8l9\nYCtPUDK+2tffc3D9MtYoRFrDSOgGRJcVr8doTNZCyslTqGn04VLuCnubZWtmumhS\nQXP7deck63J5ioGqXsX4GAJU56R0GBE4sSYVWecxfPWXOExHVYhi/MztlrE+Uu4t\nQ/OehOy93HDa0jY8Y05mKfDynK+7EEBRTNAZHazKmpSmq+udfRIFYcXsiFEZl5Ko\n8+pVCKMJ2aqIJo+WzhBj0+hCoyc0UarNtbSfEujjgmzQDmAECYDuD0p7QFyGnamR\nS4JbntbwOxI811hMk3gMkzZEswWTf6sRt/06ARGg4gxK3Er/rQ39UbvuZg9mYMQV\nOGgwNaN0UcG41W/oI/hThCXRtHCE9C6RNSFLuc08sTajrh+3qVbFO8nFVNr2HjaH\nBem87yUwq2nPOSk6jWm0AVYVRq7v4hU9obNhntf8WcuW8Yy4dINmnADixyRxQHQ2\nCRbU+JY7ybi9kC1mE58H52uEiNeQOAq3gSe3Hr3Oheb1uAHqlvSlLglqBPeVo1l4\nrVbQAOGtkHUugdDeDJCi\n=wkmz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-20T06:19:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDA0NDE3YjZlZDA4ZDkzYTRiMTQyNTJjMGFiYWJiNTgxYzUxY2MyNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872","sha":"6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872"}],"sha":"04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/04417b6ed08d93a4b14252c0ababb581c51cc277"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T05:48:48Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T05:48:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): persist AUDIT_BACKEND_URI + STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET across deploys (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 1/2 v1.2) (#528)\n\nPost-Faz 1/2 deploy revealed the \"staging canonical env drift\" class:\nrender-backend-env.sh regenerates /home/halil/platform/env/backend.env\nfrom Vault KV on every deploy, wiping manual additions. My two operator-\napplied vars (AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE,\nSTAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET=...) survived exactly one deploy cycle\nbefore render wiped them, silently reverting the audit cutover flag\nand breaking the compare endpoint''s KC token mint.\n\n## Fix chain\n1. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh` — new write_kv_if_present\n   calls near the end append AUDIT_BACKEND_URI + STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET\n   from script env to the rendered backend.env (preserving them across\n   every deploy without needing a Vault KV entry).\n2. `deploy/ubuntu/deploy-backend.sh` — forward both env vars when\n   invoking render-backend-env.sh via either token or approle path.\n3. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env-approle.sh` — same env-var pass-\n   through at the inner invocation.\n4. `.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml` — Deploy step exposes both:\n   - `AUDIT_BACKEND_URI: ${{ vars.AUDIT_BACKEND_URI || ''lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE'' }}`\n     (repo var override for rollback; default = consolidation target)\n   - `STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET: ${{ secrets.STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET }}`\n     (GH secret provisioned earlier by QLTY-PROACTIVE-05)\n\n## Behavior\n- First deploy after merge: render script picks up both env values, writes\n  them to canonical env → compose picks them up → gateway routes[5] flag\n  active + sweeper secret available for compare endpoint tests.\n- Rollback path: set repo variable AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://USER-SERVICE and\n  re-run deploy-backend → flag reverted.\n- Cleanup in Faz 4: drop these four block entries when route[5] is\n  hardcoded and sweeper client deprecated.\n\n## Verified (stage, before this fix)\n```\n# After fresh deploy, canonical env had neither var:\n$ grep -cE \"AUDIT_BACKEND_URI|STAGING_SWEEPER\" backend.env\n0\n```\n\n## Will verify (stage, after merge+deploy)\n- Both vars present in canonical env\n- api-gateway picks up AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE\n- compare endpoint returns non-401 with fresh sweeper token\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f3013be5114dd14ebdbb12ee3f3303c5464d3cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/0f3013be5114dd14ebdbb12ee3f3303c5464d3cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/6a43312054cb38dac40507726321f22bc0ec1872","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f3013be5114dd14ebdbb12ee3f3303c5464d3cc\nparent fb09fc9e2b090dc4c3e555d5ab3b63383f6e5c82\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776664128 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776664128 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): persist AUDIT_BACKEND_URI + STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET across deploys (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 1/2 v1.2) (#528)\n\nPost-Faz 1/2 deploy revealed the \"staging canonical env drift\" class:\nrender-backend-env.sh regenerates /home/halil/platform/env/backend.env\nfrom Vault KV on every deploy, wiping manual additions. My two operator-\napplied vars (AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE,\nSTAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET=...) survived exactly one deploy cycle\nbefore render wiped them, silently reverting the audit cutover flag\nand breaking the compare endpoint''s KC token mint.\n\n## Fix chain\n1. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh` — new write_kv_if_present\n   calls near the end append AUDIT_BACKEND_URI + STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET\n   from script env to the rendered backend.env (preserving them across\n   every deploy without needing a Vault KV entry).\n2. `deploy/ubuntu/deploy-backend.sh` — forward both env vars when\n   invoking render-backend-env.sh via either token or approle path.\n3. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env-approle.sh` — same env-var pass-\n   through at the inner invocation.\n4. `.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml` — Deploy step exposes both:\n   - `AUDIT_BACKEND_URI: ${{ vars.AUDIT_BACKEND_URI || ''lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE'' }}`\n     (repo var override for rollback; default = consolidation target)\n   - `STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET: ${{ secrets.STAGING_SWEEPER_CLIENT_SECRET }}`\n     (GH secret provisioned earlier by QLTY-PROACTIVE-05)\n\n## Behavior\n- First deploy after merge: render script picks up both env values, writes\n  them to canonical env → compose picks them up → gateway routes[5] flag\n  active + sweeper secret available for compare endpoint tests.\n- Rollback path: set repo variable AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://USER-SERVICE and\n  re-run deploy-backend → flag reverted.\n- Cleanup in Faz 4: drop these four block entries when route[5] is\n  hardcoded and sweeper client deprecated.\n\n## Verified (stage, before this fix)\n```\n# After fresh deploy, canonical env had neither var:\n$ grep -cE \"AUDIT_BACKEND_URI|STAGING_SWEEPER\" backend.env\n0\n```\n\n## Will verify (stage, after merge+deploy)\n- Both vars present in canonical env\n- api-gateway picks up AUDIT_BACKEND_URI=lb://PERMISSION-SERVICE\n- compare endpoint returns non-401 with fresh sweeper token\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5b5ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQDwQAJPQSmRDjJmr+WqcuM7lvSYg\n1Aw9ca6FYIRkprvzXvTyVlwbsVcm9CH3/NKsWMvdmIovOYWsuhFqIgbL3KShHnCQ\nZYz0vcaSsxLCrBbRvZZZQxdZX0yfehbaEcnKUF1Oxsv7SJDMmC6yfntB/k+vuhkM\nHFzghoFyrdvaRDxqIh2gCF9gA1IKiw8Yljo9cUOuimAhw9pmx4SyiA2KVjG11Zft\nVOvdYgC0cxhRvFWhHIUSXZgrNhyN6sgci/i6sIODv95ZMjLeEafrjbhHsd3nhlhg\nZrwuj+QYLdiZpBqNj8SANoojmQ5En1rC58qmDORStM+B7jp7mR5ugxc8zBSwMaBj\nHXT/sh/5kEr2rl8f3c7/1siNOxLQ/Ao2+aZ+NjegPkbbxY7bdViiqS8+ilX1Fgdr\n+AXzUtQ6yV3Sq+89zwd79ZLHWrL2DYnrOeBXOdXFxPn1oUeZPVVBiyOR53XteFBb\ngxJOTTHuo4svHkHv6FS20J0dX/5hNeElMzWD7PhzyfDpSyvhLFNBuAM5CpQQnDgh\nFicbU9kY1q4a7TauBM0ofC7YvNoa75CqNECg+S19yPEkD40uAoZZDjHeDZSnBwV1\nt7XwKSkuDF+P6JEVmqxeIxvgrRMiEdQhi0Lj93ViommWdfl1e+dZVXqj30/8qHqU\nyckcEpz2COvSnYGMrbkh\n=kGFI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-20T05:48:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.