s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/fb09fc9e2b090dc4c3e555d5ab3b63383f6e5c82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T01:10:43Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T01:10:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(frontend): Dockerfile COPY . . (scripts/+configs missing) (#526)\n\n* fix(frontend): Dockerfile COPY . . + .dockerignore (scripts/+configs missing)\n\nProblem: Build 2. attempt FAIL with ''Cannot find module /app/scripts/deploy/build-single-domain.mjs''\nRoot cause: Dockerfile only COPY''d apps+packages+design-tokens+tsconfig+vite.config+webpack.config,\neksik: scripts/, eslint.config.mjs, .npmrc, vb.\n\nFix:\n- COPY . . (tüm web/ kaynağı) + .dockerignore exclude node_modules+dist+cache+logs\n- pnpm@9 → pnpm@10 (lockfile 10.12.4 ile uyumlu, önceki build log''undan tespit)\n\nCache layer''ı: package.json+pnpm-lock+workspace+.npmrc önce (deps stable),\nsonra COPY . . + pnpm install + build (source değişince cache invalidate).\n\n.dockerignore içeriği:\n- node_modules (all levels)\n- dist, build, .cache, coverage\n- playwright-report, test-results, .turbo, *.log, .DS_Store, IDE dirs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(contract): cover web/.dockerignore (delivery_scope + ux_catalog)\n\n- feature_execution_contract.v1.json: delivery_scope.change_path_globs + ux_contract.artifacts\n- ux_change_map.v1.json: entry added (consistency_and_pattern_governance)\n\nFix PR #526 enforcement-check + module-delivery-contract-check 2 errors\n(delivery_scope:uncovered_change + ux_contract:uncovered_ui_change).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cd2061c8b3ee206053c280881bfa7d5c4394c81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/8cd2061c8b3ee206053c280881bfa7d5c4394c81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/fb09fc9e2b090dc4c3e555d5ab3b63383f6e5c82","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cd2061c8b3ee206053c280881bfa7d5c4394c81\nparent 4a10c760288bb98888461663d2a328c2b7390283\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776647443 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776647443 +0300\n\nfix(frontend): Dockerfile COPY . . (scripts/+configs missing) (#526)\n\n* fix(frontend): Dockerfile COPY . . + .dockerignore (scripts/+configs missing)\n\nProblem: Build 2. attempt FAIL with ''Cannot find module /app/scripts/deploy/build-single-domain.mjs''\nRoot cause: Dockerfile only COPY''d apps+packages+design-tokens+tsconfig+vite.config+webpack.config,\neksik: scripts/, eslint.config.mjs, .npmrc, vb.\n\nFix:\n- COPY . . (tüm web/ kaynağı) + .dockerignore exclude node_modules+dist+cache+logs\n- pnpm@9 → pnpm@10 (lockfile 10.12.4 ile uyumlu, önceki build log''undan tespit)\n\nCache layer''ı: package.json+pnpm-lock+workspace+.npmrc önce (deps stable),\nsonra COPY . . + pnpm install + build (source değişince cache invalidate).\n\n.dockerignore içeriği:\n- node_modules (all levels)\n- dist, build, .cache, coverage\n- playwright-report, test-results, .turbo, *.log, .DS_Store, IDE dirs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(contract): cover web/.dockerignore (delivery_scope + ux_catalog)\n\n- feature_execution_contract.v1.json: delivery_scope.change_path_globs + ux_contract.artifacts\n- ux_change_map.v1.json: entry added (consistency_and_pattern_governance)\n\nF