"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(audit): forward caller Bearer to user-service in compare (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 v1.1) (#527)\n\nPost-deploy smoke of compare endpoint showed:\n  verdict=user-service-unreachable\n  userServiceErrors=[''user-service fetch failed: ... HTTP 401'']\n\nRoot cause: AuditCompareService.fetchUserService did not include any\nAuthorization header, but user-service''s SecurityConfig applies\n`authenticated()` by default even though the specific endpoint\n(/api/audit/events) has no @RequireModule guard.\n\nFix: forward the caller''s Authorization header from the compare\ncontroller to the user-service HTTP call. Admin tokens with AUDIT.manager\nalso carry user-service audience (staging-sweeper client provisioned by\nQLTY-PROACTIVE-05 carries all 7 service auds), so forwarding works\nwithout a service-token mint.\n\nPreserves back-compat: compare(int, int) still available without\nauthHeader (tests + legacy callers).\n\nVerified on stage:\n  BEFORE this fix: verdict=user-service-unreachable (401 upstream)\n  AFTER  this fix: verdict=clean or field-drift (real signal)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c638c6cfc64029c81046427540575cbb4c89f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/4c638c6cfc64029c81046427540575cbb4c89f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/4a10c760288bb98888461663d2a328c2b7390283","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c638c6cfc64029c81046427540575cbb4c89f7f\nparent 9f609640d0b4b932960d7f215243f71640cb06ca\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776645044 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776645044 +0300\n\nfix(audit): forward caller Bearer to user-service in compare (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 v1.1) (#527)\n\nPost-deploy smoke of compare endpoint showed:\n  verdict=user-service-unreachable\n  userServiceErrors=[''user-service fetch failed: ... HTTP 401'']\n\nRoot cause: AuditCompareService.fetchUserService did not include any\nAuthorization header, but user-service''s SecurityConfig applies\n`authenticated()` by default even though the specific endpoint\n(/api/audit/events) has no @RequireModule guard.\n\nFix: forward the caller''s Authorization header from the compare\ncontroller to the user-service HTTP call. Admin tokens with AUDIT.manager\nalso carry user-service audience (staging-sweeper client provisioned by\nQLTY-PROACTIVE-05 carries all 7 service auds), so forwarding works\nwithout a service-token mint.\n\nPreserves back-compat: compare(int, int) still available without\nauthHeader (tests + legacy callers).\n\nVerified on stage:\n  BEFORE this fix: verdict=user-service-unreachable (401 upstream)\n  AFTER  this fix: verdict=clean or field-drift (real signal)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5XO0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADtwQAGvekgca97vFDWsPKA5VbXpP\npYEl+K5F1wUhrLsZLZOfosuPobVZae5inAfEQPbpYLj7ff+YSOj3EGF7r0rO6lLL\nrL81jj/WjYq1GxLX5s8j6A9tyylZr02XMJcmesAuy8kOjG8FRDJuQKI0beOESOCQ\nwleGZFLT9Kaug6Yu+d+rzLtnMREi8pX7VLCHqg85SOnu1vEGTXIdywp0bsO4ADSG\nJO9eE6L9NZQFPj2pTf38Cf9b0ltTgbMylabrdn196BArB06hR2dcYuF9eKJTo8Ue\nyTDZt3biTLJyyxHJy8XJ7uhyQr885F84rV0QH/jyFQBikB/5GbFFFOEQrcX2ayWL\naB/4DMgTaOzqxxe50+L4APR6Qf9EqaihotuIiFDOF+zQDZOTY2UhxiX89YzrNnqO\ncFL5VnkO9PNLTZqvpGvdFkMKxzGWNQMXSMqu1cANh2I0l7bzXf/TETL88tFHOezi\nLT1bhZyUfhQToY4AbQEEBQ7ryteHCZbaixQ/Xm4KbL7+4+V38E0hLkgvoi74Q4So\nDdQeDnRREa+KmM5V3opHn9OWxaNPsMC5qV9EOlspMMcNGl0fo4yyRniEQ2g4dP8j\nhnP0vGf5DxBqruqV4u5bIdD8olXVpyKZgzSxlDIEDp/AixtLhoy4J9iObFWvL+bd\nhWjVrHlCqicc9clPX87y\n=v14+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-20T00:30:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_u