Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/981b03cc65fea3623d01e7b427928100aa5e905b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T00:10:29Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T00:10:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(frontend): K8s MFE Docker image + GHCR push workflow (ADR-0002 Faz B kapanış) (#522)\n\n* feat(frontend): K8s MFE Docker image + GHCR push workflow\n\nADR-0002 Faz B kapanış (testai/ai UI artifact gap).\n\nMevcut deploy-web.yml host nginx volume mount pattern''i compose için\nkalır (ai.acik.com şu an bu yolu kullanıyor). Bu PR K8s deployment\niçin Docker image üretir:\n  ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-ssot-frontend:sha-<short>\n\nYapı:\n1. web/Dockerfile (multi-stage: pnpm build + nginx serve)\n   - Stage 1: node:22-alpine + pnpm install + build:ubuntu:single-domain\n   - Stage 2: nginx:1.27-alpine + COPY dist/ubuntu-single-domain\n   - Cache strategy: index.html no-store, /assets immutable\n   - /healthz endpoint\n2. .github/workflows/frontend-image.yml\n   - Trigger: web/** push veya manuel\n   - GHCR login + buildx + push (sha + main-stable)\n   - Summary''de k8s overlay bump snippet\n\nK8s entegrasyon (ayrı PR k8s-gitops):\n  kustomize/base/apps/frontend/deployment.yaml image: ghcr.io/.../frontend:sha-<short>\n  Mevcut: nginx:1.27-alpine (içeriksiz)\n\nMevcut deploy-web.yml etkilenmedi (compose deploy paralel devam).\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md (Frontend MFE Dilim 4)\n      ADR-0002 Faz B test authoritative live\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(contract): cover web/Dockerfile + frontend-image.yml in delivery scope\n\nfeature_execution_contract.v1.json:\n- delivery_scope.change_path_globs: add web/Dockerfile + .github/workflows/frontend-image.yml\n- ux_contract.artifacts: add web/Dockerfile (K8s deployment artifact, trust_privacy_security_ux theme)\n\nFix: PR #522 enforcement-check + module-delivery-contract-check 2 errors\n(delivery_scope:uncovered_change + ux_contract:uncovered_ui_change for web/Dockerfile)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(ux-catalog): map web/Dockerfile to consistency_and_pattern_governance\n\nux_change_map.v1.json: add web/Dockerfile entry (single_component_source_of_truth subtheme)\n\nFix: PR #522 ux_catalog_enforcement gate missing_mappings=1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fcbcd9437d22be684772e895d51360906ef0ff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/7fcbcd9437d22be684772e895d51360906ef0ff2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/981b03cc65fea3623d01e7b427928100aa5e905b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7fcbcd9437d22be684772e895d51360906ef0ff2\nparent 28921ad287ee65fbe48a56b69c9f506436084b19\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776643829 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776643829 +0300\n\nfeat(frontend): K8s MFE Docker image + GHCR push workflow (ADR-0002 Faz B kapanış) (#522)\n\n* feat(frontend): K8s MFE Docker image + GHCR push workflow\n\nADR-0002 Faz B kapanış (testai/ai UI artifact gap).\n\nMevcut deploy-web.yml host nginx volume mount pattern''i compose için\nkalır (ai.acik.com şu an bu yolu kullanıyor). Bu PR K8s deployment\niçin Docker image üretir:\n  ghcr.io/halildeu/platform-ssot-frontend:sha-<short>\n\nYapı:\n1. web/Dockerfile (multi-stage: pnpm build + nginx serve)\n   - Stage 1: node:22-alpine + pnpm install + build:ubuntu:single-domain\n   - Stage 2: nginx:1.27-alpine + COPY dist/ubuntu-single-domain\n   - Cache strategy: index.html no-store, /assets immutable\n   - /healthz endpoint\n2. .github/workflows/frontend-image.yml\n   - Trigger: web/** push veya manuel\n   - GHCR login + buildx + push (sha + main-stable)\n   - Summary''de k8s overlay bump snippet\n\nK8s entegrasyon (ayrı PR k8s-gitops):\n  kustomize/base/apps/frontend/deployment.yaml image: ghcr.io/.../frontend:sha-<short>\n  Mevcut: nginx:1.27-alpine (içeriksiz)\n\nMevcut deploy-web.yml etkilenmedi (compose deploy paralel devam).\n\nRefs: platform-k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md (Frontend MFE Dilim 4)\n      ADR-0002 Faz B test authoritative live\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(contract): cover web/Dockerfile + frontend-image.yml in delivery scope\n\nfeature_execution_contract.v1.json:\n- delivery_scope.change_path_globs: add web/Dockerfile + .github/workflows/frontend-image.yml\n- ux_contract.artifacts: add web/Dockerfile (K8s deployment artifact, trust_privacy_security_ux theme)\n\nFix: PR #522 enforcement-check + module-delivery-contract-check 2 errors\n(delivery_scope:uncovered_change + ux_contract:uncovered_ui_change for web/Dockerfile)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(ux-catalog): map web/Dockerfile to consistency_and_pattern_governance\n\nux_change_map.v1.json: add web/Dockerfile entry (single_component_source_of_truth subtheme)\n\nFix: PR #522 ux_catalog_enforcement gate missing_mappings=1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE----