ttps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/28921ad287ee65fbe48a56b69c9f506436084b19","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDI4OTIxYWQyODdlZTY1ZmJlNDhhNTZiNjljOWY1MDY0MzYwODRiMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/e99c4043feba6aa06ac889faec0cf01100e57385","sha":"e99c4043feba6aa06ac889faec0cf01100e57385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/e99c4043feba6aa06ac889faec0cf01100e57385"}],"sha":"28921ad287ee65fbe48a56b69c9f506436084b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/28921ad287ee65fbe48a56b69c9f506436084b19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/e99c4043feba6aa06ac889faec0cf01100e57385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:42:01Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:42:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit): shadow-compare diagnostic endpoint (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2) (#521)\n\n* feat(audit): shadow-compare diagnostic endpoint (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2)\n\nParallel track of the A → C gradual audit consolidation roadmap. This PR\nships the shadow-compare endpoint Codex''s thread 019da7f1 recommended\nfor Option B: collect parity evidence BEFORE operators flip the feature\nflag added in Faz 1 (PR #520).\n\n## Design\nGET /api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50\n\n- Lives only on permission-service (independent of gateway route flag).\n- Gated on @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"manager\") — strictest audit relation;\n  operators only. Read-only, no side effects.\n- Calls BOTH sources in parallel:\n  * permission-service: direct in-service AuditEventService.listEvents\n    (gets merged permission_audit_events + user_audit_events mirror)\n  * user-service: HTTP GET http://user-service:8089/api/audit/events\n    (gets raw user_audit_events; no auth required, user-service has no\n    @RequireModule gate)\n- Returns BOTH raw responses verbatim + a pre-computed diff summary.\n\n## Diff fields\n- totalDelta (permission.total - userService.total)\n- permissionOnlyIds / userServiceOnlyIds / commonIds\n- fieldDiffs (up to 50 entries): per-id field mismatches across\n  [userEmail, service, level, action, correlationId]\n  (Codex flagged these specifically as likely-drift: user-service\n  synthesizes userEmail = \"user:\" + targetUserId and correlationId =\n  \"audit-\" + id; permission-service returns real values.)\n- verdict ladder:\n  * clean              totals match, no id or field drift\n  * id-drift           totals match but id sets differ (mirror churn)\n  * count-drift        totals diverge; ids compared are consistent\n  * field-drift        same ids, different field values\n  * user-service-unreachable  HTTP call failed\n\n## Operator usage\n  curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer <admin-token>\" \\\n    \"https://ai.acik.com/api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50\" | jq .\n\n## Gateway\nAdded routes[18] /api/audit/events/compare → PERMISSION-SERVICE (order=-1)\nso the explicit route is evaluated before the base /api/audit/** route[5].\n\n## Roadmap position\n- Faz 1 (PR #520): AUDIT_BACKEND_URI feature-flag (reversible cutover)\n- **Faz 2 (this PR)**: shadow-compare endpoint for evidence collection\n- Faz 3 (future): mirror durability upgrade (outbox pattern)\n- Faz 4 (future): delete user-service AuditEventController read-path\n- Faz 5 (retention): drop user_audit_events table\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(fec): cover permission-service/dto/* path for shadow-compare DTOs (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 follow-up)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cea5d869e6d7ba2b9efcbfd5dce09ae90d6c150","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/3cea5d869e6d7ba2b9efcbfd5dce09ae90d6c150"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/e99c4043feba6aa06ac889faec0cf01100e57385","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cea5d869e6d7ba2b9efcbfd5dce09ae90d6c150\nparent 6bddaf5ac791a5d4f4e02a7364e66970a37285eb\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776642121 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776642121 +0300\n\nfeat(audit): shadow-compare diagnostic endpoint (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2) (#521)\n\n* feat(audit): shadow-compare diagnostic endpoint (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2)\n\nParallel track of the A → C gradual audit consolidation roadmap. This PR\nships the shadow-compare endpoint Codex''s thread 019da7f1 recommended\nfor Option B: collect parity evidence BEFORE operators flip the feature\nflag added in Faz 1 (PR #520).\n\n## Design\nGET /api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50\n\n- Lives only on permission-service (independent of gateway route flag).\n- Gated on @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"manager\") — strictest audit relation;\n  operators only. Read-only, no side effects.\n- Calls BOTH sources in parallel:\n  * permission-service: direct in-service AuditEventService.listEvents\n    (gets merged permission_audit_events + user_audit_events mirror)\n  * user-service: HTTP GET http://user-service:8089/api/audit/events\n    (gets raw user_audit_events; no auth required, user-service has no\n    @RequireModule gate)\n- Returns BOTH raw responses verbatim + a pre-computed diff summary.\n\n## Diff fields\n- totalDelta (permission.total - userService.total)\n- permissionOnlyIds / userServiceOnlyIds / commonIds\n- fieldDiffs (up to 50 entries): per-id field mismatches across\n  [userEmail, service, level, action, correlationId]\n  (Codex flagged these specifically as likely-drift: user-service\n  synthesizes userEmail = \"user:\" + targetUserId and correlationId =\n  \"audit-\" + id; permission-service returns real values.)\n- verdict ladder:\n  * clean              totals match, no id or field drift\n  * id-drift           totals match but id sets differ (mirror churn)\n  * count-drift        totals diverge; ids compared are consistent\n  * field-drift        same ids, different field values\n  * user-service-unreachable  HTTP call failed\n\n## Operator usage\n  curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer <admin-token>\" \\\n    \"https://ai.acik.com/api/audit/events/compare?page=1&pageSize=50\" | jq .\n\n## Gateway\nAdded routes[18] /api/audit/events/compare → PERMISSION-SERVICE (order=-1)\nso the explicit route is evaluated before the base /api/audit/** route[5].\n\n## Roadmap position\n- Faz 1 (PR #520): AUDIT_BACKEND_URI feature-flag (reversible cutover)\n- **Faz 2 (this PR)**: shadow-compare endpoint for evidence collection\n- Faz 3 (future): mirror durability upgrade (outbox pattern)\n- Faz 4 (future): delete user-service AuditEventController read-path\n- Faz 5 (retention): drop user_audit_events table\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(fec): cover permission-service/dto/* path for shadow-compare DTOs (QLTY-PROACTIVE-06 Faz 2 follow-up)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5WhJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfpIQACHWDC5jSIAAdvhzpEFZJWWi\nkL59Mv02L2enRr0ynm37EgLAvVAuCgC43SPwy04+R3PkVdXIhl/nw9n1hmx9UGGQ\nMsJ0D3A+YMG2rOP1jmiz+tczw0C3ni0VPIPPHxzMct+d7agxoNzedkOY9kD602+H\nt5tm/PeadZihvnLgPBoGG0jkZJeOy0NfODZtQTdMoFFlPbsCQjCuc1kJ0B+pQfwG\n1qHQOpkm5/TJHYPvfX3ZNvZRjZRVvpL0y+nJUBwq8W9mImD3jDRx5X9z1paeM+lF\nHJMuhQNdG5LjWaLivuWtTpxIGo1N8E+3i+dBttU+1zn+2LSiZhcUfbTkrEE/nHpK\nfEW+tCxRIqVTiqorJ0cWUR+UUwExWWgCf0i6PaM+LdJ5aalpMKio9kxD3LaiZBkf\nVAwTExKeejVToQGDy3ciHnSCDKWy0RmBxa5VCTq25ZNliiDeFo21r4qilaHPcLnu\nyw0Y6WP1Y6WIZYtWDnU6sJC7B3qabXBMfL061lbyTATSHNDTE798hNSVpuDasS4P\nlMuV2c5pFROHMehLXMRrcpQeF7U9sQqWeGDkTLZq0bj9XHTlmf3tFExgigYj+V2u\nVCAdbIA4wLO6FnFhdHlBiAy68ymgjsh1O5PTQcDqhOFp7GExmMDvxoQGMK6eN7qT\nas2k70CAO2VZYF1UK6Xm\n=s1Pv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T23:42:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscription