alildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/8c62334c9a0de2b4df31da7f4c2baa97fde82097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:47:34Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:47:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ops): allowlist known-benign startup WARN patterns (QLTY-PROACTIVE-04 v1.3) (#518)\n\nv1.2 sweep (run 24640769946) after regex-tightening surfaced 7 services\nwith WARN counts 1-4. Sample inspection:\n- Flyway: \"PostgreSQL 18.3 is newer than this version\" × 7 services.\n  Flyway supports PG 18 but logs recommendation WARN.\n- Eureka InstanceInfoReplicator: \"Ignoring onDemand update due to rate\n  limiter\" × 4 services. Expected debounce on boot burst.\n- Hikari: \"idleTimeout is close to or more than maxLifetime\" on report-\n  service — intentional config (see report-pg-pool).\n- Hikari: \"idleTimeout has been set but has no effect\" on permission-\n  service — benign config quirk.\n\nAll four patterns added to allowlist (suppressions via PR, not runtime).\n\nExpected: next workflow_dispatch → verdict=pass for healthy stage.\n\nSignal preservation check (non-regression): adding these specific\npatterns does NOT suppress:\n- Non-WARN-level errors (primary regex anchors to LEVEL token)\n- Different Flyway/Eureka/Hikari warnings (regex is specific)\n- Real connection/auth failures on these components\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5db27c5f24b6d98511deaebb7e85aff01a55c0fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/5db27c5f24b6d98511deaebb7e85aff01a55c0fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/8c62334c9a0de2b4df31da7f4c2baa97fde82097","verification":{"payload":"tree 5db27c5f24b6d98511deaebb7e85aff01a55c0fd\nparent 56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776638854 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776638854 +0300\n\nfix(ops): allowlist known-benign startup WARN patterns (QLTY-PROACTIVE-04 v1.3) (#518)\n\nv1.2 sweep (run 24640769946) after regex-tightening surfaced 7 services\nwith WARN counts 1-4. Sample inspection:\n- Flyway: \"PostgreSQL 18.3 is newer than this version\" × 7 services.\n  Flyway supports PG 18 but logs recommendation WARN.\n- Eureka InstanceInfoReplicator: \"Ignoring onDemand update due to rate\n  limiter\" × 4 services. Expected debounce on boot burst.\n- Hikari: \"idleTimeout is close to or more than maxLifetime\" on report-\n  service — intentional config (see report-pg-pool).\n- Hikari: \"idleTimeout has been set but has no effect\" on permission-\n  service — benign config quirk.\n\nAll four patterns added to allowlist (suppressions via PR, not runtime).\n\nExpected: next workflow_dispatch → verdict=pass for healthy stage.\n\nSignal preservation check (non-regression): adding these specific\npatterns does NOT suppress:\n- Non-WARN-level errors (primary regex anchors to LEVEL token)\n- Different Flyway/Eureka/Hikari warnings (regex is specific)\n- Real connection/auth failures on these components\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","rea