MxZGE3ZjRjMmJhYTk3ZmRlODIwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9","sha":"56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9"}],"sha":"8c62334c9a0de2b4df31da7f4c2baa97fde82097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/8c62334c9a0de2b4df31da7f4c2baa97fde82097"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:33:26Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:33:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ops): sweep regex matches LOG LEVEL not message-text (QLTY-PROACTIVE-04 v1.2) (#517)\n\nv1.1 sweep run (24640586644) surfaced noise: DEBUG-level Spring Security\nfilter-chain logs containing \"denied\" / \"failed\" / \"rejected\" as message\ntext matched the error regex, inflating api-gateway error count from 0\nto 4 despite no real ERROR.\n\nRoot cause: v1 regex searched for tokens (denied/rejected/unauthorized/\nforbidden) ANYWHERE in a line, which happens in legitimate DEBUG/INFO\nsecurity-audit logs.\n\nFix: anchor the regex to the Spring Boot log LEVEL slot\n  `<TIMESTAMP> <LEVEL> <PID> --- [<SERVICE>] ...`\nMatch only when LEVEL is FATAL/ERROR/WARN. Keep secondary patterns for:\n- stack-trace continuation lines (`at foo.bar.Baz(...)`, `Caused by:`)\n- HTTP 5xx tokens (for proxy logs without Spring LEVEL prefix)\n\nDropped: generic token matching (denied/rejected/unauthorized/forbidden)\n— these are only noise at DEBUG/INFO, and show up at WARN+/ERROR already\ncaptured by the level-anchored primary pattern.\n\nExpected impact:\n- v1.1: api-gateway=4, auth-service=1, user-service=2, variant-service=1\n  (all DEBUG false positives)\n- v1.2: expect most/all ~0 for healthy stage (real WARN+ only).\n\nNext dispatch of the workflow will prove the reduction.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a14cd65c2ceb0741cf93c9991a075e91fa0afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/62a14cd65c2ceb0741cf93c9991a075e91fa0afd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/56c5e0b9210a506c64774cda740072a07d718ba9","verification":{"payload":"tree 62a14cd65c2ceb0741cf93c9991a075e91fa0afd\nparent 275aed2127180de90b417c067d0ee839a2a9a38d\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776638006 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776638006 +0300\n\nfix(ops): sweep regex matches LOG LEVEL not message-text (QLTY-PROACTIVE-04 v1.2) (#517)\n\nv1.1 sweep run (24640586644) surfaced noise: DEBUG-level Spring Security\nfilter-chain logs containing \"denied\" / \"failed\" / \"rejected\" as message\ntext matched the error regex, inflating api-gateway error count from 0\nto 4 despite no real ERROR.\n\nRoot cause: v1 regex searched for tokens (denied/rejected/unauthorized/\nforbidden) ANYWHERE in a line, which happens in legitimate DEBUG/INFO\nsecurity-audit logs.\n\nFix: anchor the regex to the Spring Boot log LEVEL slot\n  `<TIMESTAMP> <LEVEL> <PID> --- [<SERVICE>] ...`\nMatch only when LEVEL is FATAL/ERROR/WARN. Keep secondary patterns for:\n- stack-trace continuation lines (`at foo.bar.Baz(...)`, `Caused by:`)\n- HTTP 5xx tokens (for proxy logs without Spring LEVEL prefix)\n\nDropped: generic token matching (denied/rejected/unauthorized/forbidden)\n— these are only noise at DEBUG/INFO, and show up at WARN+/ERROR already\ncaptured by the level-anchored primary pattern.\n\nExpected impact:\n- v1.1: api-gateway=4, auth-service=1, user-service=2, variant-service=1\n  (all DEBUG false positives)\n- v1.2: expect most/all ~0 for healthy stage (real WARN+ only).\n\nNext dispatch of the workflow will prove the reduction.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5Vg2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEDgQABnCH/fdEZqn9NSIHnpcD2hJ\nmfj32BNOz7euZqpnveBvpCesolU+czv9obwd4UY+RijKjfnfuObSNUvSor2iPMYs\n8pGxA3hr5YvlNaMvVUEzvH9r4+srPzqzCqnxHINp66GnbF/agCG6JSi1BrIW+Yhv\nwTDvuSffHXpLB3rJIMpZ6vF5xQqaaLZm57bQ+7eU/eVvJqoJE9p1sCQ97/IisNZD\n9wD0X5Ua799ZS1nITtoTft8G0jLNPh4G1NvP685AHT54MqmaGT+ycqMmNLcU6+0G\nI79nseZUXMrKtqrJOkrYHNkOag78o46rSFEg22NjslTQxiMrCBbB7A8BZJWXuJOX\nUKbJnxhtElE0LKF0pHxZlsGZ2slxxmZhd3gQlLj1QbuisjZ58rWkjN9+bD91gWUN\n1XqHeRNS743fEvZhgZcVokQQ7sWB7bMG45CiJOGEhdQFhYWmVcLOx5IkP7EyFF7T\n1Ei7wcPLEpXbro3VVPVA+WfmP/o8TFldYmuA+JHBCKJUe0JJldQBbjvR9E8pPKsa\nVJT74I9+/OVxLsywljqoDgC8INLKoYfaqlpAfRzeqY6WzQXjjcaspzVjjtMXim9+\nTbYFD0SRnVzBGvtCXRAJRO4DqcadxqOBgNBBKm5aRZ/+HIPBQ8Qz1+wbPZRtkpI/\nvvKHtlCEOmhReUIKVlnk\n=iKLB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T22:33:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/