om/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/60611faf580cab74a13f7fdc4db0010ced972b4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:01:02Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T22:01:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gateway): route /api/audit/events/live + /export to permission-service (QLTY-PROACTIVE-03) (#514)\n\nWhy: admin dashboard showed repeated `GET /api/audit/events/live 404` in\nconsole (SSE reconnect loop from useAuditLiveStream.ts:132).\n\nRoot cause: gateway route[5] Path=/api/audit/** targets lb://USER-SERVICE,\nbut user-service''s AuditEventController exposes only `GET /api/audit/events`\n(list) — no `/live`, no `/export`, no `/export-jobs/*`. Permission-service\nhas the full surface including SseEmitter /live. Result: user-service 404\non every sub-surface request.\n\nCodex thread 019da7a2 adversarial review verdict: PARTIAL — one-line swap\nof route[5] URI to PERMISSION-SERVICE is unsafe because:\n  1. Data-source parity: user-service reads user_audit_events; permission-\n     service reads permission_audit_events + mirrored user_audit_events\n     (mirror requires PERMISSION_SERVICE_INTERNAL_API_KEY — must be verified\n     in stage/prod before cut-over).\n  2. Auth semantics: permission-service list has @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"viewer\");\n     user-service does not. Silent permission tightening.\n  3. FEC gap: application.properties not in current change_path_globs.\n\nSurgical approach adopted:\n- Add explicit routes[16] (/api/audit/events/live) + routes[17]\n  (/api/audit/events/export + /export-jobs/**) with order=-1 so they\n  evaluate BEFORE the /api/audit/** catch-all on route[5].\n- Leave route[5] → USER-SERVICE for base list endpoint (preserve existing\n  data source + auth semantics until parity migration).\n- Add @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"viewer\") on permission-service''s /live\n  endpoint for parity with list endpoint (was previously authenticated-but-\n  ungated — Codex flag).\n- FEC change_path_globs: add backend/api-gateway/src/main/resources/*.\n\nNext step (separate PR after parity verification):\n- Cut over route[5] to PERMISSION-SERVICE entirely; remove user-service\n  AuditEventController as dead code.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d0f28565d65774e6c2790bd92fc6fe2c3b51ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/2d0f28565d65774e6c2790bd92fc6fe2c3b51ac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/60611faf580cab74a13f7fdc4db0010ced972b4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d0f28565d65774e6c2790bd92fc6fe2c3b51ac2\nparent d3c0c6ff1e3d02e49b87c954ed4733c1fd700a27\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776636062 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776636062 +0300\n\nfix(gateway): route /api/audit/events/live + /export to permission-service (QLTY-PROACTIVE-03) (#514)\n\nWhy: admin dashboard showed repeated `GET /api/audit/events/live 404` in\nconsole (SSE reconnect loop from useAuditLiveStream.ts:132).\n\nRoot cause: gateway route[5] Path=/api/audit/** targets lb://USER-SERVICE,\nbut user-service''s AuditEventController exposes only `GET /api/audit/events`\n(list) — no `/live`, no `/export`, no `/export-jobs/*`. Permission-service\nhas the full surface including SseEmitter /live. Result: user-service 404\non every sub-surface request.\n\nCodex thread 019da7a2 adversarial review verdict: PARTIAL — one-line swap\nof route[5] URI to PERMISSION-SERVICE is unsafe because:\n  1. Data-source parity: user-service reads user_audit_events; permission-\n     service reads permission_audit_events + mirrored user_audit_events\n     (mirror requires PERMISSION_SERVICE_INTERNAL_API_KEY — must be verified\n     in stage/prod before cut-over).\n  2. Auth semantics: permission-service list has @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"viewer\");\n     user-service does not. Silent permission tightening.\n  3. FEC gap: application.properties not in current change_path_globs.\n\nSurgical approach adopted:\n- Add explicit routes[16] (/api/audit/events/live) + routes[17]\n  (/api/audit/events/export + /export-jobs/**) with order=-1 so they\n  evaluate BEFORE the /api/audit/** catch-all on route[5].\n- Leave route[5] → USER-SERVICE for base list endpoint (preserve existing\n  data source + auth semantics until parity migration).\n- Add @RequireModule(\"AUDIT\",\"viewer\") on permission-service''s /live\n  endpoint for parity with list endpoint (was previously authenticated-but-\n  ungated — Codex flag).\n- FEC change_path_globs: add backend/api-gateway/src/main/resources/*.\n\nNext step (separate PR after parity verification):\n- Cut over route[5] to PERMISSION-SERVICE entirely; remove user-service\n  AuditEventController as dead code.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5VCeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn2oQAG8hUVBXm0IIkLYj4wORQvf0\nQtH8MczduVFCaX54zl+I0e1S4aaJA3WoNPC+pDJkd0A3UIlEOuhetRztmDBMTuRZ\nBmiU1vXUffS8orkZGY4CnQc3/I4vC/LgOW8RUIHJfo8sXLh2DY/YvZvIgCdFQWmT\n5ISDWHQqHRNNvaDSP0q7SU9gH/Nba45lM68NaPyVgc6zLDv9Ks8QjN7Jzne+5vhy\nEvWVtYESZX0TbR3ynwICxS74uRKJFnwOE9tW//HFs2WtQ+ysF+BGjQKE8zPSzaYN\nBsI3kmoguEGY1PW2nj1pLmokLI8j8MKPHYvOa0YYggV78bNcg9LzliIWGepbxMqu\nEn+CSj3CYgHSbCmbaPbUDYo5442zYocP/8zytOgF+iubd3MV0hICLDmUsJ/cE1VP\nXFbr4ZEVMa1o4WwEvcVw1whxn2O6WiSq6sQk1uffJKS1mQZf5pF6Ps+6NUUqXrE0\nQ/JX7w+wgfk7GXGvvOrSsvkvkaN8FuNyDeJNf2VjTCIeU1zJmBxaJI9zgcMkRkb6\nddq0KN8XC+se5hEUCJYXQm49ek33JbXgclAcLZJRJqXUtP2FpzX1tHEZyKWlY95x\nJ1ItJg+1JHg5XVYFh1JJ/1gl9ZMMb/QS0XQNMcN/hAUqB8FqNcSwi6ATh7S6a/b1\n1o2LR5WVO5aimkR8DJVL\n=FW00\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","