thub-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/d3c0c6ff1e3d02e49b87c954ed4733c1fd700a27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:49:08Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:49:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(auth-service): K8s application config shortname NS default (#510)\n\nS1-B2 hardcoded namespace default fix — auth-service application-k8s.yml\n3 default URL hardcoded ''platform-prod.svc.cluster.local'' namespace''i\nkullanıyordu. Test overlay env override ile maskeleniyor ama default\ndrift. Cross-env pod restart veya default fallback senaryolarında\nyanlış namespace''e traffic gönderme riski.\n\nDeğişiklikler (3 satır):\n- permission.service.base-url default:\n  http://permission-service.platform-prod.svc.cluster.local:8090 →\n  http://permission-service:8090\n- permission.audit-mirror.base-url default: aynı shortname\n- user.service.base-url default:\n  http://user-service.platform-prod.svc.cluster.local:8089 →\n  http://user-service:8089\n\nRationale: Pod kendi namespace''inde service resolution yapar (K8s\nDNS search path). Shortname ''permission-service'' pod''un kendi\nnamespace''inde resolve eder — test pod''u platform-test, prod pod''u\nplatform-prod. Env-neutral default.\n\nCross-namespace hedef için env override zaten açık\n(PERMISSION_SERVICE_BASE_URL, USER_SERVICE_BASE_URL).\n\nRefs: k8s-gitops docs/handoff-auth-hardcoded-ns-fix.md\n      k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md §2.3\n\nCo-authored-by: Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ecbcf1bd1e32b3f575ba5e192ff0d4ac316f89b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/7ecbcf1bd1e32b3f575ba5e192ff0d4ac316f89b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/d3c0c6ff1e3d02e49b87c954ed4733c1fd700a27","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ecbcf1bd1e32b3f575ba5e192ff0d4ac316f89b\nparent 87cf06633cf0017f6a88dd6d14b8da43dd07488a\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1776635348 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776635348 +0300\n\nfix(auth-service): K8s application config shortname NS default (#510)\n\nS1-B2 hardcoded namespace default fix — auth-service application-k8s.yml\n3 default URL hardcoded ''platform-prod.svc.cluster.local'' namespace''i\nkullanıyordu. Test overlay env override ile maskeleniyor ama default\ndrift. Cross-env pod restart veya default fallback senaryolarında\nyanlış namespace''e traffic gönderme riski.\n\nDeğişiklikler (3 satır):\n- permission.service.base-url default:\n  http://permission-service.platform-prod.svc.cluster.local:8090 →\n  http://permission-service:8090\n- permission.audit-mirror.base-url default: aynı shortname\n- user.service.base-url default:\n  http://user-service.platform-prod.svc.cluster.local:8089 →\n  http://user-service:8089\n\nRationale: Pod kendi namespace''inde service resolution yapar (K8s\nDNS search path). Shortname ''permission-service'' pod''un kendi\nnamespace''inde resolve eder — test pod''u platform-test, prod pod''u\nplatform-prod. Env-neutral default.\n\nCross-namespace hedef için env override zaten açık\n(PERMISSION_SERVICE_BASE_URL, USER_SERVICE_BASE_URL).\n\nRefs: k8s-gitops docs/handoff-auth-hardcoded-ns-fix.md\n      k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md §2.3\n\nCo-authored-by: Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5U3UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG3YQALDwP7DesIGuJr56idASxZcc\n53e+jlTgvXlsar8PTDqnFet79h+pXJ1KfaEdDF/qj+usqOM0GnHzhpft3qyQKj/a\necl7WM6e9Vjwb5X3mc2MX1umveYsh2HEE3DLGKs8wSyHbwiim9772wxk7lGwP1fN\nghZZ3kB/RwGpPqZRir8jxQ20f8/miaDmH2YcEfSGPRXasHGVnGU4ywm+Xge9Btqr\n/tVSbuWDRwSWIcsgQFEcpPb9/gWovBP3/QCv95gYpp6kgp+Oz0/sgkRF2+5L1el6\ncOdihc35puNFYlgWyU0wcAEosFQxECA7cYWpGWb65GCTd8i7ep/WCugwpOwQK+Bz\nRYW4XCJZ9hzyYPjAnUaFil9k9lZ7QJmdKiG4rURVznv6dSPcpBbdBKkPCMKZ06t6\nklEVYivTNm6y6nBJCDyT5O+7N5cJZaVFlbSwvWA4q/VXGaxWvzF/ls8ZlNh+Q/eE\nWlsSGN2a3NAw+0LGMYLrKgQDmwcvOP0t1Sqq4roFjSaSfqEOvHFHEOIlsnnHIZpD\n8x3dRfZarzlwFqlb6G8r7BXAzLgqwWm/3o4PICi+e2HbWjx5vUKY7cfH8dAmmNYZ\nabNH97sXMHpyntA61H1LDyd6U17wclvqkA3IFM4lpx4Ndjc2Zarkysb1gnoZHs8/\nWRQVsF3XgIdsu4ahN7xB\n=aVRB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T21:49:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http