ptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/87cf06633cf0017f6a88dd6d14b8da43dd07488a","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDg3Y2YwNjYzM2NmMDAxN2Y2YTg4ZGQ2ZDE0YjhkYTQzZGQwNzQ4OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4","sha":"c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4"}],"sha":"87cf06633cf0017f6a88dd6d14b8da43dd07488a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/87cf06633cf0017f6a88dd6d14b8da43dd07488a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:36:05Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:36:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(keycloak): smoke-client confidential client — D29 katman 3 Zanzibar-ready (#511)\n\nK8s-6 S2-B3 blocker: testai.acik.com D29 katman 3 (Zanzibar-ready allow\nprobe) için confidential client gerekli. Mevcut realm (serban) 8 client\niçeriyor ama confidential smoke-client tanımı yok.\n\nEklenen: smoke-client\n- clientAuthenticatorType: client-secret (confidential)\n- directAccessGrantsEnabled: true (password grant, smoke test için)\n- serviceAccountsEnabled: true (client_credentials grant, service token)\n- standardFlowEnabled: false (browser flow kapalı, sadece API)\n- publicClient: false\n- secret: DEV_ONLY_ROTATE_VIA_VAULT_SMOKE_CLIENT_SECRET (placeholder)\n\nKritik: Seed sonrası realm import edilir edilmez secret Vault üzerinden\nrotate edilmeli (kv/platform/keycloak/smoke-client). Placeholder değer\nkullanıma alınmadan önce rotate zorunlu. Prod için fixed secret asla\ncommit edilmemeli.\n\ntestai D29 katman 3 smoke:\n  TOKEN=curl -X POST .../protocol/openid-connect/token \\\\\n    -d grant_type=client_credentials \\\\\n    -d client_id=smoke-client -d client_secret=VAULT\n  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer TOKEN\" https://testai.acik.com/variants\n\nRefs: k8s-gitops docs/handoff-smoke-client-keycloak.md\n      k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md §2.1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cd023d5aa9bab8f3621c7f92455aa07d07e0dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/0cd023d5aa9bab8f3621c7f92455aa07d07e0dba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cd023d5aa9bab8f3621c7f92455aa07d07e0dba\nparent 7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776634565 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776634565 +0300\n\nfeat(keycloak): smoke-client confidential client — D29 katman 3 Zanzibar-ready (#511)\n\nK8s-6 S2-B3 blocker: testai.acik.com D29 katman 3 (Zanzibar-ready allow\nprobe) için confidential client gerekli. Mevcut realm (serban) 8 client\niçeriyor ama confidential smoke-client tanımı yok.\n\nEklenen: smoke-client\n- clientAuthenticatorType: client-secret (confidential)\n- directAccessGrantsEnabled: true (password grant, smoke test için)\n- serviceAccountsEnabled: true (client_credentials grant, service token)\n- standardFlowEnabled: false (browser flow kapalı, sadece API)\n- publicClient: false\n- secret: DEV_ONLY_ROTATE_VIA_VAULT_SMOKE_CLIENT_SECRET (placeholder)\n\nKritik: Seed sonrası realm import edilir edilmez secret Vault üzerinden\nrotate edilmeli (kv/platform/keycloak/smoke-client). Placeholder değer\nkullanıma alınmadan önce rotate zorunlu. Prod için fixed secret asla\ncommit edilmemeli.\n\ntestai D29 katman 3 smoke:\n  TOKEN=curl -X POST .../protocol/openid-connect/token \\\\\n    -d grant_type=client_credentials \\\\\n    -d client_id=smoke-client -d client_secret=VAULT\n  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer TOKEN\" https://testai.acik.com/variants\n\nRefs: k8s-gitops docs/handoff-smoke-client-keycloak.md\n      k8s-gitops docs/dev-repo-handoff-bundle.md §2.1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5UrFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxlAQAFPDjxWoTXZKC6x+r5K3KEw1\nofHqV0a4nZxvKR7KJ47UOrATejP69E1jeKA69OixT3lAPLSEHb00eP7my7Gu9EPw\n92MHJNtrfeYpxyFDJNsnrVgrECcF1tnSVF+SGCqYngf+qN3nmneOVqpj5oBOM8Hf\nk4njLv7fSfhc2vQ9Yp5dEGGdkcoYZVTRhYhjvGRQDvD9S/5Ndrx/Tbp92Tly21xc\nMqZ2is5CqiKU+r0qvlVU5VoegL5ABo/c3VuwvKA0zjIg9qnza6nJw3Zs7RoulhmY\n2s1vxJCnBIdd6s4A1vuFmee2dnPfLVHm7Ie80yC8t/hVRXKFtz1g8XEtxITLzCNP\nNwc1Dv0MhF2zCTdEB2HOJ+mt2YTIxVzGh2APlz21kNz8sy63KDMHYdBYSXVYrrov\n8qNkVm0eopK8plykCovh9Ifwbywqa39qWfEpMn1Un+9volPlFWn/8EAg8S5ibfgm\nmQBp/SKsUoIWw4Gu3JYBnk2shUe6eJpSJSAgHqz70ZCr/TfZOvdjPj0+KSyBG1fG\nH8v2OTxC2ZZ5smT+odse0ebJNrQxSgtbl1xvEcx0HnMESn/UxQ3fhO+j8fPNYt5y\n0nd7X+KDjBDiAlkYviABs1IbMYncDNYb5Wsxnwv3qb2nCCxBfX2TPu1OOsxrT38F\netQvPWp2Lf4bIqtF86iF\n=R+g2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T21:36:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKGM0Y2Q3NTQzNzY0MmQ3Zjc4OWZlOGY2M2U2NzM3MTYwZTZmYWI2YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd","sha":"7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd"}],"sha":"c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/c4cd75437642d7f789fe8f63e6737160e6fab6a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:12:46Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T21:12:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shell): __skipAuth flag + theme-registry anonymous call (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02) (#509)\n\n* fix(shell): __skipAuth flag + theme-registry anonymous call (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02)\n\nWhy: /api/v1/theme-registry keeps returning 401 on real browsers after\nKC_HOSTNAME flip even though api-gateway now declares it `permitAll()`.\nCodex confirmed Spring Security STILL invokes the JWT filter when a\nBearer header is present, so strict single-aud validators (variant-service)\nreject stale/wrong-aud tokens from the pre-hydration localStorage and the\npublic endpoint fails with 401.\n\nFix: call /v1/theme-registry anonymously from frontend. theme-registry\nis a public contract (CSS var metadata, not sensitive) so sending the\nrequest without Authorization bypasses the JWT filter entirely.\n\n- web/packages/shared-http/src/index.ts\n  Add `__skipAuth?: boolean` to SharedHttpRequestConfig. Request interceptor\n  now checks the flag and skips Authorization header injection. Debug log\n  exposes skipAuth state for troubleshooting.\n\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/theme-context.provider.tsx\n  fetchRegistry() passes `{ __skipAuth: true }`; resolves bootstrap race\n  where ThemeProvider mounts before AuthBootstrapper completes.\n\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx\n  loadRegistry() same pattern for admin runtime panel.\n\n- extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/contract/feature_execution_contract.v1.json\n  Add change_path_globs for web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/{layout,theme}/**\n  + web/packages/shared-http/src/* so FEC check covers these paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(fec): correct glob patterns to match fnmatch semantics (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02 follow-up)\n\nPrior commit added `web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/{layout,theme}/**/*` to\nchange_path_globs and relied on existing `layout/**/*` in ux_contract.\nPython fnmatch treats `**` as two greedy `*` so `**/*` requires a literal\n`/` in the remainder — ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx (a direct child of\nlayout/) has no slash after the pattern prefix → NO MATCH.\n\nVerified via:\n  fnmatch.fnmatch(''.../layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx'',\n                  ''.../layout/**/*'')   → False\n  fnmatch.fnmatch(''.../layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx'',\n                  ''.../layout/*'')      → True\n\nChanges:\n- change_path_globs: replace `**/*` with `*` for 2 mfe-shell paths\n- ux_contract.artifacts: add explicit entries for\n  - web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/*.tsx\n  - web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/*.tsx\n  - web/packages/shared-http/src/*.ts\n\nLocal FEC check now PASSES (detected_scopes=[frontend], errors=0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ux-map): register ThemeRuntimePanelButton + theme-context.provider paths (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02 follow-up)\n\nUX catalog enforcement requires an exact-path entry in\nextensions/PRJ-UX-NORTH-STAR/contract/ux_change_map.v1.json per changed\nUI file (glob coverage in FEC is separate — both checks required).\n\nAdded:\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/theme-context.provider.tsx\n  Both mapped to:\n    ux_theme_id: consistency_and_pattern_governance\n    ux_subtheme_id: single_component_source_of_truth\n\nshared-http/src/index.ts was already registered.\n\nLocal `check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py` now PASSES (errors=0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11cdaa6e9e9bfb9653235242c4ca4f29665033d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/11cdaa6e9e9bfb9653235242c4ca4f29665033d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd","verification":{"payload":"tree 11cdaa6e9e9bfb9653235242c4ca4f29665033d9\nparent d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776633166 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776633166 +0300\n\nfix(shell): __skipAuth flag + theme-registry anonymous call (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02) (#509)\n\n* fix(shell): __skipAuth flag + theme-registry anonymous call (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02)\n\nWhy: /api/v1/theme-registry keeps returning 401 on real browsers after\nKC_HOSTNAME flip even though api-gateway now declares it `permitAll()`.\nCodex confirmed Spring Security STILL invokes the JWT filter when a\nBearer header is present, so strict single-aud validators (variant-service)\nreject stale/wrong-aud tokens from the pre-hydration localStorage and the\npublic endpoint fails with 401.\n\nFix: call /v1/theme-registry anonymously from frontend. theme-registry\nis a public contract (CSS var metadata, not sensitive) so sending the\nrequest without Authorization bypasses the JWT filter entirely.\n\n- web/packages/shared-http/src/index.ts\n  Add `__skipAuth?: boolean` to SharedHttpRequestConfig. Request interceptor\n  now checks the flag and skips Authorization header injection. Debug log\n  exposes skipAuth state for troubleshooting.\n\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/theme-context.provider.tsx\n  fetchRegistry() passes `{ __skipAuth: true }`; resolves bootstrap race\n  where ThemeProvider mounts before AuthBootstrapper completes.\n\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx\n  loadRegistry() same pattern for admin runtime panel.\n\n- extensions/PRJ-PM-SUITE/contract/feature_execution_contract.v1.json\n  Add change_path_globs for web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/{layout,theme}/**\n  + web/packages/shared-http/src/* so FEC check covers these paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(fec): correct glob patterns to match fnmatch semantics (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02 follow-up)\n\nPrior commit added `web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/{layout,theme}/**/*` to\nchange_path_globs and relied on existing `layout/**/*` in ux_contract.\nPython fnmatch treats `**` as two greedy `*` so `**/*` requires a literal\n`/` in the remainder — ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx (a direct child of\nlayout/) has no slash after the pattern prefix → NO MATCH.\n\nVerified via:\n  fnmatch.fnmatch(''.../layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx'',\n                  ''.../layout/**/*'')   → False\n  fnmatch.fnmatch(''.../layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx'',\n                  ''.../layout/*'')      → True\n\nChanges:\n- change_path_globs: replace `**/*` with `*` for 2 mfe-shell paths\n- ux_contract.artifacts: add explicit entries for\n  - web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/*.tsx\n  - web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/*.tsx\n  - web/packages/shared-http/src/*.ts\n\nLocal FEC check now PASSES (detected_scopes=[frontend], errors=0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ux-map): register ThemeRuntimePanelButton + theme-context.provider paths (QLTY-PROACTIVE-02 follow-up)\n\nUX catalog enforcement requires an exact-path entry in\nextensions/PRJ-UX-NORTH-STAR/contract/ux_change_map.v1.json per changed\nUI file (glob coverage in FEC is separate — both checks required).\n\nAdded:\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/layout/ThemeRuntimePanelButton.tsx\n- web/apps/mfe-shell/src/app/theme/theme-context.provider.tsx\n  Both mapped to:\n    ux_theme_id: consistency_and_pattern_governance\n    ux_subtheme_id: single_component_source_of_truth\n\nshared-http/src/index.ts was already registered.\n\nLocal `check_ux_catalog_enforcement.py` now PASSES (errors=0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5UVOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaJEQAHLFAp/66NVN3U9JYnCn2VFF\nVaxL/HpuwmtfEXuGz0OReFprf8TuxWytDIqroP0qFyromYpfb8eMcYd2cH6lFfV3\n88MvnL0EqPQVENyHgWg0v5pJNenaqq5zcB75kOff6HLaRNJVs4nFvvk++C77Oh7C\nQIgDSI8D7QDtyP/JqHPwbYjpCkWRNX/ThdxoI/G4gzpA4WkSxm1iRTuAk4GVI50/\nFH6hcHLPajaiDUiEiaMRnXV1Z4LfsCHzal9G1N1CIEFZXW0H5HDkIhw2FT6KzCBr\nNfg9lC+9N1nNyjLBS2Rf+E5Le5DPl+89pkRGpcLFtwtqkHKJ+iSA98/z/cxD71Pr\nusVIj11OBUJg9iU/klJOOTd1Qm9bZ7AunKZpyKcO7I1Xiz/FrzgxBxvIyB/ICaSO\nkJiMStJWfkGjNjYHeuc6y46k24n7YMubNtFEfNHlU8PUWltP5YoGw5JMM3OP38Tt\n4iN+2dxw9dZSeMPHSFzb++ecURE03IAag69IgW3mcIEYvInqErg5lYO6GHl6e0+a\nl2GwZt2uFDVTm9DPedAgxnKZn7wjbhoMhkOqUFfDlPc6xluitz6g74bA8iSlzCxQ\nFPK56onl7BJYXWsXNQrMZaMXdCds5f6p34Lxt9fIGjbE7RZ/+azfglSXXaNa5yo6\nfcj0iScBZyXPo8jGS0/9\n=MeCP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T21:12:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDdkODk5YzFkODY3MjRmZDlkNmVjMGVlNDg4YzU0M2YyODA0MWRlY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14","sha":"d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14"}],"sha":"7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/7d899c1d86724fd9d6ec0ee488c543f28041decd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:59:46Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:59:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): permit-all GET /api/v1/theme-registry (public CSS-var metadata) (#506)\n\n* fix(security): permit-all GET /api/v1/theme-registry (public CSS-var metadata)\n\nBrowser homepage console still shows 1 x 401 on `/api/v1/theme-registry`\nafter all other auth drifts fixed. Root cause: frontend\n`theme-context.provider.tsx` bootstraps the theme registry fetch BEFORE\nthe auth context is populated. Request goes without Authorization header,\ngateway rejects with 401 \"JWT token zorunludur.\".\n\nThe registry payload is public metadata (CSS variable key→list mappings\nfor theme overrides). Not sensitive. Frontend code explicitly tolerates\nthe fetch failing, but the console error persists and confuses users.\n\n## Fix\nPermit-all GET on `/api/v1/theme-registry(/**)` at both:\n- api-gateway SecurityConfig (outer enforcement)\n- variant-service SecurityConfig (defense-in-depth, also permitted)\n\nOther paths (POST/PUT/DELETE) still require auth — only GET is public.\n\n## Non-goals\nFrontend fix (ensure fetch happens after auth ready) is cleaner but\nout of scope for this backend-side unblock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n* chore(fec): add api-gateway + variant-service security paths to FEC\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e1d5ae40eb5e1936230e29af12441c359a019a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/4e1d5ae40eb5e1936230e29af12441c359a019a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e1d5ae40eb5e1936230e29af12441c359a019a1\nparent 9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776628786 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776628786 +0300\n\nfix(security): permit-all GET /api/v1/theme-registry (public CSS-var metadata) (#506)\n\n* fix(security): permit-all GET /api/v1/theme-registry (public CSS-var metadata)\n\nBrowser homepage console still shows 1 x 401 on `/api/v1/theme-registry`\nafter all other auth drifts fixed. Root cause: frontend\n`theme-context.provider.tsx` bootstraps the theme registry fetch BEFORE\nthe auth context is populated. Request goes without Authorization header,\ngateway rejects with 401 \"JWT token zorunludur.\".\n\nThe registry payload is public metadata (CSS variable key→list mappings\nfor theme overrides). Not sensitive. Frontend code explicitly tolerates\nthe fetch failing, but the console error persists and confuses users.\n\n## Fix\nPermit-all GET on `/api/v1/theme-registry(/**)` at both:\n- api-gateway SecurityConfig (outer enforcement)\n- variant-service SecurityConfig (defense-in-depth, also permitted)\n\nOther paths (POST/PUT/DELETE) still require auth — only GET is public.\n\n## Non-goals\nFrontend fix (ensure fetch happens after auth ready) is cleaner but\nout of scope for this backend-side unblock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n* chore(fec): add api-gateway + variant-service security paths to FEC\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5TQyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8JQQAKl2hrIMtBG7fbNrcXsKVGLr\nW1HH4Yoxz6zbZls2unAVQ/IbEzXUEpLBFxFDQJNAB8zwI0p1IxmpD4tteOyVcQ44\nO+JGdjf5rEcMoJ1pdDBSHmwb96g36pd/DFqxXhqITMySTJr5D+rFOGhjX0C6KUN0\nnfrOfU9EWZ/iXBbRj+bBkOSh3hDqoHSmGdqVYs4rHBkeOWwLuDSMcQIywuZXFHOT\nfAXTktqwfg586X