53f8792a0443aa14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/d032e4af2a0cd86bd65d573e53f8792a0443aa14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:40:46Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:40:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(compose): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER env-aware for user + variant + CORS allow ai.acik.com (#505)\n\n* fix(compose): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER env-aware for user + variant + CORS allow ai.acik.com\n\nBrowser homepage /api/v1/theme-registry + /api/v1/me/theme/resolved 401,\n/api/auth/cookie 403 after KC_HOSTNAME flip to https://ai.acik.com.\n\n## Root causes (Codex thread 019da72d)\n\n### 1. variant-service + user-service SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER hardcoded\nCompose had:\n- variant (line 170): `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: http://localhost:8081/realms/serban`\n- user-service (line 68): `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: http://keycloak:8080/realms/serban`\n\nBrowser tokens now carry `iss=https://ai.acik.com/realms/serban` (post PR #494\nKC_HOSTNAME fix). Spring Security primary validator only checks\n`spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.jwt.issuer-uri` — doesn''t fall back\nto SECURITY_JWT_ISSUERS plural on variant/user. Canonical env already has\n`SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER=https://ai.acik.com/realms/serban` from prior OI-03\nwork but compose hardcoded blocked it.\n\n### 2. Gateway CORS default excludes stage public origin\n`GATEWAY_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` default was `http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3004`\nonly — browser Origin `https://ai.acik.com` tripped preflight 403 on\n`/api/auth/cookie` (which is gateway-defined AuthCookieEndpoint, not auth-service).\n\n## Fix\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml` variant (line 170) + user-service (line 68):\n  `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: ${SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER:-<old-default>}` env-aware\n- Gateway CORS default now includes `https://ai.acik.com` for stage parity\n\n## Evidence\nvariant-service log (pre-fix): `The iss claim is not valid` on every admin\nhomepage request.\n\n## Consultation\nCodex thread `019da72d` — separate root cause for 401 (variant iss) vs 403\n(gateway CORS); user-service same drift class; schema/core-data/report/\npermission compose blocks already env-aware (no drift). variant/user code\nfallback decoder parity optional but not blocker.\n\n## Ops already applied (immediate unblock)\nstaging `/home/halil/platform/repo/backend/docker-compose.yml` sed-patched\nwith the same env-aware pattern + variant + user-service recreated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d47bd92dac98298c30d0fffd34e4196258da1aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/d47bd92dac98298c30d0fffd34e4196258da1aa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c","verification":{"payload":"tree d47bd92dac98298c30d0fffd34e4196258da1aa8\nparent b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1776627646 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776627646 +0300\n\nfix(compose): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER env-aware for user + variant + CORS allow ai.acik.com (#505)\n\n* fix(compose): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER env-aware for user + variant + CORS allow ai.acik.com\n\nBrowser homepage /api/v1/theme-registry + /api/v1/me/theme/resolved 401,\n/api/auth/cookie 403 after KC_HOSTNAME flip to https://ai.acik.com.\n\n## Root causes (Codex thread 019da72d)\n\n### 1. variant-service + user-service SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER hardcoded\nCompose had:\n- variant (line 170): `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: http://localhost:8081/realms/serban`\n- user-service (line 68): `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: http://keycloak:8080/realms/serban`\n\nBrowser tokens now carry `iss=https://ai.acik.com/realms/serban` (post PR #494\nKC_HOSTNAME fix). Spring Security primary validator only checks\n`spring.security.oauth2.resourceserver.jwt.issuer-uri` — doesn''t fall back\nto SECURITY_JWT_ISSUERS plural on variant/user. Canonical env already has\n`SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER=https://ai.acik.com/realms/serban` from prior OI-03\nwork but compose hardcoded blocked it.\n\n### 2. Gateway CORS default excludes stage public origin\n`GATEWAY_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` default was `http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3004`\nonly — browser Origin `https://ai.acik.com` tripped preflight 403 on\n`/api/auth/cookie` (which is gateway-defined AuthCookieEndpoint, not auth-service).\n\n## Fix\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml` variant (line 170) + user-service (line 68):\n  `SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER: ${SECURITY_JWT_ISSUER:-<old-default>}` env-aware\n- Gateway CORS default now includes `https://ai.acik.com` for stage parity\n\n## Evidence\nvariant-service log (pre-fix): `The iss claim is not valid` on every admin\nhomepage request.\n\n## Consultation\nCodex thread `019da72d` — separate root cause for 401 (variant iss) vs 403\n(gateway CORS); user-service same drift class; schema/core-data/report/\npermission compose blocks already env-aware (no drift). variant/user code\nfallback decoder parity optional but not blocker.\n\n## Ops already applied (immediate unblock)\nstaging `/home/halil/platform/repo/backend/docker-compose.yml` sed-patched\nwith the same env-aware pattern + variant + user-service recreated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5S++CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEWQQAEZXpUZbetLu26I40E4InS6k\n3/Ut/dmFRrdSK5ev4SVyQ41MGUj3h63d3WvNKLZnlwvAIECubgyHV0zWh9TWdZJv\nf1OW7DPXW52fmxu1L9ysqxkkpNGPrZ4EAwKYRrSsQlQR2AOb2J/+Nh8O0GAg2cOC\nIvuL3dtNGUTuiUaVgvOwvnuB62aXGfjVLvnKD2PHdDQz3S0hLMlGfmCl5tGgz3nR\n5VYPsccxSDpaIwZ+zxXMRDsZyUGYRBBiHBin/OTmjLMhz50buPmeeXCWuR7QSZar\nNPwL4dbSkW6Ge4Gw2W4yHi/eLalHwKcfSwSRTembvBrYCEx2yV16FF2eOTEiiA+c\neHF8UVbjz6xlKfb8SUTjh+OeUUXKQtpM2V0kuISneK54bAlie8UWC9CBeR6IUQLZ\nN8dmf1H9VI3i7XZHJPcbb/SS5UmLNgb5zHYogLG1tMgb61leAbu5KYKO3z+enejL\nrn8HmwotGnSE/aPhjon+lh7v0iilYK/wiVzv6y8dHElIVVxSdSVlFpgmPuK1Fre4\noW8G65eQQobgcb3ddG1d1cBbJ4+kGX9N7Zpv0FT2u0vePR6EvEAJSqqiNaTLX5r2\nAbFkgRfFSdBDwLRnM84bQM03rEvFM0isjaoADA7/XaUaSTOUWRxAuCa4M0zNxUEp\nbuIpEm8z0u3JQbNzZJcl\n=8cCY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T19:40:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDlhNmUzODRiNThmNDgxNzQwOTBkZTQ4YjYxMzEyNTRkY2JkYWMzOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77","sha":"b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77"}],"sha":"9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/9a6e384b58f48174090de48b6131254dcbdac39c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:18:25Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T19:18:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): EUREKA_SERVER_URL compose default for auth/variant + render chain drift-guard (#504)\n\n* fix(deploy): EUREKA_SERVER_URL compose default for auth/variant + render chain drift-guard\n\nZanzibar-25 follow-up: admin@example.com homepage broken (browser console\n503 on /api/v1/theme-registry + /api/v1/me/theme/resolved + 403 on /api/auth/cookie).\n\nRoot cause:\n- docker-compose.yml auth-service (line 125) + variant-service (line 186)\n  declared `EUREKA_SERVER_URL: ${EUREKA_SERVER_URL}` WITHOUT `:-` default\n- Canonical /home/halil/platform/env/backend.env didn''t have the key\n- Render chain silently passed empty string to container env\n- variant-service Eureka client couldn''t resolve discovery-server\n  (`There is no known eureka server; cluster server list is empty`)\n- Eureka registry missing VARIANT-SERVICE → gateway lb://VARIANT-SERVICE\n  route resolution failed → 503 on all variant-service endpoints\n\nEvidence from staging log:\n  ERROR DiscoveryClient_VARIANT-SERVICE - was unable to send heartbeat!\n  TransportException: There is no known eureka server; cluster server list is empty\n\nEureka registry after fix: 7/7 services (previously 6/7, variant missing).\n\n## Fix\n1. `backend/docker-compose.yml` — auth-service + variant-service now use\n   `${EUREKA_SERVER_URL:-http://discovery-server:8761/eureka}` pattern\n   (parity with 4 other services already using the :- default)\n2. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh` — added EUREKA_SERVER_URL to the\n   render default-injection block so canonical env always carries the\n   compose discovery URL even when Vault KV is empty. Same pattern as\n   PR #491 (SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_AUDIENCE) + PR #494 (KC_HOSTNAME).\n\n## Ops already applied (immediate unblock)\n- Canonical env appended: `EUREKA_SERVER_URL=http://discovery-server:8761/eureka`\n- variant-service + schema-service recreated via docker compose\n- Eureka registry: 7 services incl. VARIANT-SERVICE verified\n\n## Non-goals\n- K8s profile unaffected — `application-k8s.yml` sets `spring.cloud.discovery.enabled=false`\n- schema-service still not in Eureka (separate concern, service may not\n  be Eureka client by design)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"761a07ccd47c3be464139f8b5034bb496864afe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/761a07ccd47c3be464139f8b5034bb496864afe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/b67172397b32676c9a6d7cd22926d299c51f0a77","verification":{"payload":"tree 761a07ccd47c3be464139f8b5034bb496864afe0\nparent de39d9a6ab26334e99510e7505ee3a80c7b21ca8\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776626305 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776626305 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): EUREKA_SERVER_URL compose default for auth/variant + render chain drift-guard (#504)\n\n* fix(deploy): EUREKA_SERVER_URL compose default for auth/variant + render chain drift-guard\n\nZanzibar-25 follow-up: admin@example.com homepage broken (browser console\n503 on /api/v1/theme-registry + /api/v1/me/theme/resolved + 403 on /api/auth/cookie).\n\nRoot cause:\n- docker-compose.yml auth-service (line 125) + variant-service (line 186)\n  declared `EUREKA_SERVER_URL: ${EUREKA_SERVER_URL}` WITHOUT `:-` default\n- Canonical /home/halil/platform/env/backend.env didn''t have the key\n- Render chain silently passed empty string to container env\n- variant-service Eureka client couldn''t resolve discovery-server\n  (`There is no known eureka server; cluster server list is empty`)\n- Eureka registry missing VARIANT-SERVICE → gateway lb://VARIANT-SERVICE\n  route resolution failed → 503 on all variant-service endpoints\n\nEvidence from staging log:\n  ERROR DiscoveryClient_VARIANT-SERVICE - was unable to send heartbeat!\n  TransportException: There is no known eureka server; cluster server list is empty\n\nEureka registry after fix: 7/7 services (previously 6/7, variant missing).\n\n## Fix\n1. `backend/docker-compose.yml` — auth-service + variant-service now use\n   `${EUREKA_SERVER_URL:-http://discovery-server:8761/eureka}` pattern\n   (parity with 4 other services already using the :- default)\n2. `deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh` — added EUREKA_SERVER_URL to the\n   render default-injection block so canonical env always carries the\n   compose discovery URL even when Vault KV is empty. Same pattern as\n   PR #491 (SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_AUDIENCE) + PR #494 (KC_HOSTNAME).\n\n## Ops already applied (immediate unblock)\n- Canonical env appended: `EUREKA_SERVER_URL=http://discovery-server:8761/eureka`\n- variant-service + schema-service recreated via docker compose\n- Eureka registry: 7 services incl. VARIANT-SERVICE verified\n\n## Non-goals\n- K8s profile unaffected — `application-k8s.yml` sets `spring.cloud.discovery.enabled=false`\n- schema-service still not in Eureka (separate concern, service may not\n  be Eureka client by design)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"va