on-k8s.yml (K8s-ready, Zanzibar-25 Dilim 2 gap) (#502)\n\nK8s-6 session needed permission-service K8s profile to unblock Seviye 1\nZanzibar runtime activation. 7/8 backend services had application-k8s.yml;\npermission-service was the remaining gap after Dilim 1 + Dilim 2 closure\n(d6e0aa8b auth/gateway + fb3a94bc 5-backend).\n\n## Scope\n- `backend/permission-service/src/main/resources/application-k8s.yml` NEW\n\nFollows user-service/variant-service template with permission-service\nspecific adjustments:\n- `server.port=8084` (D-003 TRANSFORMED: K8s Service port 8090 →\n  targetPort 8084; permission-service internal port per base config)\n- Explicit `eureka.client.enabled=false` (permission-service base\n  application.properties sets `eureka.client.enabled=${EUREKA_ENABLED:true}`;\n  template `spring.cloud.discovery.enabled=false` alone doesn''t cover\n  Spring Cloud Eureka client v4 autoconfig)\n- OpenFGA block with K8s-appropriate defaults (`enabled=true` per D-003\n  authz hub + runbook RB-zanzibar-canary; `api-url=http://openfga:8080`\n  per platform-k8s-gitops service DNS contract)\n- Explicit `permission.authz.user-lookup-base-url` + `user-table`\n  (ConfigMap override documentation contract)\n- `management.endpoints.web.exposure.include` adds `metrics` for\n  `/actuator/metrics/tuple_sync_outbox_pending` runbook access\n\n## Non-goals (out of scope, follow-up)\n- platform-k8s-gitops/kustomize/base/apps/permission-service/* manifests\n  (configmap, deployment, service, servicemonitor, kustomization include)\n  — separate PR in that repo\n- application-prod.yml Vault import review (if prod,k8s profile ever used)\n- DB URL defaults (ESO injects SPRING_DATASOURCE_* via ConfigMap/Secret)\n\n## Consultation\nCodex thread 019da556 iter1 REVISE (OpenFGA block + metrics exposure);\niter2 AGREE.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] mvn compile permission-service PASS\n- [x] File structure matches user-service/variant-service template\n- [ ] CI backend-verify green\n- [ ] GitOps manifest follow-up opens in platform-k8s-gitops\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"800af44efb14b743f66b08a992c9ae2738d289d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/800af44efb14b743f66b08a992c9ae2738d289d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/39239011ba1d2fa15f19440058d41ba3d76f33f5","verification":{"payload":"tree 800af44efb14b743f66b08a992c9ae2738d289d0\nparent 722d3688504c3588dc3a053d281bda3ef7f97391\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776596383 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776596383 +0300\n\nfeat(permission-service): application-k8s.yml (K8s-ready, Zanzibar-25 Dilim 2 gap) (#502)\n\nK8s-6 session needed permission-service K8s profile to unblock Seviye 1\nZanzibar runtime activation. 7/8 backend services had application-k8s.yml;\npermission-service was the remaining gap after Dilim 1 + Dilim 2 closure\n(d6e0aa8b auth/gateway + fb3a94bc 5-backend).\n\n## Scope\n- `backend/permission-service/src/main/resources/application-k8s.yml` NEW\n\nFollows user-service/variant-service template with permission-service\nspecific adjustments:\n- `server.port=8084` (D-003 TRANSFORMED: K8s Service port 8090 →\n  targetPort 8084; permission-service internal port per base config)\n- Explicit `eureka.client.enabled=false` (permission-service base\n  application.properties sets `eureka.client.enabled=${EUREKA_ENABLED:true}`;\n  template `spring.cloud.discovery.enabled=false` alone doesn''t cover\n  Spring Cloud Eureka client v4 autoconfig)\n- OpenFGA block with K8s-appropriate defaults (`enabled=true` per D-003\n  authz hub + runbook RB-zanzibar-canary; `api-url=http://openfga:8080`\n  per platform-k8s-gitops service DNS contract)\n- Explicit `permission.authz.user-lookup-base-url` + `user-table`\n  (ConfigMap override documentation contract)\n- `management.endpoints.web.exposure.include` adds `metrics` for\n  `/actuator/metrics/tuple_sync_outbox_pending` runbook access\n\n## Non-goals (out of scope, follow-up)\n- platform-k8s-gitops/kustomize/base/apps/permission-service/* manifests\n  (configmap, deployment, service, servicemonitor, kustomization include)\n  — separate PR in that repo\n- application-prod.yml Vault import review (if prod,k8s profile ever used)\n- DB URL defaults (ESO injects SPRING_DATASOURCE_* via ConfigMap/Secret)\n\n## Consultation\nCodex thread 019da556 iter1 REVISE (OpenFGA block + metrics exposure);\niter2 AGREE.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] mvn compile permission-service PASS\n- [x] File structure matches user-service/variant-service template\n- [ ] CI backend-verify green\n- [ ] GitOps manifest follow-up opens in platform-k8s-gitops\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5LWfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvxIQACbKRE7DTzKvRdNMuciz2luc\n5nj6oEVzJU3QVBJdSsTur3z7dj8/iE2K3iw+pIs8Ixl62SK0FpnK0O7hMsVBGrX9\nbfpgL0xz+JkDm5U80ya1FX5yP27fjOTUvPkTBLcfo/ReRNJm0bZa1bbI1yC13ki4\nKA40bczvjm69g+ZEG0h8CqlMqitFaYmc4u6ds0i6bIc526N9HDMdXHbGr/hxOFu9\njxKLbPmcCxb2ryF+s6iVNRfdwDC37tblIkwrb1Hu5rXp/V6e/uOsKF8PL8HUiSTS\nWfGKUieHnW6vU1cklD/9k7rpuT3dEaY9DhBHrV4IojCW2rNeEB/UHMuz0ICvfhJP\nrMNzNzlT8gVPQS3p1L7SF2h2kfw93W3BMVcUbqxlL4cjJooix0mCIO7r5oR1U1tD\nI7k0DJRVK4Qi+Q4Mk6ksm6G5QtrHNoiwwVUE0srg5iCoM8MxgLMjiVP28XXSNzOL\n5uZUDUl0P5zA1tAl9ZeMvf5fSGbbOTwcw+KNNl+AX2VOH8ZImLBatZtQw4hRjI8b\nfU2B8cXkAkGWcyIjNHdwfIarinEfIBm0CwhgYoyUSSIhyOPMpcQuu6AvSqkWZ/X8\nJ9M8u6JfLvKWhaLLo8jBDYkGzpQbZC18MpbwKzFviNfefgmAmXmTVqnnAUlLcJx5\n6e7SVHC9YJSTH7EBWI85\n=1Goq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T10:59:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"