i.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/445d8376a4f62192a0c689597aedb954f038c3f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T08:52:47Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T08:52:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(canary): seed super_admin module tuples to match k6 persona expectations (OI-03) (#499)\n\n* fix(canary): seed super_admin module tuples to match k6 persona expectations (OI-03)\n\nk6 super_admin persona asserts feature-level OpenFGA relations (can_manage/\nmodule:ACCESS, can_view/module:THEME, can_view/module:REPORT) on top of the\nseeded organization#admin + scope tuples. The OpenFGA model does NOT derive\nmodule access from organization#admin (no inheritance relation defined), so\nsuper_admin would produce ~22% residual mismatch even after the userId\nresolution fix (PR #498).\n\nCodex thread 019da4b5 analysis:\n- PR #498 fixes 4 of 5 personas (read_only/restricted/multi_role_deny/scope_less)\n- super_admin remaining baseline: 3 of 5 assertions would fail without seed\n\nSetup now writes the exact relations k6 expects for super_admin (1204) so\nthe canary matrix is deterministic end-to-end. Non-goal: changing runtime\nsemantics — the model stays as-is; only canary seed is extended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI workflows on PR #499\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b36c6374582ad5836b570590e94314257fb080b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/5b36c6374582ad5836b570590e94314257fb080b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/445d8376a4f62192a0c689597aedb954f038c3f5","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b36c6374582ad5836b570590e94314257fb080b\nparent 46c7ccf56468285ac98bcc488146bb5d372510da\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1776588767 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776588767 +0300\n\nfix(canary): seed super_admin module tuples to match k6 persona expectations (OI-03) (#499)\n\n* fix(canary): seed super_admin module tuples to match k6 persona expectations (OI-03)\n\nk6 super_admin persona asserts feature-level OpenFGA relations (can_manage/\nmodule:ACCESS, can_view/module:THEME, can_view/module:REPORT) on top of the\nseeded organization#admin + scope tuples. The OpenFGA model does NOT derive\nmodule access from organization#admin (no inheritance relation defined), so\nsuper_admin would produce ~22% residual mismatch even after the userId\nresolution fix (PR #498).\n\nCodex thread 019da4b5 analysis:\n- PR #498 fixes 4 of 5 personas (read_only/restricted/multi_role_deny/scope_less)\n- super_admin remaining baseline: 3 of 5 assertions would fail without seed\n\nSetup now writes the exact relations k6 expects for super_admin (1204) so\nthe canary matrix is deterministic end-to-end. Non-goal: changing runtime\nsemantics — the model stays as-is; only canary seed is extended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI workflows on PR #499\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp5JffCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPXEQAK035speXSYSUaJH0GxONqg4\n5N7noGVHCjZ9VKqLyunWVvuzNovL06HAcajNJWCDD4oRFGQ0k3QhLrZgP0F0CnBQ\nnJBsPlvWJC8IMFH23yfGtCflRuHYfjRmtFdNgtTB4giVAaPSeyYfyN9oW9clh4mh\nvQdD2idg+mQHFoOQpQNJwuv