//api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/e09b83fe878a91c1258b8f0f6ef63160f6c0fe0b"}],"sha":"718d4c01483ef25bd25bc9bb5f13a89ee697c485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/718d4c01483ef25bd25bc9bb5f13a89ee697c485"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/e09b83fe878a91c1258b8f0f6ef63160f6c0fe0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T20:27:28Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T20:27:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): write-backend-deploy-stage.sh VAULT_KV_MOUNT consistency (#493)\n\nrender-backend-env.sh and check-backend-deploy-stage.sh both honor\nVAULT_KV_MOUNT (default `secret`), but write-backend-deploy-stage.sh hardcoded\nthe mount segment in its kv_put URL. If an operator ever overrode\nVAULT_KV_MOUNT, prefetch/check/write would target different mounts and the\nwrite/render/check chain would silently break.\n\n- Add VAULT_KV_MOUNT env-default (`secret`)\n- Normalize mount (strip leading/trailing `/`) in kv_put\n- Use mount variable in POST URL + log line\n\nDefault behavior unchanged (`secret`); override path now consistent.\nwrite-backend-deploy-prod.sh (ENV=prod wrapper) inherits automatically.\n\nCodex thread 019da211 AGREE (mini review): scope is consistency-only,\nresidual risk (empty/`/` mount) matches existing render/check pattern.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a58f8b4517eb2a3685f7d4c4c0885d2ae884e91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/0a58f8b4517eb2a3685f7d4c4c0885d2ae884e91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/e09b83fe878a91c1258b8f0f6ef63160f6c0fe0b","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a58f8b4517eb2a3685f7d4c4c0885d2ae884e91\nparent 49dfb135b41d394f9d5b8dd2778b32ae76099f9f\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776544048 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776544048 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): write-backend-deploy-stage.sh VAULT_KV_MOUNT consistency (#493)\n\nrender-backend-env.sh and check-backend-deploy-stage.sh both honor\nVAULT_KV_MOUNT (default `secret`), but write-backend-deploy-stage.sh hardcoded\nthe mount segment in its kv_put URL. If an operator ever overrode\nVAULT_KV_MOUNT, prefetch/check/write would target different mounts and the\nwrite/render/check chain would silently break.\n\n- Add VAULT_KV_MOUNT env-default (`secret`)\n- Normalize mount (strip leading/trailing `/`) in kv_put\n- Use mount variable in POST URL + log line\n\nDefault behavior unchanged (`secret`); override path now consistent.\nwrite-backend-deploy-prod.sh (ENV=prod wrapper) inherits automatically.\n\nCodex thread 019da211 AGREE (mini review): scope is consistency-only,\nresidual risk (empty/`/` mount) matches existing render/check pattern.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4+k