users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/7b374612d51115b0f499e7758d3b0cc6522f7062/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:58:26Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:58:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(user-service): deterministic CSV export rate-limit via Clock injection (#490)\n\n* fix(user-service): deterministic CSV export rate-limit via Clock injection\n\nCsvExportGuardService''in TokenBucket''ı wall-clock (`Instant.now()`) ile refill\nediyordu. MacOS''ta `AuthorizationContextService.buildContext()` ilk istekte\npermission-service DNS çözümlemesi için ~5s Netty time-out''una giriyor, bu da\nbucket''ın ~1 token refill etmesine yol açıp burst-capacity testinin 25. isteğini\n200 olarak döndürüyordu (beklenen: 429). CI Linux''ta DNS hızlı olduğundan\nsemptom görünmüyor.\n\nOption A (Clock injection):\n- `ClockConfig` yeni bean: `Clock.systemUTC()` (prod; `@ConditionalOnMissingBean`)\n- `CsvExportGuardService` + `TokenBucket`: constructor''a `Clock` eklendi, `refill()`\n  artık `clock.instant()` üzerinden çalışıyor.\n- `UserSecurityIntegrationTest.JwtTestConfig`: `@Primary Clock.fixed(...)` bean —\n  testte refill daima 0s görür, determinism wall-clock jitter''ından bağımsız.\n\nVerification (MacOS/JDK21):\n- `UserSecurityIntegrationTest#export_csv_rate_limit_blocks_after_burst_capacity`: PASS (8.855s)\n- Full `UserSecurityIntegrationTest` class: 15/15 PASS\n- Full user-service test suite: 71 PASS / 6 skip / 0 fail\n\nCodex MCP review thread `019da1dc-07a3-7ce3-bdc5-fbc3677b11c1`: APPROVE (7/7).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(fec): add user-service config/service globs to FEC\n\nmodule-delivery-contract-check ve enforcement-check, change_path_globs''da yer\nalmayan user-service java paths için FAIL veriyordu. PR #489 pattern''i aynı\n(permission-service path globs aynı şekilde eklendi). Bu PR''ın CsvExportGuardService\n+ ClockConfig değişiklikleri delivery-scope tarafından kapsanmalı.\n\n- backend/user-service/src/main/java/com/example/user/config/*\n- backend/user-service/src/main/java/com/example/user/service/*\n\nTest paths (src/test/**) zaten policy exclude_globs (`**/test/**`) tarafından\nkapsanıyor, explicit ekleme gerekmiyor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fded31e39877b4facb496648f55b63049e821ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/fded31e39877b4facb496648f55b63049e821ead"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/7b374612d51115b0f499e7758d3b0cc6522f7062","verification":{"payload":"tree fded31e39877b4facb496648f55b63049e821ead\nparent 0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1776538706 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776538706 +0300\n\nfix(user-service): deterministic CSV export rate-limit via Clock injection (#490)\n\n* fix(user-service): deterministic CSV export rate-limit via Clock injection\n\nCsvExportGuardService''in TokenBucket''ı wall-clock (`Instant.now()`) ile refill\nediyordu. MacOS''ta `AuthorizationContextService.buildContext()` ilk istekte\npermission-service DNS çözümlemesi için ~5s Netty time-out''una giriyor, bu da\nbucket''ın ~1 token refill etmesine yol açıp burst-capacity testinin 25. isteğini\n200 olarak döndürüyordu (beklenen: 429). CI Linux''ta DNS hızlı olduğundan\nsemptom görünmüyor.\n\nOption A (Clock injection):\n- `ClockConfig` yeni bean: `Clock.systemUTC()` (prod; `@ConditionalOnMissingBean`)\n- `CsvExportGuardService` + `TokenBucket`: constructor''a `Clock` eklendi, `refill()`\n  artık `clock.instant()` üzerinden çalışıyor.\n- `UserSecurityIntegrationTest.JwtTestConfig`: `@Primary Clock.fixed(...)` bean —\n  testte refill daima 0s görür, determinism wall-clock jitter''ından bağımsız.\n\nVerification (MacOS/JDK21):\n- `UserSecurityIntegrationTest#export_csv_rate_limit_blocks_after_burst_capacity`: PASS (8.855s)\n- Full `UserSecurityIntegrationTest` class: 15/15 PASS\n- Full user-service test suite: 71 PASS / 6 skip / 0 fail\n\nCodex MCP review thread `019da1dc-07a3-7ce3-bdc5-fbc3677b11c1`: APPROVE (7/7).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(fec): add user-service config/service globs to FEC\n\nmodule-delivery-contract-check ve enforcement-check, change_path_globs''da yer\nalmayan user-service java paths için FAIL veriyordu. PR #489 pattern''i aynı\n(permission-service path globs aynı şekilde eklendi). Bu PR''ın CsvExportGuardService\n+ ClockConfig değişiklikleri delivery-scope tarafından kapsanmalı.\n\n- backend/user-service/src/main/java/com/example/user/config/*\n- backend/user-service/src/main/java/com/example/user/service/*\n\nTest paths (src/test/**) zaten policy exclude_globs (`**/test/**`) tarafından\nkapsanıyor, explicit ekleme gerekmiyor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp49RSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6JYQAKpCknqQAJwXpQNTSjxouSSo\nhQEJT2v67AvjRB4RpYUuQmql3Zd2izmAhvUPEOHUJlqeLPlAWPxeGoQd7n/2a+b9\nhWFxa1e3vxsMs+62ZXUU8BxrWvKdQPgmBv+XuNPewGtIWgLWvsC4DS2ba9BVPFwc\nViAYIQ4SpYWU/8cv4rUySXaW79yzfauMhiZrQZbKSspuRUAyK2Ux6dp2VkTvmDVn\nLxPp4W3M9QpPuJaeCnNlpaEwNoWMTgid29YeSCyl10BQGr2H5DJ2AXVHf38JeQCe\nv4t0fyBCjie+nXnqaxCcmg62UWpPp1mPLX8Ay0WF/xQxfjxJ+01zg5T5BLS9mf4g\na81UykWT0gEB0wcWUxp+Nom0B7/YoawZNmRzj6JJA8f9GD5cVQ+Yg3OU+R4bRFeb\nWvgQMxagRhAK/K6feurS54duzBy0RD5QQ4x8lVg977d7wOPBTmd/D68u06PLn5ev\niXgXuCoqEn7OAk9axi6yMsoPqC0PljqNvRNfF4S7JFMsDaY1kxNVB50511bm8ypk\nmQxFtHFkRlZpeKer0h6LLqfH83DzCJS7PgIM6tE1s5bwUoSga3HfHQn2sMUuUZ79\nekv+3WIfx5AEjXLbfZF+P6h16KumHnXTbwFkVCHnLiVT2EFIRt4Bf/8U3drEfvpL\nZxbnKCoWE7jQA8vmPwKj\n=PEL7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T18:58:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/7b374612d51115b0f499e7758d3b0cc6522f7062","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDdiMzc0NjEyZDUxMTE1YjBmNDk5ZTc3NThkM2IwY2M2NTIyZjcwNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861","sha":"0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861"}],"sha":"7b374612d51115b0f499e7758d3b0cc6522f7062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/7b374612d51115b0f499e7758d3b0cc6522f7062"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:32:59Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:32:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(permission): granule-only role_permissions support — DROP NOT NULL + null-guards (OI-03) (#489)\n\n* fix(permission): granule-only role_permissions support — DROP NOT NULL + null-guards (OI-03)\n\nCanary write-path 500 bug: `role_permissions.permission_id NOT NULL violation`\nat AccessControllerV1.updateRoleGranules:219. Root cause: V2 baseline\nschema set permission_id NOT NULL; V5 (STORY-0318) added granule columns\nand left the stale NOT NULL in place even though the RolePermission\nentity mapping and sync paths already treated it as nullable.\n\n## V13 migration\n- ALTER COLUMN permission_id DROP NOT NULL\n- Partial unique index uk_role_permissions_role_granule on\n  (role_id, permission_type, permission_key) WHERE permission_id IS NULL\n- Legacy uk_role_permissions_role_permission kept for non-null legacy rows\n\n## Null-safe paths (granule-only rows have permission=null)\n- PermissionService.snapshotRole — split legacy codes from granule triples;\n  audit now exposes type/key/grant under `granules` key\n- PermissionService.toResponse — filter null permissions out of the legacy\n  permissionModules map; response still returns successfully with empty\n  permissions for granule-only roles\n- AccessRoleService.toDto — byModule grouping admits only PermissionType.MODULE\n  for granule-only rows; ACTION/REPORT granules no longer surface as pseudo-\n  module badges in /v1/roles policies summary\n- AccessRoleService.deriveLevel — null-safe legacy lookup + grantType fallback\n  (DENY→NONE, MANAGE/ALLOW→MANAGE, VIEW→VIEW)\n- AccessRoleService.deriveModuleIdentity — two-phase: legacy canonical-key\n  lookup first, then granule-only MODULE rows return permissionKey directly\n- AccessRoleService.applyLevelForModule — null-guard filters on legacy code\n  match (bulk endpoint, canary non-blocker)\n- AccessRoleService.cloneRole — granule-only source copies type/key/grant\n  directly instead of calling apply(null)\n- RolePermissionGranuleDefaults.apply — null guard; resolve(null) no longer\n  NPEs\n\n## Unit tests (19/19 PASS)\n- AccessRoleServiceTest: deriveModuleIdentity_granuleOnlyModuleRow_returnsPermissionKey\n- AccessRoleServiceTest: getRole_withMixedGranules_skipsActionGranulesFromPolicies\n- PermissionServiceTest: assignRole_withGranuleOnlyRole_doesNotNpeAndReturnsEmptyLegacyPermissions\n\n## Consultation trail\n- Codex thread 019da1af-iter1 REVISE (4 NPE bombs flagged)\n- Codex thread 019da1af-iter2 AGREE post-impl\n- Codex thread 019da1ce (local gate user-service flake) — worktree light mode\n  + separate PR for rate-limit determinism\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI workflows on PR #489\n\n* chore(fec): add permission-service Java service/controller/test globs to FEC\n\nmodule-delivery-contract-check requires java source paths in change_path_globs;\nprevious contract only covered resources/migrations. This PR''s permission-service\nnull-safe edits (AccessRoleService, PermissionService, RolePermissionGranuleDefaults)\nneed the java paths to be delivery-scope covered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6bc69d2732e52d7c1fce65f084b48c29ba932a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/b6bc69d2732e52d7c1fce65f084b48c29ba932a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/0a550f40c084bc4bd7391c7e7c3b0c1579d91861","verification":{"payload":"tree b6bc69d2732e52d7c1fce65f084b48c29ba932a7\nparent c63fb19abbb7f46003ab5c5afc346c61739f19e7\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1776537179 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776537179 +0300\n\nfix(permission): granule-only role_permissions support — DROP NOT NULL + null-guards (OI-03) (#489)\n\n* fix(permission): granule-only role_permissions support — DROP NOT NULL + null-guards (OI-03)\n\nCanary write-path 500 bug: `role_permissions.permission_id NOT NULL violation`\nat AccessControllerV1.updateRoleGranules:219. Root cause: V2 baseline\nschema set permission_id NOT NULL; V5 (STORY-0318) added granule columns\nand left the stale NOT NULL in place even though the RolePermission\nentity mapping and sync paths already treated it as nullable.\n\n## V13 migration\n- ALTER COLUMN permission_id DROP NOT NULL\n- Partial unique index uk_role_permissions_role_granule on\n  (role_id, permission_type, permission_key) WHERE permission_id IS NULL\n- Legacy uk_role_permissions_role_permission kept for non-null legacy rows\n\n## Null-safe paths (granule-only rows have permission=null)\n- PermissionService.snapshotRole — split legacy codes from granule triples;\n  audit now exposes type/key/grant under `granules` key\n- PermissionService.toResponse — filter null permissions out of the legacy\n  permissionModules map; response still returns successfully with empty\n  permissions for granule-only roles\n- AccessRoleService.toDto — byModule grouping admits only PermissionType.MODULE\n  for granule-only rows; ACTION/REPORT granules no longer surface as pseudo-\n  module badges in /v1/roles policies summary\n- AccessRoleService.deriveLevel — null-safe legacy lookup + grantType fallback\n  (DENY→NONE, MANAGE/ALLOW→MANAGE, VIEW→VIEW)\n- AccessRoleService.deriveModuleIdentity — two-phase: legacy canonical-key\n  lookup first, then granule-only MODULE rows return permissionKey directly\n- AccessRoleService.applyLevelForModule — null-guard filters on legacy code\n  match (bulk endpoint, canary non-blocker)\n- AccessRoleService.cloneRole — granule-only source copies type/key/grant\n  directly instead of calling apply(null)\n- RolePermissionGranuleDefaults.apply — null guard; resolve(null) no longer\n  NPEs\n\n## Unit tests (19/19 PASS)\n- AccessRoleServiceTest: deriveModuleIdentity_granuleOnlyModuleRow_returnsPermissionKey\n- AccessRoleServiceTest: getRole_withMixedGranules_skipsActionGranulesFromPolicies\n- PermissionServiceTest: assignRole_withGranuleOnlyRole_doesNotNpeAndReturnsEmptyLegacyPermissions\n\n## Consultation trail\n- Codex thread 019da1af-iter1 REVISE (4 NPE bombs flagged)\n- Codex thread 019da1af-iter2 AGREE post-impl\n- Codex thread 019da1ce (local gate user-service flake) — worktree light mode\n  + separate PR for rate-limit determinism\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: trigger CI workflows on PR #489\n\n* chore(fec): add permission-service Java service/controller/test globs to FEC\n\nmodule-delivery-contract-check requires java source paths in change_path_globs;\nprevious contract only covered resources/migrations. This PR''s permission-service\nnull-safe edits (AccessRoleService, PermissionService, RolePermissionGranuleDefaults)\nneed the java paths to be delivery-scope covered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp485bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADakQADxlWLOwlnbDWlPh1W9ff7Dm\nJVvIfF8s57wfBeX7+VSt2O8FYmhG1XMAdhFpHZ3VWOJXvfyXHFVJ3dxC65qTMtAi\nzMtvpgGkXVADIc+tPs30kHEJQ+j8g52BAQuUMNJWvgIYQNvY/VxynwOXmpRkFmIW\n57ZbPDbnMEOELqGj37M3L9cRbdY47Y21WwVTMeUWGbbBHeaABpuZcikZlPk3Vrq8\nZA3CBcLLnvP2qdEnOfiUE+h1kgEWLi2zmyY3yuwgN9woTgLD8PlMcorOwX5blmn6\npDpkTj2FvRisqd3XTchRR8cLMEf7y5ehPLCyxbMvBdKXFpTkKtgjdOqMJ7LUTvpD\nA2iugeymm9POLcJohJyB1Xgbhxlt1qvqcqIGfmel8sslfR/TzVqvCaQhABImrBwj\nwzvgTfqiOUi2AzvoiBo0EbjjlwjZKGetAxXPrsAOHKj2tlAw4Fm+YZD6uFodj0Pu\nEQjjAn8ad4I+ja8eUUt2lmEtO9jpoBG2vWbh8xKtde0s+RM