-service}\n```\n\nLocal dev default preserved (`permission-service`). Stage canonical env can\nnow expand to full 8-audience list (frontend,user-service,variant-service,\npermission-service,core-data-service,account,realm-management,broker) which\ncovers canary + browser frontend token aud.\n\nSame env-chain drift class as PR #484, #486 — one more hardcoded wire needed\nsubstitution.\n\nOI-03 root-cause chain so far:\n- Bug A (DB): canary-admin legacy → canary-super-admin rename (one-off staging ops)\n- Bug B layer 1 (PR #486): permission-service SECURITY_AUTH_ALLOWED_CLIENT_IDS env wire\n- Bug B layer 2 (canonical env): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUERS +localhost:8081\n- Bug B layer 3 (THIS PR): SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_AUDIENCE substitution\n\nExpected post-deploy: canary-restricted `/authz/me` → 200.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92d3c8f1c5eff9eb4eaf3d9887733f4b72b8f2aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/92d3c8f1c5eff9eb4eaf3d9887733f4b72b8f2aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/c63fb19abbb7f46003ab5c5afc346c61739f19e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 92d3c8f1c5eff9eb4eaf3d9887733f4b72b8f2aa\nparent e59b0f5bf47eb08a9b97e864fc6368859781e152\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776530690 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776530690 +0300\n\nfix(compose): permission-service SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_* env substitution (OI-03 Bug B deepest) (#487)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-03 canary Bug B deepest layer: `/authz/me` 401 persisted after\nSECURITY_JWT_ISSUERS expansion (PR #486) + localhost:8081 issuer + Vault KV\npush. Root cause: secondary decoder''s AUDIENCE hardcoded as\n`permission-service` in compose (no ${...} substitution) → canonical env\noverride (list of 8 audiences including `account`) ignored → canary-load\nclient tokens (aud=account) rejected by secondary decoder validator.\n\nFix: change three secondary env lines to substitution pattern (matching\nprimary AUDIENCE/ISSUER/JWK_SET_URI already-canonical pattern):\n\n```\n- SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_JWK_SET_URI=${...:-http://keycloak:8080/...}\n- SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_ISSUER=${...:-http://localhost:8081/realms/serban}\n- SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_AUDIENCE=${...:-permission-service}\n```\n\nLocal dev default preserved (`permission-service`). Stage canonical env can\nnow expand to full 8-audience list (frontend,user-service,variant-service,\npermission-service,core-data-service,account,realm-management,broker) which\ncovers canary + browser frontend token aud.\n\nSame env-chain drift class as PR #484, #486 — one more hardcoded wire needed\nsubstitution.\n\nOI-03 root-cause chain so far:\n- Bug A (DB): canary-admin legacy → canary-super-admin rename (one-off staging ops)\n- Bug B layer 1 (PR #486): permission-service SECURITY_AUTH_ALLOWED_CLIENT_IDS env wire\n- Bug B layer 2 (canonical env): SECURITY_JWT_ISSUERS +localhost:8081\n- Bug B layer 3 (THIS PR): SECURITY_JWT_SECONDARY_AUDIENCE substitution\n\nExpected post-deploy: canary-restricted `/authz/me` → 200.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp47UCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI3UQAJS8733DQpW86wjO7sxS7RBZ\nM75ST6/RcqDeS6k8WQqOg+UkIvWO3d75omWvuCmKHyuKbJpdwiEkZY9tHMsxynhf\nVx0CoQ20Z28TdpDO+7QHoynxUDDnqX5aR8tDZP8lzAng7j9AvEGoVomdA3yhzpCJ\n1fQChuaQRgudmL7URRNxR4zJvjicUp06O/IguyLIIS+tvBGdhIxktQ7/3yxhcRdG\ni4K8EUBLOTTZuE+YnPU09w7TPEP4TearpjYN46TyTgQx7upMFzKzojweiQ6dpJON\ni8GaBR60pb4Ij8rWIbIung8rh+cCdavox43eykQIC6aoY2PmfBILXQ6+/cZUbIxE\nFgdB3hFGN0C2CU0kZByT0lc2L1hiT49UFG7QaKYPevONyxpshPiw3aj1m0KXi4to\nl2IlklwkcptaJxP5PLojVLTnMJqZM6oBjCiQ5xYS222faiPqXpVG97IVCRspuIdn\nq9ctGftvWp9EGkIL6aspU28nr7u2Cd71LWIzhUlFR48gJRNpINqLzWWV9P51VcDH\nPewLHlXIRr+FKOEyxJo89y8paZJupV9HxHfYYrSAd73r+kUaHC6w1qm/xlmzS12V\nqsf3+6PSPZTG1eRuiJDIpsT+Yi/jhd1gwFRK1R5n0WEtVqm+s+JNoed7wujk59l3\noAw+zwsxCZr6SEZv8wxM\n=zUUS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\