https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/50c1fa29051046694722cae6470bb1d48b728207/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T09:21:45Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T09:21:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deploy): Drift #2 render pre-deploy fail-closed flip (OI-02 Option B post-closure) (#475)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 Option B closure proven runtime Vault consumer path\n(auth-service + permission-service /actuator/health/vault UP). Drift #2\ncan now safely flip:\n\n**Default flip (.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml):**\n- `render_env_before_deploy` stage default: `false` → `true`\n- Every deploy re-renders canonical backend.env from Vault KV (AppRole auth)\n- Stale env + manual drift class (2026-04-18 incident class) eliminated\n- Emergency rollback: `workflow_dispatch render_env_before_deploy=false`\n\n**Fail-closed hardening (deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh):**\nCodex PR review REVISE flagged that default flip alone would NOT fully close\nthe drift class — the render script''s graceful degradation (keep existing\nbackend.env when Vault KV missing or incomplete) masks silent failures.\nNow hard-fails on two paths:\n\n- Path missing (`secret/data/<env>/backend-deploy/config` 404):\n  Previous behavior → keep existing env. New → exit 1 with remediation hint.\n- Required keys missing from KV payload:\n  Previous behavior → log + keep existing. New → exit 1, operator must\n  run `write-backend-deploy-stage.sh` to populate missing keys.\n\n**Why hard-fail is correct here:**\n- Stage intended to mirror prod authz posture. Silent drift in stage creates\n  false confidence before prod cutover gate (OI-04).\n- Manual canonical env edits can no longer accidentally persist across\n  deploys — Vault is single source of truth.\n- Every deploy exercises AppRole login + KV read cycle, catching transient\n  issues (Vault unreachable, policy drift, token expired) immediately.\n\n**Rollback runway:**\nworkflow_dispatch → `render_env_before_deploy=false` → skip render entirely,\nuse current canonical env. Used only when Vault is verified down or the\ncanonical env was hand-rotated outside Vault (rare, break-glass).\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9fdb` plan review REVISE — combined flip +\nfail-closed hardening, not default flip alone.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9c8d149a09ec4980b079492702cc4a36eaf8610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/c9c8d149a09ec4980b079492702cc4a36eaf8610"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/50c1fa29051046694722cae6470bb1d48b728207","verification":{"payload":"tree c9c8d149a09ec4980b079492702cc4a36eaf8610\nparent a37aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776504105 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776504105 +0300\n\nfeat(deploy): Drift #2 render pre-deploy fail-closed flip (OI-02 Option B post-closure) (#475)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 Option B closure proven runtime Vault consumer path\n(auth-service + permission-service /actuator/health/vault UP). Drift #2\ncan now safely flip:\n\n**Default flip (.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml):**\n- `render_env_before_deploy` stage default: `false` → `true`\n- Every deploy re-renders canonical backend.env from Vault KV (AppRole auth)\n- Stale env + manual drift class (2026-04-18 incident class) eliminated\n- Emergency rollback: `workflow_dispatch render_env_before_deploy=false`\n\n**Fail-closed hardening (deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh):**\nCodex PR review REVISE flagged that default flip alone would NOT fully close\nthe drift class — the render script''s graceful degradation (keep existing\nbackend.env when Vault KV missing or incomplete) masks silent failures.\nNow hard-fails on two paths:\n\n- Path missing (`secret/data/<env>/backend-deploy/config` 404):\n  Previous behavior → keep existing env. New → exit 1 with remediation hint.\n- Required keys missing from KV payload:\n  Previous behavior → log + keep existing. New → exit 1, operator must\n  run `write-backend-deploy-stage.sh` to populate missing keys.\n\n**Why hard-fail is correct here:**\n- Stage intended to mirror prod authz posture. Silent drift in stage creates\n  false confidence before prod cutover gate (OI-04).\n- Manual canonical env edits can no longer accidentally persist across\n  deploys — Vault is single source of truth.\n- Every deploy exercises AppRole login + KV read cycle, catching transient\n  issues (Vault unreachable, policy drift, token expired) immediately.\n\n**Rollback runway:**\nworkflow_dispatch → `render_env_before_deploy=false` → skip render entirely,\nuse current canonical env. Used only when Vault is verified down or the\ncanonical env was hand-rotated outside Vault (rare, break-glass).\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9fdb` plan review REVISE — combined flip +\nfail-closed hardening, not default flip alone.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp400pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFoQQADpYDK/