7aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a","sha":"a37aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/a37aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a"}],"sha":"50c1fa29051046694722cae6470bb1d48b728207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/50c1fa29051046694722cae6470bb1d48b728207"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/a37aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:51:02Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:51:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(auth-service): SERVICE_JWT_* → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* naming unification (OI-02 post-mortem) (#473)\n\n* fix(auth-service): SERVICE_JWT_* → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* naming unification (OI-02 post-mortem)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 incident exposed a critical 3-way naming drift:\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml`: set `SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY` env\n- `auth-service/application.properties`: reads `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY`\n- `render-backend-env.sh` + `deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml`: write/map\n  `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY`\n\nConsequence: stage compose''s `SERVICE_JWT_*` env was silently IGNORED by\nauth-service. With Spring Cloud Vault disabled (stage default), the service\nfell through to empty string and generated ephemeral RSA key on every boot.\nRestart = key rotation = all prior service tokens invalidated.\n\nAdditionally, `application-docker.properties` had blank overrides:\n  security.service-jwt.private-key=\n  security.service-jwt.public-key=\n\nThese masked the env-var-aware fallback chain from `application.properties`,\nforcing empty values in docker profile regardless of env.\n\nFix:\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml`: user-service + auth-service env key rename\n  `SERVICE_JWT_*` → `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_*`\n- `backend/auth-service/src/main/resources/application-docker.properties`:\n  replace blank overrides with the same env-aware fallback chain used by\n  `application.properties` (`${AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_*:${vault.jwt.auth-service.*:}}`)\n- `backend/scripts/verify-service-jwt-env.sh`: update required env list\n- `backend/scripts/vault/check-backend-deploy-stage.sh`: update fallback\n  hint message\n\nSERVICE_JWT_KEY_ID remains unchanged — it''s a shared identifier (not\nauth-service-specific).\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9f9f` post-mortem + `019d9fa6` plan review\nREVISE (naming standardization verdict)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(rehearsal): app-level-schema.yml SERVICE_JWT → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT parity (Codex #473 PARTIAL)\n\n* fix(fec): cover verify-service-jwt-env.sh (CI unblock PR #473)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aa56f14e5cee67c1baa6d81449c546d2fa79fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/3aa56f14e5cee67c1baa6d81449c546d2fa79fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/a37aee289e411bc764bd7378210d6840d51fa29a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3aa56f14e5cee67c1baa6d81449c546d2fa79fc9\nparent 0631084e4f954f40f9244d6b7ad9ff75d257ccf5\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776502262 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776502262 +0300\n\nfix(auth-service): SERVICE_JWT_* → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* naming unification (OI-02 post-mortem) (#473)\n\n* fix(auth-service): SERVICE_JWT_* → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* naming unification (OI-02 post-mortem)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 incident exposed a critical 3-way naming drift:\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml`: set `SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY` env\n- `auth-service/application.properties`: reads `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY`\n- `render-backend-env.sh` + `deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml`: write/map\n  `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_PRIVATE_KEY`\n\nConsequence: stage compose''s `SERVICE_JWT_*` env was silently IGNORED by\nauth-service. With Spring Cloud Vault disabled (stage default), the service\nfell through to empty string and generated ephemeral RSA key on every boot.\nRestart = key rotation = all prior service tokens invalidated.\n\nAdditionally, `application-docker.properties` had blank overrides:\n  security.service-jwt.private-key=\n  security.service-jwt.public-key=\n\nThese masked the env-var-aware fallback chain from `application.properties`,\nforcing empty values in docker profile regardless of env.\n\nFix:\n- `backend/docker-compose.yml`: user-service + auth-service env key rename\n  `SERVICE_JWT_*` → `AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_*`\n- `backend/auth-service/src/main/resources/application-docker.properties`:\n  replace blank overrides with the same env-aware fallback chain used by\n  `application.properties` (`${AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_*:${vault.jwt.auth-service.*:}}`)\n- `backend/scripts/verify-service-jwt-env.sh`: update required env list\n- `backend/scripts/vault/check-backend-deploy-stage.sh`: update fallback\n  hint message\n\nSERVICE_JWT_KEY_ID remains unchanged — it''s a shared identifier (not\nauth-service-specific).\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9f9f` post-mortem + `019d9fa6` plan review\nREVISE (naming standardization verdict)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(rehearsal): app-level-schema.yml SERVICE_JWT → AUTH_SERVICE_JWT parity (Codex #473 PARTIAL)\n\n* fix(fec): cover verify-service-jwt-env.sh (CI unblock PR #473)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp40X2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVSMQAKrYE87hajoBVxUY/Cr0yj6d\nwDwN1KWz9QwpFEwCn/tiIZ06wk1qpqliaY4QEhqrblE8H7U0G5PuriWYJazuSFmH\ncfdFn3p9r3+Zw2AmuyDVXFCDfg46ruBGWBiTTvuH0JK2o7I9H44IXpklE9jKX01n\n5F1qMIk+KC5qlCpf0FsNHOyxluVsjuWNmtIUfFgD1NMVQFTp0VWyXFQqK9P0YRxM\n1EriA2xt/bsutdgYjaHxH4aK3tI3ExQsgs7IwVwGk+MnLBPNe4P9SJy/tpdFqW2R\neAj1NeibOWuJtCKTt6d+aN2T5FI6g2+ShmClRwKgBRSVRXA00CElUsQOszNV2Wzo\n1d3cDuvgRYJWhBokUXqbn/wSbh7tT+ZhJqpyYVK81ahsaqgl1PakUBGdo0pUnguf\n3gDryUVyvKhuBG0ciOfxE9mJG3cSnRNbAcz/vldgN6QgkzcUT4sJMHaYhAaMiTDc\nqChW7vnvJhHw3os4OpGGf+ynoH3oUNtCZdVoNvGjbHUaF+ywhJElonmYdpQWh0aX\nT2OfY0QemjIHmimaUw87Bl6zRaRpwQlb+yC6DrTVmsYR6jl5dFldfR4MGX/Y9LFB\n2a3rXYaMbvQfZUzfmruPsmOgkQGMnFYOB9wKoDLcfwVGu+Y+BRr4mUNk6I7drt9i\n87SnNGfzBblF1rClS6dw\n=1jM9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T08:51:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_eve