ts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:39:02Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T08:39:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(vault-approle): runbook scope split + OI-02 incident troubleshooting (Codex PR #14) (#474)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 post-mortem uncovered scope confusion in\n`RB-vault-approle-setup-stage.md` — runbook didn''t distinguish between:\n1. **Host render scope** (deploy-time): `secret/data/stage/backend-deploy/config`\n2. **Runtime Vault consumer scope**: `secret/data/stage/jwt/auth-service`\n   + per-service `secret/data/stage/db/*`\n\nBoth scopes are served by the same AppRole (`backend-deploy-stage`), but\nthe §2 \"Etkilenen path''ler\" section listed paths flatly, implying deploy-\nonly scope. This caused policy heredoc to miss runtime paths → 2026-04-18\nauth-service 403.\n\nChanges:\n- §2 scope split: host render paths vs runtime Vault consumer paths, with\n  policy source-of-truth reference (`backend/infra/vault/policies/backend-\n  deploy-runtime.hcl`, PR #13 refactor).\n- §5 new troubleshooting entries:\n  - \"Runtime Vault consumer 403 (auth-service/permission-service)\" —\n    policy missing runtime path, resolution via seed script re-run + HCL\n    verification\n  - \"Runtime auth-service ephemeral RSA key (silent)\" — PR #15 naming fix\n    incident + resolution (canonical env AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* or Spring\n    Cloud Vault enabled + KV populated)\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9fa6` plan review PARTIAL — runbook scope split\ndocs-only, independent merge OK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b3fb3cd28cfc9d1bd08cd174c5ba4bc44c7308d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/0b3fb3cd28cfc9d1bd08cd174c5ba4bc44c7308d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/0631084e4f954f40f9244d6b7ad9ff75d257ccf5","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b3fb3cd28cfc9d1bd08cd174c5ba4bc44c7308d\nparent 8f6fb71175c5dd8d03a9715f7a199f184a55ae25\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776501542 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776501542 +0300\n\ndocs(vault-approle): runbook scope split + OI-02 incident troubleshooting (Codex PR #14) (#474)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 post-mortem uncovered scope confusion in\n`RB-vault-approle-setup-stage.md` — runbook didn''t distinguish between:\n1. **Host render scope** (deploy-time): `secret/data/stage/backend-deploy/config`\n2. **Runtime Vault consumer scope**: `secret/data/stage/jwt/auth-service`\n   + per-service `secret/data/stage/db/*`\n\nBoth scopes are served by the same AppRole (`backend-deploy-stage`), but\nthe §2 \"Etkilenen path''ler\" section listed paths flatly, implying deploy-\nonly scope. This caused policy heredoc to miss runtime paths → 2026-04-18\nauth-service 403.\n\nChanges:\n- §2 scope split: host render paths vs runtime Vault consumer paths, with\n  policy source-of-truth reference (`backend/infra/vault/policies/backend-\n  deploy-runtime.hcl`, PR #13 refactor).\n- §5 new troubleshooting entries:\n  - \"Runtime Vault consumer 403 (auth-service/permission-service)\" —\n    policy missing runtime path, resolution via seed script re-run + HCL\n    verification\n  - \"Runtime auth-service ephemeral RSA key (silent)\" — PR #15 naming fix\n    incident + resolution (canonical env AUTH_SERVICE_JWT_* or Spring\n    Cloud Vault enabled + KV populated)\n\nCodex review: thread `019d9fa6` plan review PARTIAL — runbook scope split\ndocs-only, independent merge OK.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp40MmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl1YQAEQouMng+jpIqsDEbdhN6DYd\naKJ2yIxMHTNCr4j6RtQaSJsX8ssdtVOJ0lQ0nN5nOZqUhFIoS8GYUwq926USVdKm\nPQgGhQL6QmTyhAuvlRRI7RxOGwGeUM/7oAjJuq/0dmcncrpwIXW2GgGtpCzaEppb\nEneXDYP/DAKs+cMgMVbfyKdeEgzHyh7VV+3QKrAISd4e4+R9H3ATSRJDnfp5Z+J2\n1KyvrlVvgmyxLJN4ZPbt7