vice`) + per-\nservice DB paths now automatically in scope when policy is applied.\n\nTemplate placeholder `{{env}}` is substituted with ${ENV_NAME} via sed\nat seed time. Self-binding paths (role-id read, secret-id update) remain\nin the script because they''re role-name-specific and don''t belong in the\nshared template.\n\nRefs:\n- `backend/infra/vault/policies/backend-deploy-runtime.hcl` (canonical)\n- Codex thread `019d9f9f` post-mortem + `019d9fa6` plan review PARTIAL\n- RB-vault-approle-setup-stage.md scope split (PR #14 follow-up)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc25dec026aa1ab71d75f1682c865586df8ddf44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/dc25dec026aa1ab71d75f1682c865586df8ddf44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/8f6fb71175c5dd8d03a9715f7a199f184a55ae25","verification":{"payload":"tree dc25dec026aa1ab71d75f1682c865586df8ddf44\nparent 383170e0fcb8a7074cbaa61dab2fdad1bdb855b9\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776501137 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776501137 +0300\n\nfix(vault): seed-stage-approle.sh policy source-of-truth → HCL file (OI-02 post-mortem) (#472)\n\n2026-04-18 OI-02 incident post-mortem: seed script inline heredoc policy\nmissed `secret/data/stage/jwt/auth-service` + per-service `db/*` paths,\nwhile `backend/infra/vault/policies/backend-deploy-runtime.hcl` already\nhad them. Drift class: single source of truth violated across 3 artifacts\n(seed heredoc + HCL file + check-backend-deploy-stage.sh required_keys).\n\nThis commit eliminates the heredoc and makes the seed script load the\ncanonical HCL policy template. Runtime path (`jwt/auth-service`) + per-\nservice DB paths now automatically in scope when policy is applied.\n\nTemplate placeholder `{{env}}` is substituted with ${ENV_NAME} via sed\nat seed time. Self-binding paths (role-id read, secret-id update) remain\nin the script because they''re rol