227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/583bf9aaa792474ced90c4d9e1df418629da7dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T07:15:24Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T07:15:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(vault-check): KV db/* + jwt/auth-service path existence + field validation (Codex Thread 3 Drift #4) (#470)\n\nCodex Thread 3 drift hunt (2026-04-18) flagged that `write-secrets-stage.sh`\nwrites per-service DB creds (`secret/<env>/db/{auth,user,permission,variant}-service`)\nand JWT signing keys (`secret/<env>/jwt/auth-service`), but `check-backend-deploy-stage.sh`\ndoes not verify any of these paths. Silent drift gap: if a DB cred path is\nmissing or fields drift, `render-backend-env.sh` falls back to shared\nPOSTGRES_* creds and per-service isolation is lost — no doctor signal until\nintegration failure surfaces (often as generic DB connection error).\n\nThis commit adds post-required check loop:\n\n- `secret/<env>/db/auth-service`  expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/user-service`  expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/permission-service` expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/variant-service` expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/jwt/auth-service` expects {privateKey, publicKey}\n\nTreatment: path ABSENT is OK (informational log — fallback path documented\nin the message). Path PRESENT but field MISSING is FAIL (drift detected).\nThis matches the operational contract: per-service creds are opt-in\nhardening, but once seeded they must be complete.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef7a6c1146deb3950797f023ee10f3c1c6071c46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/ef7a6c1146deb3950797f023ee10f3c1c6071c46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/583bf9aaa792474ced90c4d9e1df418629da7dd8","verification":{"payload":"tree ef7a6c1146deb3950797f023ee10f3c1c6071c46\nparent 68c47f6ba3f736c0f1ba87590a2711a8884d3908\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776496524 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776496524 +0300\n\nfeat(vault-check): KV db/* + jwt/auth-service path existence + field validation (Codex Thread 3 Drift #4) (#470)\n\nCodex Thread 3 drift hunt (2026-04-18) flagged that `write-secrets-stage.sh`\nwrites per-service DB creds (`secret/<env>/db/{auth,user,permission,variant}-service`)\nand JWT signing keys (`secret/<env>/jwt/auth-service`), but `check-backend-deploy-stage.sh`\ndoes not verify any of these paths. Silent drift gap: if a DB cred path is\nmissing or fields drift, `render-backend-env.sh` falls back to shared\nPOSTGRES_* creds and per-service isolation is lost — no doctor signal until\nintegration failure surfaces (often as generic DB connection error).\n\nThis commit adds post-required check loop:\n\n- `secret/<env>/db/auth-service`  expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/user-service`  expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/permission-service` expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/db/variant-service` expects {url, user, password}\n- `secret/<env>/jwt/auth-service` expects {privateKey, publicKey}\n\nTreatment: path ABSENT is OK (informational log — fallback path documented\nin the message). Path PRESENT but field MISSING is FAIL (drift detected).\nThis matches the operational contract: per-service creds are opt-in\nhardening, but once seeded they must be complete.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4y+MCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApvoQAGiU79McFxlNgHrToqRicdaw\nPAq0YJ+q+ISHkIuoqp2IVqOtIQmoEN6fb4lxGuIxUWKM0HMmKyg//zL1q6nlYmGH\n94ktTfwvj85yPj68OQd9nRunxO0GvXBKyHw+AZbVOGAOGIcQ0mLrC5OFhKMVX7eW\nS4na7/wz1L/wvxtv490dHqd/LMINq6mMXRn485cpFSPDd1qV60uPWj5wD4U13XBb\nJ5Hm8VB9yD4ROMYkm0n2jqnSapw9I8OO0JqVNTOWprQd1CawCf1FbtW+xT+oqoxx\nukjOaZPviFhALMUIhtY0V3LBQ+j7Fz194WP9LsW0Vy6WDFaPoPA2jzHmkNdu1hs6\nNykTrBoG3J/dicMmzwu3BsWsFg8Z0wMrWozbYvSj9ZcJk+GW+n4IRo04b7dE8Bjz\npCMaFJME7VcNlPzk9227LM1jWtCbq6nawF8RttsREfnI/x4yGoBzcMC2OC0NKBcN\nqCZWeT3GhgC0VSDWdNa4VzueAQN4ofLo4EA7QrvibpzW8GURscC4g5NlKxoWfVXu\nhjDjQwA/TjJfI9zwI+UyHQnopAI5RLFnMei9JAYQ+fddk6Xih1R7Si0OCdLfzcfQ\n/wkKFBfnHCVdjQ1VMejux9xIfsM56MTPC/+S9t/GB2E1QpaU8Vhp/KJn+8sxPbA9\nWzL/jwnB/+VqA2Um3abK\n=yxl+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T07:15:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"