ers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/a4b3673b2823a1859695430fa9f80e297c7ab162/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:53:18Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T06:53:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): fail-closed WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM port assertion + README drift (PR #464 CRITICAL follow-up) (#467)\n\nCodex post-merge review flagged PR #464 as CRITICAL: comment-only guardrail\ndoes not prevent the next operator from re-introducing\n`WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082` on stage, which silently 502s\nvia nginx since stage compose hardcodes api-gateway `8080:8080`.\n\nThis commit adds enforcement at the actual decision point:\n- `deploy/ubuntu/run-frontend-nginx-container.sh` now performs a\n  DEPLOY_ENV-aware port assertion after the existing fallback. stage|staging\n  must be `:8080`, prod|production must be `:8082`. Mismatch → exit 1 with\n  remediation command printed to stderr.\n- `deploy/ubuntu/README.md:241-243` was still recommending\n  `WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082` as the stage example. Fixed\n  to `:8080` with explicit stage-vs-prod note + 2026-04-18 incident\n  reference.\n\nTest: `DEPLOY_ENV=stage NGINX_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082 bash\nrun-frontend-nginx-container.sh` → exits 1 with helpful error. DEPLOY_ENV=\nstage with `:8080` (default) or prod with `:8082` → pass-through unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2aa1cf62aad30c495cfd845cbb6eeeb7763c4319","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/2aa1cf62aad30c495cfd845cbb6eeeb7763c4319"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/a4b3673b2823a1859695430fa9f80e297c7ab162","verification":{"payload":"tree 2aa1cf62aad30c495cfd845cbb6eeeb7763c4319\nparent 3dcbf52605a6829112d8f2ee7819710af6b809f3\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776495198 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776495198 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): fail-closed WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM port assertion + README drift (PR #464 CRITICAL follow-up) (#467)\n\nCodex post-merge review flagged PR #464 as CRITICAL: comment-only guardrail\ndoes not prevent the next operator from re-introducing\n`WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082` on stage, which silently 502s\nvia nginx since stage compose hardcodes api-gateway `8080:8080`.\n\nThis commit adds enforcement at the actual decision point:\n- `deploy/ubuntu/run-frontend-nginx-container.sh` now performs a\n  DEPLOY_ENV-aware port assertion after the existing fallback. stage|staging\n  must be `:8080`, prod|production must be `:8082`. Mismatch → exit 1 with\n  remediation command printed to stderr.\n- `deploy/ubuntu/README.md:241-243` was still recommending\n  `WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082` as the stage example. Fixed\n  to `:8080` with explicit stage-vs-prod note + 2026-04-18 incident\n  reference.\n\nTest: `DEPLOY_ENV=stage NGINX_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8082 bash\nrun-frontend-nginx-container.sh` → exits 1 with helpful error. DEPLOY_ENV=\nstage with `:8080` (default) or prod 