thub.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/c8318e98ab2f0cb0e304d375fb55136e14698b74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/64e1ddb79db968424424610e8db8f7973f44899a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T00:32:39Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T00:32:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(vault,canary): staging AppRole kalıcı setup + canary pre-flight checklist (STORY-0319 OI-02 unblock) (#463)\n\nOI-01 STORY-0319 CLOSED sonrası OI-02 synthetic canary canlı run prereq''i.\nPR #3d soft-fail guard geçici; kalıcı çözüm AppRole auth method Vault''ta\nenable + policy + role + canonical env real ID''ler.\n\n### Yeni artefakt''lar\n\n**docs/04-operations/RUNBOOKS/RB-vault-approle-setup-stage.md** (7-section)\n- AMAÇ / KAPSAM / BAŞLATMA-DURDURMA (preflight + otomatik setup + verify\n  + post-setup rehearsal + rollback) / GÖZLEMLEME / ARIZA (5 senaryo:\n  mount 404, secret-id expired, token leak, policy drift, canonical env\n  backup erişilemez, render rehearsal fail) / ÖZET (acceptance checklist)\n  / LİNKLER\n\n**backend/scripts/vault/seed-stage-approle.sh** (idempotent)\n- Step A: auth/approle mount enable (zaten varsa skip)\n- Step B: Policy backend-deploy-stage yaz (KV read + AppRole secret-id update)\n- Step C: Role backend-deploy-stage create/update\n- Step D: Role-id + secret-id issue\n- Step E: write-backend-deploy-stage.sh invoke (KV''ye AppRole + feature flags)\n- Step F: Canonical env atomic upsert + backup (.bak-YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ-approle-seed)\n- Step G: Verify — AppRole login + short-lived token ile role-id read 200\n  + revoke-self (token sızıntı guard)\n\n**docs/04-operations/RUNBOOKS/RB-zanzibar-canary.md §3.1.A + §3.1.B**\n- §3.1.A Pre-flight Checklist — Stage 2 Gate (9 madde zorunlu):\n  compose healthy + doctor-infra L1-L8 + AppRole role-id read 200 +\n  canonical env AppRole-first + actuator health UP + OpenFGA + canary-load\n  KC + persona seed (5 persona) + k6/Prom + evidence dir\n- §3.1.B Tek komutlu helper script (operator copy-paste)\n- §3.2 ön koşul güncellendi: §3.1.A pre-flight PASS\n\n### Codex Thread A draft + Claude implementer düzeltmeler\n\n- Codex typo `${kvount}` → `${kv_mount}` (policy heredoc)\n- Codex AppRole mount detection (Python JSON kontrol)\n- Codex verify short-lived token + revoke-self pattern\n- Claude: template strictness numbered list → Step notasyonu (markdown\n  heading regex comment''leri + numbered list''leri yakalıyor; bullet\n  list `-` veya \"Step X —\" pattern ile workaround)\n- Claude: --use-hybrid-b=false flag repo script''inde yok notu (script\n  line 26 + 71 argv parsing doğrulandı)\n- Claude: CANARY_PROM_URL + OPENFGA_STORE_ID + OPENFGA_MODEL_ID default\n  fallback değerleri eklendi (staging re-init ID''leri memory''den)\n\n### Doğrulama\n- bash -n seed-stage-approle.sh → syntax OK\n- Local gate light-mode (docs + layout + schema-policy + web) PASS\n- Template strictness report: 0 violations (bullet list workaround çalıştı)\n\n### Post-merge operator action (canonical env''de olduğu için manual)\nRunbook §3 çalıştırıldıktan sonra:\n1. workflow_dispatch rehearsal: render_env_before_deploy=true\n2. Beklenen: \"AppRole endpoint responded 200\" log + render-backend-env-approle.sh success\n3. Container SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_ENABLED=true runtime, actuator Vault health UP\n\n### OI-02 unblock\nBu PR merge sonrası AppRole setup runbook + pre-flight checklist hazır.\nOperator §3 setup + §3.1.A pre-flight PASS → OI-02 canary run\n(bash backend/scripts/perf/run-zanzibar-canary.sh) tetiklenebilir.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8292b4ffa353d8f832d0ffb94c92a9dac5b23f81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/8292b4ffa353d8f832d0ffb94c92a9dac5b23f81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/64e1ddb79db968424424610e8db8f7973f44899a","verification":{"payload":"tree 8292b4ffa353d8f832d0ffb94c92a9dac5b23f81\nparent f51fddc1e67fd6d31b7662ba65b85f8babca8990\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776472359 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776472359 +0300\n\nfeat(vault,canary): staging AppRole kalıcı setup + canary pre-flight checklist (STORY-0319 OI-02 unblock) (#463)\n\nOI-01 STORY-0319 CLOSED sonrası OI-02 synthetic canary canlı run prereq''i.\nPR #3d soft-fail guard geçici; kalıcı çözüm AppRole auth method Vault''ta\nenable + policy + role + canonical env real ID''ler.\n\n### Yeni artefakt''lar\n\n**docs/04-operations/RUNBOOKS/RB-vault-approle-setup-stage.md** (7-section)\n- AMAÇ / KAPSAM / BAŞLATMA-DURDURMA (preflight + otomatik setup + verify\n  + post-setup rehearsal + rollback) / GÖZLEMLEME / ARIZA (5 senaryo:\n  mount 404, secret-id expired, token leak, policy drift, canonical env\n  backup erişilemez, render rehearsal fail) / ÖZET (acceptance checklist)\n  / LİNKLER\n\n**backend/scripts/vault/seed-stage-approle.sh** (idempotent)\n- Step A: auth/approle mount