fc97a7870827f9ee"}],"sha":"f51fddc1e67fd6d31b7662ba65b85f8babca8990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/f51fddc1e67fd6d31b7662ba65b85f8babca8990"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/8b5f8e3b695c75081c4fd0c6fc97a7870827f9ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T23:41:04Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T23:41:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deploy): post-deploy doctor-infra guard + nginx DEPLOY_ENV-aware symmetry (STORY-0319 PR #4/6) (#461)\n\nUzun vadeli kalıcı çözüm iskeletinin son PR''ı — OI-01 STORY-0319 closure.\n\n### .github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\n- **Post-deploy doctor-infra guard** step `deploy-stage-host` job''ının son\n  step''i olarak eklendi (Collect diagnostics''ten önce):\n  ```yaml\n  - name: Post-deploy doctor-infra guard\n    if: ${{ env.DEPLOY_ENABLED == ''true'' }}\n    shell: bash\n    run: bash backend/scripts/doctor-infra.sh\n  ```\n  Full A-L check (L-only mod yok). FAIL path''leri (L1 profile local,\n  L2 authz unauth 200, L3-L8 env drift) step RED → deploy RED.\n  WARN path''leri (container missing, 000/unexpected HTTP) step GREEN —\n  \"deterministic drift sensor\", fail-closed ideal değil.\n\n### .github/workflows/deploy-web.yml\n- **Stage self-hosted path** (`deploy-stage-web`): hardcoded\n  `STAGE_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=\"http://127.0.0.1:8080\"` +\n  `STAGE_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM=\"http://127.0.0.1:8081\"` override **kaldırıldı**.\n  `DEPLOY_ENV=\"stage\"` + `NGINX_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM=\"${WEB_GATEWAY_UPSTREAM:-}\"`\n  + `NGINX_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM=\"${WEB_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM:-}\"` — tek kaynak\n  `run-frontend-nginx-container.sh` case/esac DEPLOY_ENV fallback.\n\n- **Prod SSH path** (`Deploy web (Ubuntu Nginx via SSH)`):\n  - Job env''e `WEB_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM: ${{ vars.WEB_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM }}`\n    eklendi (Codex turn N bulgu: önceden ssh command''e geçiyordu ama\n    job env''de yoktu → her zaman boş → script fallback).\n  - SSH command `DEPLOY_ENV=\"prod\"` + 7 `NGINX_*` + 2 `WEB_*_UPSTREAM`\n    explicit forwarding.\n  - Heredoc içinde `NGINX_*` + `DEPLOY_ENV` remote shell''de tanımlı\n    (quoted heredoc interpolation sorunu çözüldü).\n\nStage ve prod artık simetrik: tek kaynak script case/esac + explicit\nvars override. Workflow''da hardcoded override yok.\n\n### docs/04-operations/RUNBOOKS/RB-staging-prod-profile.md\n- Status: `Draft` → `Rehearsed` (PR #3f deploy 24590348212 canlı kanıt\n  referansı: profile=prod,docker runtime, GHCR digest aktif, 8 container\n  healthy, /authz/me superAdmin=True authzVersion=8; AppRole setup\n  pending operational).\n\n### Codex review (thread 019d9c7b)\n- PR #4 Turn 1 BLOCK (nginx asimetri + doctor step naming + runbook status)\n  → turn 2 BLOCK (WEB_KEYCLOAK_UPSTREAM env eksik)\n  → turn 3 APPROVE.\n\n### Doğrulama\n- `python3 yaml.safe_load` backend + web workflow → OK\n- Local gate light-mode (docs + layout + schema-policy + web) PASS\n- Stage self-hosted path test staging rehearsal''da (post-merge deploy)\n- Prod SSH path syntax + pattern doğru; prod env runtime test için\n  ilk uygun pencerede disposable target''ta workflow_dispatch rehearsal\n  (Codex operasyonel not).\n\n### STORY-0319 closure\n- OI-01 (4-PR iskeleti) COMPLETE: PR #1 docs + PR #2 render + PR #3a/b/c/d/e/f\n  + PR #4. Staging prod-like runtime: profile=prod,docker, GHCR digest,\n  post-deploy doctor guard, nginx DEPLOY_ENV-aware symmetry.\n- Dalga 1 Stage 2 canlı run (OI-02) şimdi açıldı — operatör manuel\n  `bash backend/scripts/perf/run-zanzibar-canary.sh` rehearsal yapabilir.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65ed3bb56b958be1e494e0ae706c90b97624c51a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/65ed3bb56b958be1e494e0ae706c90b97624c51a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/8b5f8e3b695c75081c4fd0c6fc97a7870827f9ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 65ed3bb56b958be1e494e0ae706c90b97624c51a\nparent b8e189e4b2e1445d76596fa8efe11a6460daeebd\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776469264 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776469264 +0300\n\nfeat(deploy): post-deploy doctor-infra guard + nginx DEPLOY_ENV-aware symmetry (STORY-0319 PR #4/6) (#461)\n\nUzun vadeli kalıcı çözüm iskeletinin son PR''ı — OI-01 STORY-0319 closure.\n\n### .github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\n- **Post-deploy doctor-infra guard** step `deploy-stage-host` job''ının son\n  step''i olarak eklendi (Collect diagnostics''ten önce):\n  ```yaml\n  - name: Post-deploy doctor-infra guard\n    if: ${{ env.DEPLOY_ENABLED == ''true'' }}\n    shell: bash\n    run: bash backend/scripts/doctor-infra.sh\n  ```\n  Full A-L check (L-only mod yok). FAIL path''leri (L1 profile local,\n  L2 authz unauth 200, L3-L8 env drift) step RED → deploy RED.\n  WARN path''leri (container missing, 000/unexpected HTTP) step GREEN —\n  \"deterministic drift sensor\", fail-closed ideal değil.\n\n### 