 render path''ine düşüyor\n(`render-backend-env-approle.sh`) → Vault''ta AppRole yok → exit 22.\n\nParadoks: `VAULT_TOKEN` paylaşılmadıysa render path AppRole olur;\nAppRole Vault''ta yoksa render fail. Fix: AppRole setup tamamlanana\nkadar render default `false` (canonical env token path kullanılır).\n\n### Değişiklik (.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml)\n- `workflow_dispatch.inputs.render_env_before_deploy` default: `true` → `false`\n- Deploy step fallback: `render_env=\"${...:-true}\"` → `:-false}\"`\n- Build/pull default''ları değişmedi (GHCR retag aktif kalıyor)\n\n### Deploy etkisi\n- Canonical env token path: `bootstrap_vault_credentials_from_env_file`\n  render=false iken canonical env''den fresh VAULT_TOKEN okur → deploy\n  script token path''te çalışır.\n- `maybe_render_env` return 0 (render_flag != true) → AppRole path\n  çalışmaz.\n- Container''lar canonical env''den `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod,docker`\n  + fresh Vault token alır (SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_ENABLED compose default\n  false → container-side Vault client inactive, host-side AppRole\n  render akışı zaten yok).\n\n### AppRole setup follow-up (unlock render flip)\n1. Staging Vault `auth enable approle` + role configure\n2. Canonical env''e real VAULT_ROLE_ID + VAULT_SECRET_ID yaz\n3. Workflow stage env VAULT_TOKEN policy (approle secret-id update)\n4. Bu PR''daki default''u `false` → `true` flip et\n5. Soft-fail guard 200 path''ine girer → rotation otomatik\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b08f54275133126b2d42eecbc09bb280568fe0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/b08f54275133126b2d42eecbc09bb280568fe0c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/4268dfb0dcef25ae83e2ceeca1511698f9c88252","verification":{"payload":"tree b08f54275133126b2d42eecbc09bb280568fe0c8\nparent 1b48e550467813f1d6e4f5fc7b8621f0d2ff27cd\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776466053 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776466053 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): rollback render_env_before_deploy default to false (STORY-0319 PR #3e/6) (#459)\n\nPR #3d deploy \"AppRole endpoint 403; skipping rotation\" ✓ ama sonraki\n`maybe_render_env` çağrısı fail: `RENDER_ENV_BEFORE_DEPLOY=true` +\n`VAULT_TOKEN` workflow''da paylaşılmıyor (AppRole precedence koruması)\n→ deploy script AppRole render path''ine düşüyor\n(`render-backend-env-approle.sh`) → Vault''ta AppRole yok → exit 22.\n\nParadoks: `VAULT_TOKEN` paylaşılmadıysa render path AppRole olur;\nAppRole Vault''ta yoksa render fail. Fix: AppRole setup tamamlanana\nkadar render default `false` (canonical env token path kullanılır).\n\n### Değişiklik (.github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml)\n- `workflow_dispatch.inputs.render_env_before_deploy` default: `true` → `false`\n- Deploy step fallback: `render_env=\"${...:-true}\"` → `:-false}\"`\n- Build/pull default''ları değişmedi (GHCR retag aktif kalıyor)\n\n### Deploy etkisi\n- Canonical env token path: `bootstrap_vault_credentials_from_env_file`\n  render=false iken canonical env''den fresh VAULT_TOKEN okur → deploy\n  script token path''te çalışır.\n- `maybe_render_env` return 0 (render_flag != true) → AppRole path\n  çalışmaz.\n- Container''lar canonical env''den `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod,docker`\n  + fresh Vault token alır (SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_ENABLED compose default\n  false → container-side Vault client inactive, host-side AppRole\n  render akışı zaten yok).\n\n### AppRole setup follow-up (unlock render flip)\n1. Staging Vault `auth enable approle` + role configure\n2. Canonical env''e real VAULT_ROLE_ID + VAULT_SECRET_ID yaz\n3. Workflow stage env VAULT_TOKEN policy (approle secret-id update)\n4. Bu PR''daki default''u `false` → `true` flip et\n5. Soft-fail guard 200 path''ine girer → rotation otomatik\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4riFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwOkQA