'a karşılık gelmiyor). `materialize-backend-\ndeploy-approle.sh` `auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage/role-id`\nendpoint''ine istek atıyor → 404/403 → step exit 22 → deploy bloke.\n\nFix: `Refresh stage backend AppRole materials` step''ine preflight probe:\n- 200 → AppRole configured, normal rotation\n- 403/404 → notice + exit 0, deploy token-path ile devam eder\n  (canonical env''deki token container''lara iner, Spring Cloud Vault\n  TOKEN auth method ile login olur)\n- Diğer (ağ/Vault unreachable) → fail-close (exit 1)\n\n### Diagnostic (ssh staging-sw üzerinden 2026-04-17)\n- Vault `auth/approle/role?list=true` → `no handler for route`\n- `sys/auth` → sadece `token/` mount\n- `sys/mounts` → sadece `secret/` KV\n- Canonical env `VAULT_AUTH_METHOD=APPROLE` + sahte ROLE_ID/SECRET_ID\n- Fresh root token `/home/halil/platform/state/vault-dev/vault-root-token`\n  geçerli (root policy, TTL=0)\n\n### Operasyonel aksiyonlar (bu commit dışı, kullanıcı explicit onay ile yaptı)\n- `/home/halil/platform/env/backend.env` VAULT_TOKEN fresh root token ile\n  rotate edildi (backup: `.bak-pre-token-rotation-20260417T222148Z`).\n- GitHub stage environment `VAULT_TOKEN` secret fresh token ile update\n  edildi (2026-04-17 22:23:38Z, stdin via `gh secret set --body -`).\n\n### AppRole kalıcı setup (PR #3e veya ops follow-up)\nStaging Vault''ta:\n1. `vault auth enable approle`\n2. `vault write auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage policies=... secret_id_ttl=...`\n3. `vault read auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage/role-id` →\n   canonical env''e yaz\n4. `vault write -f auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage/secret-id` →\n   canonical env''e yaz\n5. Policy: `secret/stage/backend-deploy/config` read + secret/stage/db/*\n   read + auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage/secret-id update\n6. Bu PR''daki soft-fail guard 200 path''ine girer → rotation otomatikleşir\n\n### Doğrulama\n- `python3 yaml.safe_load` workflow → jobs: deploy-backend + deploy-stage-host ✓\n- Bash shell syntax: case/esac + exit code path''leri kapalı.\n- Local gate light-mode (docs + layout + schema-policy + web) PASS\n  (backend-gate pre-existing JaCoCo env — PR ile alakasız).\n\n### Post-merge staging deploy rehearsal (manuel + izleme)\n1. `gh workflow run deploy-backend.yml -f env=stage`\n2. Beklenen log: \"AppRole endpoint responded 404 (role not configured...);\n   skipping rotation. Canonical env token path active.\"\n3. Render step canonical env token ile çalışır, SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE\n   canonical env''den prod,docker iner.\n4. GHCR retag + compose up + actuator health check.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffd37cd18833d85dbc1e8433a87062c53903ffc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/ffd37cd18833d85dbc1e8433a87062c53903ffc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/1b48e550467813f1d6e4f5fc7b8621f0d2ff27cd","verification":{"payload":"tree ffd37cd18833d85dbc1e8433a87062c53903ffc1\nparent 16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776465317 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776465317 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): AppRole refresh step soft-fail on 403/404 — unblock stage deploy (STORY-0319 PR #3d/6) (#458)\n\nPR #3c staging deploy iki kez başarısız oldu. Root cause: **staging''de\nVault AppRole auth method enable edilmemiş** (sadece `token/` mount\nmevcut; canonical env''deki `VAULT_ROLE_ID`/`VAULT_SECRET_ID` stale UUID,\nhiçbir Vault configuration''a karşılık gelmiyor). `materialize-backend-\ndeploy-approle.sh` `auth/approle/role/backend-deploy-stage/role-id`\nendpoint''ine istek atıyor → 404/403 → step exit 22 → deploy bloke.\n\nFix: `Refresh stage backend AppRole materials` step''ine preflight probe:\n- 200 → AppRole configured, normal rotation\n- 403/404 → notice + exit 0, deploy token-path ile devam eder\n  (canonical env''deki token container''lara iner, Spring Cloud Vault\n  TOKEN auth method ile login o