NG_PROFILES_ACTIVE\n   canonical env''den prod,docker iner.\n4. GHCR retag + compose up + actuator health check.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4rWlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq80QAHzN7AquJ59SV2z4s+oUhTt0\npPkeLgGlv58UPjcDfiFgp5qN4b9MgOUmcgdSmQDHRZdmki6kUUUDUEgheFud/pP9\nxD5MtnO2/aVeClUCuZvfxFzAOH9f56NLk68zLtlzcKFGhumWbGgDfcbZk+77n9C7\nsuvGlMsGpzosYXQHWCKNbbzvqJMpzuWv9qOlad9bOLAOkHBEjhEJzTDjZdES6PaF\ny/smceUvVfn6l7189VmEXzTTG+uUWr7+DV30AWrOdxQAbRa8cA5DYfagWlw8ET1E\nY5snhFKcknMLYElydCwqYppK7DEYKrH60fIisR1/psOsRUoufzm7ueeMj5tV6/jd\nodibwbvJV8ahgEYB1rEJ8uxU6a4lTjd5gGnNG/t74u7wGs5MoGE8gaFykyrLZomq\nwzQTKpO397meuqoZ0XwziAM/bUjJXpgQ2lt5j4GAL8FSk9rhVoZs/dqdnSTSqzCW\ngGYzVh5fKL501optI+DRfFODZai2fdjTJTskMMQ2pu5YSzEfPbp0132ilfHR7kln\n7pX41kM2DiLawuHgtVzDwdHUuRfL7cIBMwk04mfAi4k8nUSFuut7LiLc2mevdm7a\nbG9UqPBH+bSoc6DmNaG8GsYYbRGw5vChHEv5/pMm05OO9uqDEtWmf5MB1xGZwF+E\nH9Da7rAoJpknwL+sjt9M\n=om6U\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-17T22:35:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/1b48e550467813f1d6e4f5fc7b8621f0d2ff27cd","node_id":"C_kwDOQooUwNoAKDFiNDhlNTUwNDY3ODEzZjFkNmU0ZjVmYzdiODYyMWYwZDJmZjI3Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commit/16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c","sha":"16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c"}],"sha":"1b48e550467813f1d6e4f5fc7b8621f0d2ff27cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/1b48e550467813f1d6e4f5fc7b8621f0d2ff27cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/commits/16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T20:20:45Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"Halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T20:20:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deploy,vault): GHCR retag + AppRole-first migration + workflow default flip (STORY-0319 PR #3c/6) (#457)\n\nUzun vadeli kalıcı çözüm iskeletinin runtime flip PR''ı. Staging deploy\nartık GHCR digest''leri + AppRole-first Vault auth ile çalışır.\n\n### deploy/ubuntu/deploy-backend.sh\n- **GHCR retag strict (fail-close):** `compose_run pull` kaldırıldı;\n  doğrudan `docker pull ghcr.io/{owner}/platform-ssot-{svc}:{IMAGE_TAG}` +\n  `docker tag → platform-{svc}:latest`. Eksik image → exit 1 (stale image\n  fallback yok). `IMAGE_TAG:?` strict — `main-stable` sessiz fallback yok.\n  Codex turn N bulgu: compose `build:` tabanlı olduğu için `compose pull`\n  yeterli değildi; `up -d` GHCR digest''leri kullanmıyordu.\n- **AppRole precedence guard:** `bootstrap_vault_credentials_from_env_file`\n  artık `RENDER_ENV_BEFORE_DEPLOY=true` iken env-file''dan VAULT_TOKEN\n  bootstrap etmez (token path by-pass fiilen kapandı). Render script\n  AppRole material (VAULT_ROLE_ID + VAULT_SECRET_ID) ile kalır.\n\n### deploy/ubuntu/render-backend-env.sh\n- `required_keys[]`: `VAULT_TOKEN` kaldırıldı; 9 AppRole-first key zorunlu:\n  `VAULT_ROLE_ID`, `VAULT_SECRET_ID`, `VAULT_AUTH_METHOD`,\n  `VAULT_SECRET_PREFIX`, `VAULT_FAIL_FAST`, `SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_ENABLED`,\n  `SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_KV_ENABLED`, `SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_FAIL_FAST` +\n  eski `VAULT_URI`. Vault config eksikse render graceful-degradation ile\n  önceki env''i korur + check FAIL deploy''u durdurur.\n- `ordered_keys[]`: `VAULT_TOKEN` kaldırıldı; 8 yeni AppRole/flag key eklendi.\n\n### backend/scripts/vault/write-backend-deploy-stage.sh\n- `VAULT_TOKEN` write satırı kaldırıldı (token path by-pass önlendi).\n- 7 yeni key payload''a eklendi: AppRole material + feature flag''ler\n  (tümü default `true` / `APPROLE`). Codex turn N bulgu #4: fail-fast\n  zinciri `SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_FAIL_FAST` + `VAULT_FAIL_FAST` birlikte\n  taşınıyor (override riski yok).\n\n### backend/scripts/vault/check-backend-deploy-stage.sh\n- `config_required[]` listesi AppRole-first model: 9 key zorunlu (aynı\n  render_keys ile senkron). Vault KV''de eksik anahtar → CI check FAIL.\n\n### .github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\n- workflow_dispatch inputs default flip:\n  - `render_env_before_deploy: false → true`\n  - `build_local: true → false`\n  - `docker_pull_policy: never → always`\n- Deploy step shell fallback aynı flip; push event''te default path\n  canonical env render (AppRole) + GHCR retag + compose up build by-pass.\n- Emergency rollback: `gh workflow run ... -f build_local=true\n  -f docker_pull_policy=never -f render_env_before_deploy=false`.\n\n### docs/04-operations/RUNBOOKS/RB-staging-prod-profile.md\n- §2 dosya referansları workflow inputs güncel.\n- §3.3 + §3.4 FUTURE STATE banner''ları kaldırıldı; executable akışlar.\n- §4.2 + §4.3 rollback banner''ları executable (emergency override + Vault\n  AppRole rollback).\n- §5.2 + §5.3 gözlemleme banner''ları kaldırıldı; `docker image inspect`\n  GHCR digest doğrulama eklendi.\n- §5.2 \"Boot log Unable to connect to Vault\" ariza — AppRole material eksik\n  senaryosu explicit.\n- §6 acceptance checklist — host-local smoke dili (port binding 127.0.0.1\n  hardening ayrı follow-up).\n\n### Kapsam DIŞI (bilinçli, Codex turn N onaylı)\n- `backend/.env.prod.example` dokunulmadı — prod compose hâlâ\n  VAULT_TOKEN-merkezli x-vault-env; prod AppRole migration ayrı STORY.\n- `deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml` dokunulmadı (aynı gerekçe).\n- `write-backend-deploy-prod.sh` stage wrapper''ını inherit eder ama prod\n  truth değişmeden.\n- Port binding `127.0.0.1:8088/8090` hardening — ayrı follow-up (lokal\n  dev workflow etkisi).\n- Runbook Status `Draft` kaldı — Rehearsed geçişi staging rehearsal PASS\n  kanıtı sonrası ayrı commit''te.\n\n### Doğrulama\n- `bash -n` tüm 4 script → syntax OK.\n- `python3 yaml.safe_load` workflow → OK.\n- Local gate light-mode (docs + layout + schema-policy + web + secrets) PASS.\n- Codex review (thread 019d9c7b) turn 5 BLOCK → turn 6 APPROVE.\n\n### Post-merge staging rehearsal matrisi (operatör)\n1. `gh workflow run deploy-backend.yml -f env=stage`\n2. Deploy log: `docker pull ghcr.io/...` + retag satırları\n3. SSH staging-sw:\n   - `docker image inspect platform-auth-service:latest --format ''{{json .RepoDigests}}''` → GHCR digest\n   - `docker exec platform-auth-service-1 printenv SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE` → `prod,docker`\n   - `docker exec platform-auth-service-1 printenv VAULT_AUTH_METHOD` → `APPROLE`\n   - `docker exec platform-auth-service-1 printenv SPRING_CLOUD_VAULT_ENABLED` → `true`\n   - `curl -fsS http://localhost:8088/actuator/health/vault | jq .status` → `\"UP\"`\n   - `curl -fsS http://localhost:8090/actuator/health/vault | jq .status` → `\"UP\"`\n4. `bash backend/scripts/doctor-infra.sh` → L1-L8 PASS\n5. `RB-staging-prod-profile.md` Status `Draft` → `Rehearsed` ayrı commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df332fe097a77a8dd2337f6ce5bcb9e5dfc64a88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/trees/df332fe097a77a8dd2337f6ce5bcb9e5dfc64a88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-ssot/git/commits/16b4b65ba50460ab8e2122a44f551ee6a7c4d14c","verification":{"payload":"tree df332fe097a77a8dd2337f6ce5bcb9e5dfc64a88\nparent 4195b362bdd49b99f54bbb8c7e2ff5bac28037e7\nauthor Halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1776457245 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776457245 +0300\n\nfeat(deploy,vault): GHCR retag + AppRole-first migration + workflow default flip (STORY-0319 PR #3c/6) (#457)\n\nUzun vadeli kalıcı çözüm iskeletinin runtime flip PR''ı. Staging deploy\nartık GHCR digest''leri + AppRole-first Vault auth ile çalışır.\n\n### deploy/ubuntu/deploy-backend.sh\n- **GHCR retag strict (fail-close):** `compose_run pull` kaldırıldı;\n  doğrudan `docker pull ghcr.io/{owner}/platform-ssot-{svc}:{IMAGE_TAG}` +\n  `docker tag → platform-{svc}:latest`. Eksik image → exit 1 (stale image\n  fallback yok). `IMAGE_TAG:?` strict — `main-stable` sessiz fallback yok.\n  Codex turn N bulgu: compo