hub.com/users/Faraz32123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/commits/0481d9a0b11905398eb6aee098e7e649c8af3a03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T16:17:48Z","email":"faraz.maqsood@arbisoft.com","name":"Muhammad Faraz Maqsood"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T16:17:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: accessibility issue on video transcripts (#37587)\n\nThis commit fixes accessibility issue for video transcripts as when a\nvideo component''s SRT file has an empty line, the transcript has an\nempty link that is still interactive.\n\nEmpty links should not be interactive and should be hidden from\nkeyboard users as it takes extra click for them when an empty line\noccurs in the transcript.\n\nCo-authored-by: Muhammad Faraz  Maqsood <faraz.maqsood@A006-01130.local>","tree":{"sha":"a2bd7643ce63bd448ff775692697cbfbe66c0eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/trees/a2bd7643ce63bd448ff775692697cbfbe66c0eeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/commits/0481d9a0b11905398eb6aee098e7e649c8af3a03","verification":{"payload":"tree a2bd7643ce63bd448ff775692697cbfbe66c0eeb\nparent 56f7da908aff42f5f426160a49c6171a27a433a3\nauthor Muhammad Faraz Maqsood <faraz.maqsood@arbisoft.com> 1764173868 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764173868 -0500\n\nfix: accessibility issue on video transcripts (#37587)\n\nThis commit fixes accessibility issue for video transcripts as when a\nvideo component''s SRT file has an empty line, the transcript has an\nempty link that is still interactive.\n\nEmpty links should not be interactive and should be hidden from\nkeyboard users as it takes extra click for them when an empty line\noccurs in the transcript.\n\nCo-authored-by: Muhammad Faraz  Maqsood <faraz.maqsood@A006-01130.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpJygsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA