 couldn''t see newly created threads.\n\n- Added send_signal_after_commit() helper function\n- Updated both thread creation paths to use the helper\n\nCo-authored-by: Taimoor  Ahmed <taimoor.ahmed@A006-01711.local>","tree":{"sha":"628e45ad2bba9215c47b0319b3b26c7fc4dbd3c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/trees/628e45ad2bba9215c47b0319b3b26c7fc4dbd3c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/commits/56f7da908aff42f5f426160a49c6171a27a433a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 628e45ad2bba9215c47b0319b3b26c7fc4dbd3c0\nparent 8ad4d42e3b00786a11fc6ec936b191254fde41cc\nauthor Taimoor Ahmed <68893403+taimoor-ahmed-1@users.noreply.github.com> 1764139425 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764139425 +0500\n\nfix: send thread_created signal after transaction commit (#37675)\n\nPrevents notification failures with MySQL backend by ensuring signals\nare only sent after database transactions commit. This fixes race\nconditions where Celery workers couldn''t see newly created threads.\n\n- Added send_signal_after_commit() helper function\n- Updated both thread creation paths to use the helper\n\nCo-authored-by: Taimoor  Ahmed <taimoor.ahmed@A006-01711.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpJqGhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP5kQAF83ZFzXOsh2mkK+N89yIJp2\nyyNWux+Uc3bxk+H57242bEe1qylhvXfDiY8eqw4U8JVUe71uP99efnxITskbNGiG\nunqUP9245JG/ZV2CAlyUraFOWdhf82AelB7342Z5eQeI0m3H5FqeG7tkFmiE88HR\n19id/DJ+j736xOjze1OP5PUeWPBMyv5B2OwbvL0NnrorqlHIVLcYIILlbD4hFgwV\nr3nmr6PYlNzW8snYnBu75Ln3pD/UZ0Ni5PYYEuBiR4PnMiNbGqIXX7Ik8ftzGY2n\nRtRLb9xU3a6X+T+k2nAeZLZbzON2IYt17ImnQZ/c6o/KomxdVJ+VnksS12p0RnVS\nsMOdgWs5Ytl4r/jgQmafr72O3xICTjgjgS/UhL12eGKTahJw3rBPxY/MaFN054T3\njGTrep6Vv5eG2LGpHaaFlfNnVKfVPF6CBj0Fvjh7WRqVNSIyUkRIgMWBU9uOeZef\nrXlTxU0crj7uXP7XuQ9v1ooaCH8OIRhOWLkFUuwwdQ1eIj694/dakpELZC0MrrHa\nUoSVWNv4kbrXB75o/F5uVFg9UFSaVhIfRjlubwiWudrIIxsS53qxdjgFvlv3qldW\nm5coGb9Vvn4xzMU3pSJ0qomKZkmiiaixUdegZVXB74N5+hxNBkzKmI/zDOI