hub.com/users/mlabeeb03/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mlabeeb03","id":72980976,"login":"mlabeeb03","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyOTgwOTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlabeeb03","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/commits/8ad4d42e3b00786a11fc6ec936b191254fde41cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-25T14:37:32Z","email":"72980976+mlabeeb03@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Labeeb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-25T14:37:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat!: Remove proctortrack references; add requires_escalation_email and show_review_rules options (#37576)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All references to the hardcoded ''proctortrack'' string have\nbeen removed from the codebase,  as well as the `studio.show_review_rules`\nwaffle flag. These were used to determine whether an escalation email is\nrequired and whether review rules should be shown. These decisions are now made\nbased on the value of ''requires_escalation_email'' (default False) and ''show_review_rules''\n(default True) config items in the PROCTORING_BACKENDS entry.\n\nAdditionally:\n* The proctoring info api will now return the list of providers which require an escalation\n   email so that frontend-app-learning does not need to use a hardcoded check agaist\n   the provider name ''proctortrack''.\n* Removed translation commands, mock variables and user facing strings that contained\n  ''proctortrack''.\n* Updated all test cases that were using proctortrack to use fake providers names.\n\nPart of: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36329","tree":{"sha":"3380a006958c4045acfa1a16181a1f44e7e22a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/trees/3380a006958c4045acfa1a16181a1f44e7e22a32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/commits/8ad4d42e3b00786a11fc6ec936b191254fde41cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 3380a006958c4045acfa1a16181a1f44e7e22a32\nparent 7671c0857389771c3eed158ab4275b247c6db2fa\nauthor Muhammad Labeeb <72980976+mlabeeb03@users.noreply.github.com> 1764081452 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764081452 -0500\n\nfeat!: Remove proctortrack references; add requires_escalation_email and show_review_rules options (#37576)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: All references to the hardcoded ''proctortrack'' string have\nbeen removed from the codebase,  as well as the `studio.show_review_rules`\nwaffle flag. These were used to determine whether an escalation email is\nrequired and whether review rules should be shown. These decisions are now made\nbased on the value of ''requires_escalation_email'' (default False) and ''show_review_rules''\n(default True) config items in the PROCTORING_BACKENDS entry.\n\nAdditionally:\n* The proctoring info api will now return the list of providers which require an escalation\n   email so that frontend-app-learning does not need to use a hardcoded check agaist\n   the provider name ''proctortrack''.\n* Removed translation commands, mock variables and user facing strings that contained\n  ''proctortrack''.\n* Updated all test cases that were using proctortrack to use fake providers names.\n\nPart of: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36329","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpJb8tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAH0YQAGbClCT0G8FpFgFYpev7nQ3y\nJG5diNcl4MlyUAhQJJspNUcjVwyRQ8PrJzZHtGaBCQ/bclWWjWUnq/Kz6tX//C4g\nSHJbmyDbwebVl7lMRdaATWBYQpPxQIJgQjYi5k7so59DQKOVfVOK4jYIlyCHFv48\nJeB2iQE+B+NCy47SAqsXQvxHM1y2OrRXJ5VcBNRuicqLFPvz