itsevIvan","id":81557788,"login":"NiedielnitsevIvan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTU3Nzg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NiedielnitsevIvan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/commits/5df4564173d9c36093123d3cbbf7af92ef3617aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-19T20:24:24Z","email":"81557788+NiedielnitsevIvan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ivan Niedielnitsev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-19T20:24:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: use correct full name when emitting COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED\n\nThis commit fixes the incorrect saving of the user''s full name in the\ncredentials service by modifying how the COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED\nand CCX_COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED events are emitted.\n\nPreviously, we had been using Django''s standard User.get_full_name()\nto fetch the user''s full name. However, Open edX uses the convention of\nstoring the full name in user.profile.name and leaves the User''s first\nand last name fields blank. (This is to better accommodate the wide\nrange of international conventions regarding names.)","tree":{"sha":"4f83505a8935bc0b5d6dc3820d4ec0e6e962f21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/trees/4f83505a8935bc0b5d6dc3820d4ec0e6e962f21b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m3hrab/edx-platform/git/commits/5df4564173d9c36093123d3cbbf7af92ef3617aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f83505a8935bc0b5d6dc3820d4ec0e6e962f21b\nparent f175bea4db19ad6c77bebc67ea5c1847fbbebc61\nauthor Ivan Niedielnitsev <81557788+NiedielnitsevIvan@users.noreply.github.com> 1763583864 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763583864 -0500\n\nfix: use correct full name when emitting COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED\n\nThis commit fixes the incorrect saving of the user''s full name in the\ncredentials service by modifying how the COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED\nand CCX_COURSE_PASSING_STATUS_UPDATED events are emitted.\n\nPreviously, we had been using Django''s standard User.get_full_name()\nto fetch the user''s full name. However, Open edX uses the convention of\nstoring the full name in user.profile.name and leaves the User''s first\nand last name fields blank. (This is to better accommodate the wide\nrange of international conventions regarding names.)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpHid4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8dAQAEnz8LfEnFemtR4v0om09h03\nEF5mnZg1yxU9zM2o5Do2kCzDuxsoCNQDTxWloho1LkhJGmEiTzI+KA3OJDkJnhfl\nPGlodTVIlpMGOgfVNrE+9RGoOfyXOhJSTqvsFQmuzaFKclgcPZkgJuYl8bHuxFHS\nji5S3DhlrP8bpgxplNmx7N1TwmsQLhnfGgMb8H5yxokbPVM3G47RYWi5vRiGGWb/\nW3JFTHIGQpmZoHk30iPLM6TRibQY2j0bDZFOzZSDctPeXGl6SHXixVWA8BMCPO5X\nbMdwtTPtJfH8mdEMQgsBq3m6RPNdcTqs2U+W5aspQQ1b24hqFAO7W6lGD8HEWvIs\nk11psWGFTKfaYmF7g5Rg4QSYDacK1+vnJrLEqU2KvR/F9o2s7YqduvarM3VZpZBW\nR34e5ss8coYVIF65vwQDQ9StwHsJBZezrz4k7Pb1DUil21Ekjh+nQKVYlCgwN00D\ncvMzjVeCXt9LpVqazB0a1ORHNFftEPuy6OTNik09qCCDv8asjzI4OUhX2sJ50h+v\nn3rBYDoayBUMTksKF+qs8HiDMPiZFr+YjduosHfbQXcZd6BKjdYKEkeOQKVeQTBT\nBaqvo07z0FJzLY+aBgE83nqwprohoDWtltmzJlAqiKLqm8YRvVigBJ1dgfN16sVJ\nAly2eFaR5MF4txHd1fp1\n=+2wv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-19T20:24:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api